(1681422, 227451, 35545, '<td valign="top">This was too tall to fit on my monitor.  I had to scroll to see the whole picture.  This is a good subject for montone, but I would have tweaked the brightness and contrast to bring out more texture in the rocks.  Also, the trees in the background tend to fade out.  Maybe they should have been cropped out, but that''s just me.</td>', 'This was too tall to fit on my monitor.  I had to scroll to see the whole picture.  This is a good subject for montone, but I would have tweaked the brightness and contrast to bring out more texture in the rocks.  Also, the trees in the background tend to fade out.  Maybe they should have been cropped out, but that''s just me.', '2005-09-07 03:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
