(1681824, 228044, 42837, '<td valign="top">A charming picture, with a wealth of details in the back to inform the viewer about the era depicted. I like the determined  expression on the face too. Not sure i''m too keen on the legs cropped away though, since it loses the possiblilty to capture more details that add to the haste of the despatch rider..</td>', 'A charming picture, with a wealth of details in the back to inform the viewer about the era depicted. I like the determined  expression on the face too. Not sure i''m too keen on the legs cropped away though, since it loses the possiblilty to capture more details that add to the haste of the despatch rider..', '2005-09-07 08:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1681827, 227579, 42837, '<td valign="top">The focus has moved from the branch (which needs a more careful focal range) to the water falling (which would still be obvious without sharp focus, especially the way you have captured the light so well)</td>', 'The focus has moved from the branch (which needs a more careful focal range) to the water falling (which would still be obvious without sharp focus, especially the way you have captured the light so well)', '2005-09-07 08:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
