(1681832, 226540, 42837, '<td valign="top">It would be ironic if the logo on that shirt was from a playstation game. The composition would be vastly improved if the two boys were fully in shot and the interaction between them and the branches was the entire subject. Some canopy in the top of the frame (think rule of thirds) would work, but there''s far too much at the moment.</td>', 'It would be ironic if the logo on that shirt was from a playstation game. The composition would be vastly improved if the two boys were fully in shot and the interaction between them and the branches was the entire subject. Some canopy in the top of the frame (think rule of thirds) would work, but there''s far too much at the moment.', '2005-09-07 08:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1681833, 225587, 27991, '<td valign="top">beautiful baby... i did my son and called it the same thing... a branch of me lol 8</td>', 'beautiful baby... i did my son and called it the same thing... a branch of me lol 8', '2005-09-07 08:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
