(1682023, 226467, 35602, '<td valign="top">Flares can be used creatively to enhance and frame subjects.  I like the flares around the tree branch, but as they get closer to the foreground they start to distract my eye.  Since I am not sure how you could have angled the camera to get rid of some of the flares, I have no advice.  It is definitely a shot worth doing over and over to perfect just the right amount of flare for the subject.</td>', 'Flares can be used creatively to enhance and frame subjects.  I like the flares around the tree branch, but as they get closer to the foreground they start to distract my eye.  Since I am not sure how you could have angled the camera to get rid of some of the flares, I have no advice.  It is definitely a shot worth doing over and over to perfect just the right amount of flare for the subject.', '2005-09-07 09:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
