(1682295, 225411, 24073, '<td valign="top">A fantastic shot, I don''t want to take that from you.  I may even consider buying a print if it was available, and I could secure the funds.  OK, now having said that, it does not seem to branch to me.  I read the title and I understand where your coming from, but to give this an incredible score I would be taking away from the people that busted their but to get a good "branch" photo.  Still in the better half of the challenge.  GL.</td>', 'A fantastic shot, I don''t want to take that from you.  I may even consider buying a print if it was available, and I could secure the funds.  OK, now having said that, it does not seem to branch to me.  I read the title and I understand where your coming from, but to give this an incredible score I would be taking away from the people that busted their but to get a good "branch" photo.  Still in the better half of the challenge.  GL.', '2005-09-07 11:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
