(1682410, 227684, 24073, '<td valign="top">Owe my, beautiful colors, and great portrait.  You have quite a bit of pixel explosion going on by my monitor, but I know from experience that happens with the re-sizing most of the time so Im not counting that against you.  GL, and by the way your model here is stunning.<br/>-I just went back to adjust my final scores, and this is my top rated photo aside one other, so GL.  I have looked at this photo over and over, and can''t put my finger on what it is you have nailed here that nobody else has.  The model is stunning, I love her playful expression.  The colors are dynamite, the lighting is awesome.  The clarity, and depth are good, but there is just something else that really sends it over the top for me.  Maybe its the non-border, and the portraiture part of it.  There wasn''t many portraits out there, so maybe thats what seperates it.  At any rate....Im a huge fan of whatever it is you have done.</td>', 'Owe my, beautiful colors, and great portrait.  You have quite a bit of pixel explosion going on by my monitor, but I know from experience that happens with the re-sizing most of the time so Im not counting that against you.  GL, and by the way your model here is stunning.-I just went back to adjust my final scores, and this is my top rated photo aside one other, so GL.  I have looked at this photo over and over, and can''t put my finger on what it is you have nailed here that nobody else has.  The model is stunning, I love her playful expression.  The colors are dynamite, the lighting is awesome.  The clarity, and depth are good, but there is just something else that really sends it over the top for me.  Maybe its the non-border, and the portraiture part of it.  There wasn''t many portraits out there, so maybe thats what seperates it.  At any rate....Im a huge fan of whatever it is you have done.', '2005-09-07 11:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
