(1682669, 227414, 117, '<td valign="top">Left part of the sky is light from the sun. Maybe cropping  that or the sky period for this but maybe in color balance go to the blue and cyan on the black bump up the colors of blue. You can also go to white and the cyan and maybe add more blue there. You can also make white blue with cyan and magenta.</td>', 'Left part of the sky is light from the sun. Maybe cropping  that or the sky period for this but maybe in color balance go to the blue and cyan on the black bump up the colors of blue. You can also go to white and the cyan and maybe add more blue there. You can also make white blue with cyan and magenta.', '2005-09-07 12:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682675, 226368, 41794, '<td valign="top">Cute idea!</td>', 'Cute idea!', '2005-09-07 12:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682680, 225836, 43031, '<td valign="top">I''ve worked on fiber optics before, so I know what this meant, but I''m not sure anyone else would without direct experience.</td>', 'I''ve worked on fiber optics before, so I know what this meant, but I''m not sure anyone else would without direct experience.', '2005-09-07 12:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682686, 225507, 43031, '<td valign="top">Why do people feel the need to pu an ! in titles? 6</td>', 'Why do people feel the need to pu an ! in titles? 6', '2005-09-07 13:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682689, 225842, 117, '<td valign="top">I know these groves are hard to shot in. I do like rays and these are some nice ones.</td>', 'I know these groves are hard to shot in. I do like rays and these are some nice ones.', '2005-09-07 13:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682690, 227165, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the title suits it perfectly!</td>', 'Very nice, the title suits it perfectly!', '2005-09-07 13:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682702, 228331, 117, '<td valign="top">You have a couple of dots in the sky probably you sensor or lens that needs cleaning. I know you can''t clone here.</td>', 'You have a couple of dots in the sky probably you sensor or lens that needs cleaning. I know you can''t clone here.', '2005-09-07 13:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682709, 228252, 41522, '<td valign="top">The bright areas in the background are really stealing attention away from the tree branch.</td>', 'The bright areas in the background are really stealing attention away from the tree branch.', '2005-09-07 13:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682712, 228009, 40977, '<td valign="top">Very Cool shot.  I love the color and the dark imagery of the tree limbs.  Great Job.</td>', 'Very Cool shot.  I love the color and the dark imagery of the tree limbs.  Great Job.', '2005-09-07 13:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682713, 227534, 41522, '<td valign="top">Interesting ... It feels to me that the sharpening was ovedone.  The end result, IMO, is just too harsh.</td>', 'Interesting ... It feels to me that the sharpening was ovedone.  The end result, IMO, is just too harsh.', '2005-09-07 13:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682714, 226651, 117, '<td valign="top">close cropped on the limbs at the top. You also need to level out the horizon.</td>', 'close cropped on the limbs at the top. You also need to level out the horizon.', '2005-09-07 13:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682717, 228291, 117, '<td valign="top">needs to be a little more focused.</td>', 'needs to be a little more focused.', '2005-09-07 13:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682718, 228143, 40977, '<td valign="top">Like the image, but not sure if this was the best angle.  Regardless a very nice shot.</td>', 'Like the image, but not sure if this was the best angle.  Regardless a very nice shot.', '2005-09-07 13:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682720, 227974, 41522, '<td valign="top">I feel that the lighting is working against you on this.  There are areas of the photo that looked washed out.</td>', 'I feel that the lighting is working against you on this.  There are areas of the photo that looked washed out.', '2005-09-07 13:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682724, 227326, 40977, '<td valign="top">If it wasn''t for the challenge and some images in the shot I''d swear this was from the 50s.  It works in B/W and regardless of all the images in the shot - it isn''t too busy.  Great Job.</td>', 'If it wasn''t for the challenge and some images in the shot I''d swear this was from the 50s.  It works in B/W and regardless of all the images in the shot - it isn''t too busy.  Great Job.', '2005-09-07 13:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682725, 225602, 40977, '<td valign="top">Very Cool</td>', 'Very Cool', '2005-09-07 13:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682728, 226538, 41522, '<td valign="top">My first reaction was the focus was a bit soft.  The lighting also looks a bit flat, IMHO.</td>', 'My first reaction was the focus was a bit soft.  The lighting also looks a bit flat, IMHO.', '2005-09-07 13:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682729, 228081, 40977, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it is the lightling or the focus that seems to be off. I love the image and regardless is a very good shot.</td>', 'I don''t know if it is the lightling or the focus that seems to be off. I love the image and regardless is a very good shot.', '2005-09-07 13:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682730, 228003, 12327, '<td valign="top">I like how the boats line up sorta diagonally.  Looks kinda overprocessed or is it bokeh from the lens?</td>', 'I like how the boats line up sorta diagonally.  Looks kinda overprocessed or is it bokeh from the lens?', '2005-09-07 13:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682731, 226529, 40977, '<td valign="top">Original take.  I like it.  Nice Job.</td>', 'Original take.  I like it.  Nice Job.', '2005-09-07 13:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682734, 228170, 40977, '<td valign="top">The grass close up is distracting, but the colors are amazing.  Wish the brush was out of the way of the lens.  Nice Job.</td>', 'The grass close up is distracting, but the colors are amazing.  Wish the brush was out of the way of the lens.  Nice Job.', '2005-09-07 13:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682737, 228156, 14476, '<td valign="top">very effective use of shadows, reflections.  10</td>', 'very effective use of shadows, reflections.  10', '2005-09-07 13:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682738, 227340, 41522, '<td valign="top">My first thought when seeing this image with the title in mind, was that I thought it strange that your main subject is the darkest part of the photo and the buildings are approaching over-exposure.  JMO.</td>', 'My first thought when seeing this image with the title in mind, was that I thought it strange that your main subject is the darkest part of the photo and the buildings are approaching over-exposure.  JMO.', '2005-09-07 13:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682739, 225236, 40977, '<td valign="top">Very cool feel to this shot.  Would have liked to have the red limb to the right in focus, or cropped -- regardless a nice shot. good job.</td>', 'Very cool feel to this shot.  Would have liked to have the red limb to the right in focus, or cropped -- regardless a nice shot. good job.', '2005-09-07 13:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682742, 225651, 12327, '<td valign="top">very interesting capture.  I wish the colors were a little more lively.</td>', 'very interesting capture.  I wish the colors were a little more lively.', '2005-09-07 13:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682745, 228190, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think the lightin at the time of the photo was working against you.  There are a couple of hot spots on the tree.  Maybe some warmer lighting and a little less DOF would allow us to focus on the texture of the tree a little more.</td>', 'I think the lightin at the time of the photo was working against you.  There are a couple of hot spots on the tree.  Maybe some warmer lighting and a little less DOF would allow us to focus on the texture of the tree a little more.', '2005-09-07 13:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682746, 227356, 40977, '<td valign="top">Originality abounds.  I like it.  The border works for the shot, but I might have cropped the posts on the left all the way in/out, but not half way.  But that is a style issue and regardless of that you did a really nice job.  -- 7 --</td>', 'Originality abounds.  I like it.  The border works for the shot, but I might have cropped the posts on the left all the way in/out, but not half way.  But that is a style issue and regardless of that you did a really nice job.  -- 7 --', '2005-09-07 13:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682747, 227566, 41522, '<td valign="top">I like your title for this shot.  The unlevel horizon is a bit of a problem for me.</td>', 'I like your title for this shot.  The unlevel horizon is a bit of a problem for me.', '2005-09-07 13:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682751, 227399, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely and moody.  If it was mine, I''d probably experiment with cropping the right 1/3 out of the image.  It would concentrate interest in that nice cmposition of leaves falling from the top.</td>', 'Lovely and moody.  If it was mine, I''d probably experiment with cropping the right 1/3 out of the image.  It would concentrate interest in that nice cmposition of leaves falling from the top.', '2005-09-07 13:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682753, 227887, 32064, '<td valign="top">a good composition and subtle lighting</td>', 'a good composition and subtle lighting', '2005-09-07 13:22:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1682754, 227606, 14476, '<td valign="top">Original, nice.</td>', 'Original, nice.', '2005-09-07 13:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682757, 227001, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is a good capture..</td>', 'This is a good capture..', '2005-09-07 13:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682758, 227493, 18349, '<td valign="top">Lovely...would like a bit more saturation, and you''ve got some sensor boogies on there, but lovely anyway.  :)</td>', 'Lovely...would like a bit more saturation, and you''ve got some sensor boogies on there, but lovely anyway.  :)', '2005-09-07 13:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682762, 226769, 12327, '<td valign="top">the bright circles in the lower left corner look like they are in front of the subject.  Is that glare from the sun? or something between the lens and the plant?  otherwise I really like the composition and the colors are awesome.</td>', 'the bright circles in the lower left corner look like they are in front of the subject.  Is that glare from the sun? or something between the lens and the plant?  otherwise I really like the composition and the colors are awesome.', '2005-09-07 13:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682763, 226501, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and high key elements of this shot...it works well.</td>', 'I like the angle and high key elements of this shot...it works well.', '2005-09-07 13:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682771, 228331, 12327, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve gotten a few comments about this... I think it''s swabbing time.<br/>//www.pbase.com/copperhill/ccd_cleaning.  <br/>I need to do it on mine also.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve gotten a few comments about this... I think it''s swabbing time.//www.pbase.com/copperhill/ccd_cleaning.  I need to do it on mine also.', '2005-09-07 13:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682776, 228066, 12327, '<td valign="top">I''m so curious where this was taken... that blue water looks amazing... makes me wanna jump in (hope it''s not full of sharks).</td>', 'I''m so curious where this was taken... that blue water looks amazing... makes me wanna jump in (hope it''s not full of sharks).', '2005-09-07 13:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682779, 228285, 34659, '<td valign="top">It''s a two-fer!  ;-)  Great color and composition.  The focus &amp; DOF seem slightly off to me, but otherwise great shot.</td>', 'It''s a two-fer!  ;-)  Great color and composition.  The focus & DOF seem slightly off to me, but otherwise great shot.', '2005-09-07 13:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682780, 225625, 41522, '<td valign="top">A very cool catapiller.  I really wish the focus were better, the noise reduced and the chain link background wasn''t there.</td>', 'A very cool catapiller.  I really wish the focus were better, the noise reduced and the chain link background wasn''t there.', '2005-09-07 13:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682782, 227283, 42100, '<td valign="top">Straightened horizon and removal of distractiong foreground would really help this photo.  Other than that it is a very good photo.</td>', 'Straightened horizon and removal of distractiong foreground would really help this photo.  Other than that it is a very good photo.', '2005-09-07 13:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682785, 227975, 12327, '<td valign="top">ah... the madrone trees... my favorite.  Nicely captured colors.</td>', 'ah... the madrone trees... my favorite.  Nicely captured colors.', '2005-09-07 13:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682786, 226737, 34659, '<td valign="top">This image is a little busy, but I like what''s going on.  The highlights are also a bit on the bright side - might consider adjusting contrast and color sat and reducing backlighting to make it pop a little more and get rid of some of the clutter.  Still - sharply focused and has nice reflections.  Solid entry.</td>', 'This image is a little busy, but I like what''s going on.  The highlights are also a bit on the bright side - might consider adjusting contrast and color sat and reducing backlighting to make it pop a little more and get rid of some of the clutter.  Still - sharply focused and has nice reflections.  Solid entry.', '2005-09-07 13:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682791, 228330, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wow - Magnificent shot.  I''d be interested to read how you managed some of these effects in basic editing - I don''t doubt that it''s legal, I just wanna know how to do it myself!  :-)  Nice capture.</td>', 'Wow - Magnificent shot.  I''d be interested to read how you managed some of these effects in basic editing - I don''t doubt that it''s legal, I just wanna know how to do it myself!  :-)  Nice capture.', '2005-09-07 13:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682794, 228018, 41522, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the processing and noise are overpowering here.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the processing and noise are overpowering here.', '2005-09-07 13:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682797, 225906, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful deep rich tones and very attractive composition.  Surprisingly, I think the border adds to this image too.  Nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful deep rich tones and very attractive composition.  Surprisingly, I think the border adds to this image too.  Nice job.', '2005-09-07 13:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682799, 227650, 27460, '<td valign="top">slightly out of focus, not sharp enough, but good colour and composition</td>', 'slightly out of focus, not sharp enough, but good colour and composition', '2005-09-07 13:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682801, 225635, 34659, '<td valign="top">Absolutely incredible focus, color, &amp; DOF.  This is SOOO crisp!  Nice deep, rich tones.  Great job and cute title.</td>', 'Absolutely incredible focus, color, & DOF.  This is SOOO crisp!  Nice deep, rich tones.  Great job and cute title.', '2005-09-07 13:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682802, 228052, 27460, '<td valign="top">blue haze is a little too "bright" colour contrast w/the green is a little bright on the eye</td>', 'blue haze is a little too "bright" colour contrast w/the green is a little bright on the eye', '2005-09-07 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682804, 228288, 27460, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, love the composition. only complaint is the dangling twig at the 1/3rd mark from the left.</td>', 'beautiful shot, love the composition. only complaint is the dangling twig at the 1/3rd mark from the left.', '2005-09-07 13:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682805, 228287, 34659, '<td valign="top">This looks like such an impressive sight.  I''m not sure that the B/W you used does it justice though.  Maybe bump up the contrast to get more detail or try color.  Still, a beautiful shot.</td>', 'This looks like such an impressive sight.  I''m not sure that the B/W you used does it justice though.  Maybe bump up the contrast to get more detail or try color.  Still, a beautiful shot.', '2005-09-07 13:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682806, 227880, 27460, '<td valign="top">sky is a little washed out, tree is a little "too" busy</td>', 'sky is a little washed out, tree is a little "too" busy', '2005-09-07 13:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682807, 227001, 27460, '<td valign="top">gorgeous shot, nice sense of timing</td>', 'gorgeous shot, nice sense of timing', '2005-09-07 13:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682809, 226006, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cute shot - I don''t care for the border.  Great composition otherwise and very creative take.</td>', 'Cute shot - I don''t care for the border.  Great composition otherwise and very creative take.', '2005-09-07 13:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682810, 225580, 41522, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a touch soft and that bright light at the top is extremly distracting for me.</td>', 'The focus seems a touch soft and that bright light at the top is extremly distracting for me.', '2005-09-07 13:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682811, 228231, 34659, '<td valign="top">Visually interesting composition.  Looks like too much Neat Image.  Also, I think the colors/tones could use a bump along with contrast.  Otherwise I really like it.</td>', 'Visually interesting composition.  Looks like too much Neat Image.  Also, I think the colors/tones could use a bump along with contrast.  Otherwise I really like it.', '2005-09-07 13:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682813, 228124, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think you have the start of a good challenge photo, but the focus on the plants is really soft compared to the ground below.</td>', 'I think you have the start of a good challenge photo, but the focus on the plants is really soft compared to the ground below.', '2005-09-07 13:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682816, 228217, 41522, '<td valign="top">This looks really cool.</td>', 'This looks really cool.', '2005-09-07 13:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682825, 227571, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines &amp; composition.  I think the colors &amp; contrast could use a bump, but otherwise great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful lines & composition.  I think the colors & contrast could use a bump, but otherwise great shot.', '2005-09-07 13:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682827, 226467, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really magnificent scene.  Not crazy about the processing though.  Somehow it seems to take away from the beautiful detail and rich tones, rather than augment them.  Still strong entry.</td>', 'Really magnificent scene.  Not crazy about the processing though.  Somehow it seems to take away from the beautiful detail and rich tones, rather than augment them.  Still strong entry.', '2005-09-07 13:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682830, 226405, 34659, '<td valign="top">Ya know - this was the very first thing I thought of when this challenge was announced.  I knew I didn''t have the chops to pull it off, but you''ve done quite nicely.  The horizon seems slightly tilted to me (and a distraction rather than an artistic plus), but otherwise the focus and colors/tones are dead on.  Great job.</td>', 'Ya know - this was the very first thing I thought of when this challenge was announced.  I knew I didn''t have the chops to pull it off, but you''ve done quite nicely.  The horizon seems slightly tilted to me (and a distraction rather than an artistic plus), but otherwise the focus and colors/tones are dead on.  Great job.', '2005-09-07 13:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682835, 227091, 34659, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot.  Perfect lighting &amp; tones.  Really nice work.</td>', 'Fantastic shot.  Perfect lighting & tones.  Really nice work.', '2005-09-07 13:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682837, 228024, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great idea and title.  The shot''s lighting is a bit harsh though and I think a little sharper focus would help.  Still, solid entry.</td>', 'Great idea and title.  The shot''s lighting is a bit harsh though and I think a little sharper focus would help.  Still, solid entry.', '2005-09-07 13:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682840, 227887, 34659, '<td valign="top">Now why didn''t I think of this?!?  My mother has these all over her house!  Although I''m sure I couldn''t have done it the justice that you have here.  Absolutely magnificent job.  Composition, lighting, tones, focus are all superb.  Kudos...</td>', 'Now why didn''t I think of this?!?  My mother has these all over her house!  Although I''m sure I couldn''t have done it the justice that you have here.  Absolutely magnificent job.  Composition, lighting, tones, focus are all superb.  Kudos...', '2005-09-07 13:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682842, 227975, 40977, '<td valign="top">What a great shot.  I love the colors and the composition.  Great Job.</td>', 'What a great shot.  I love the colors and the composition.  Great Job.', '2005-09-07 13:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682844, 227346, 34659, '<td valign="top">You really made the ordinary interesting here with great lighting, focus, and beautiful tones.  Composition works well too.  Nice job.</td>', 'You really made the ordinary interesting here with great lighting, focus, and beautiful tones.  Composition works well too.  Nice job.', '2005-09-07 13:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682845, 228216, 40977, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  Great Job.  I hope it does as well as it deserves.</td>', 'Love this shot.  Great Job.  I hope it does as well as it deserves.', '2005-09-07 13:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682848, 226780, 40977, '<td valign="top">The colors on the tree trunk are so wonderfull I wish they were more the focus than the limbs/sun.  Never the less, a great shot.  Good job!!!</td>', 'The colors on the tree trunk are so wonderfull I wish they were more the focus than the limbs/sun.  Never the less, a great shot.  Good job!!!', '2005-09-07 13:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682851, 227387, 40977, '<td valign="top">Really wonderfull composition and an original take on the challenge.  Nice Job.</td>', 'Really wonderfull composition and an original take on the challenge.  Nice Job.', '2005-09-07 13:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682852, 226705, 43148, '<td valign="top">too much reflection off the tracks</td>', 'too much reflection off the tracks', '2005-09-07 13:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682853, 228130, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very creative and unique entry!  Hats off to you for thinking this up.  I think the execution could use a little work, but I do like the idea.  I would recommend slightly sharper focus, more deep, rich tones, and you might bump up the contrast a bit more.  Still a solid entry and certainly one that stands out in a large crowd.  :-)</td>', 'Very creative and unique entry!  Hats off to you for thinking this up.  I think the execution could use a little work, but I do like the idea.  I would recommend slightly sharper focus, more deep, rich tones, and you might bump up the contrast a bit more.  Still a solid entry and certainly one that stands out in a large crowd.  :-)', '2005-09-07 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682854, 228051, 43148, '<td valign="top">looked too fake for me, sorry</td>', 'looked too fake for me, sorry', '2005-09-07 13:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682855, 225797, 40977, '<td valign="top">An amazing catch.  How the heck did he get in there???  Great Job.</td>', 'An amazing catch.  How the heck did he get in there???  Great Job.', '2005-09-07 13:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682856, 228034, 34659, '<td valign="top">Incredible focus, tones, &amp; DOF.  Composition is excellent too - and I love the title.  All in all an outstanding entry.  Great work!</td>', 'Incredible focus, tones, & DOF.  Composition is excellent too - and I love the title.  All in all an outstanding entry.  Great work!', '2005-09-07 13:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682857, 225460, 41522, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition.  I wish the exposure were a little more controlled.</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition.  I wish the exposure were a little more controlled.', '2005-09-07 13:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682858, 226532, 40977, '<td valign="top">A heartbreaker in the making!!!!  Great shot and love the overall soft feel.  Great Smile!!  Nice Job.</td>', 'A heartbreaker in the making!!!!  Great shot and love the overall soft feel.  Great Smile!!  Nice Job.', '2005-09-07 13:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682860, 225812, 43148, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective, may do okay in next challenge</td>', 'interesting perspective, may do okay in next challenge', '2005-09-07 13:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682861, 228323, 37961, '<td valign="top">Picture is too small to get high marks.</td>', 'Picture is too small to get high marks.', '2005-09-07 13:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682863, 227839, 40977, '<td valign="top">I hope this shot does as well as it deserves.  The composition is amazing and really holds my attention.  Great Idea....great job doing it in B/W.  Just love it.</td>', 'I hope this shot does as well as it deserves.  The composition is amazing and really holds my attention.  Great Idea....great job doing it in B/W.  Just love it.', '2005-09-07 13:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682865, 226607, 34659, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the story a DPCer was recounting about the tsunami last Christmas and that this was a friend''s or relative''s home.  Looks like a fantastic setting.  The tilted horizon is distracting though and I think it could use a bump in color tones.  Otherwise good job.</td>', 'This reminds me of the story a DPCer was recounting about the tsunami last Christmas and that this was a friend''s or relative''s home.  Looks like a fantastic setting.  The tilted horizon is distracting though and I think it could use a bump in color tones.  Otherwise good job.', '2005-09-07 13:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
