(1682901, 227987, 40977, '<td valign="top">The waterfall is lovely, but the tourist in the picture really take away from the overall feel of the shot.  Maybe a tigher shot/crop of the wter fall and the branches crossing the view might have been a better composed image.  Regardless I like what you were going for....nice job.</td>', 'The waterfall is lovely, but the tourist in the picture really take away from the overall feel of the shot.  Maybe a tigher shot/crop of the wter fall and the branches crossing the view might have been a better composed image.  Regardless I like what you were going for....nice job.', '2005-09-07 14:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682904, 225602, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is amazing because earlier this week I took shots of the exact same kind of yellow bug on another poke berry bush.  (They must really like them!)  This shot, however needs a little work IMHO.  The blown highlights (probably from flash) and drab background are real distractions.  The composition could be shifted to one side a bit more too, to make it more interesting.  Just my opinions, but I''ll give you props for making my day (with essentially an identical shot of my own - not entered in challenge).</td>', 'This is amazing because earlier this week I took shots of the exact same kind of yellow bug on another poke berry bush.  (They must really like them!)  This shot, however needs a little work IMHO.  The blown highlights (probably from flash) and drab background are real distractions.  The composition could be shifted to one side a bit more too, to make it more interesting.  Just my opinions, but I''ll give you props for making my day (with essentially an identical shot of my own - not entered in challenge).', '2005-09-07 14:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1682905, 225836, 40977, '<td valign="top">Very cool image.  The reflection and the hard wiring gives an everyday pass by image an artistic touch.  IMO there is too much lighting coming from the right and that glare is distracting.  I like what you were going for....nice job.</td>', 'Very cool image.  The reflection and the hard wiring gives an everyday pass by image an artistic touch.  IMO there is too much lighting coming from the right and that glare is distracting.  I like what you were going for....nice job.', '2005-09-07 14:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
