(1683012, 226820, 27460, '<td valign="top">branch is obstructing eye, eye is under-exposed (no detail can be seen). finger on the other hand is over-exposed and burning out. an interesting idea, but technically flawed. branch is also out of focus, w/o enough light to separate it from the black cloth.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-14 07:32:39.</i></td>', 'branch is obstructing eye, eye is under-exposed (no detail can be seen). finger on the other hand is over-exposed and burning out. an interesting idea, but technically flawed. branch is also out of focus, w/o enough light to separate it from the black cloth.', '2005-09-07 14:28:12.000000', '2005-09-14 08:32:39.000000', 1),
