(1683551, 227425, 41522, '<td valign="top">Cool.  I like the composition, with the low ground level.  Gives a sense of the distance a bolt of lightning has to travel.  I like the movement in the ground as well.</td>', 'Cool.  I like the composition, with the low ground level.  Gives a sense of the distance a bolt of lightning has to travel.  I like the movement in the ground as well.', '2005-09-07 17:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
