(1683917, 228328, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is a very refreshing approach.  The birds add that extra point of interest.  The photo feels a little flat and slightly oof.  Fiddling with some contrast may give this already nice pic some more punch.</td>', 'This is a very refreshing approach.  The birds add that extra point of interest.  The photo feels a little flat and slightly oof.  Fiddling with some contrast may give this already nice pic some more punch.', '2005-09-07 19:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
