(1684007, 227340, 24073, '<td valign="top">Just plain boring....sorry.  The picture is busy, it don''t match the challenge, and the colors are all neutral and very unorganized.  GL.</td>', 'Just plain boring....sorry.  The picture is busy, it don''t match the challenge, and the colors are all neutral and very unorganized.  GL.', '2005-09-07 19:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
