(1684481, 227968, 24073, '<td valign="top">aside from being a bit on the over-exposed side, the shadows are not exposed enough.  The texture in the back makes it seem busy, and overdone.  I think a plain white or black background with some heavily highlighted shadows would of been a ton more interesting.  I hope  this helps, I don''t mean to be over-critical.</td>', 'aside from being a bit on the over-exposed side, the shadows are not exposed enough.  The texture in the back makes it seem busy, and overdone.  I think a plain white or black background with some heavily highlighted shadows would of been a ton more interesting.  I hope  this helps, I don''t mean to be over-critical.', '2005-09-07 21:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
