(1684693, 226614, 24073, '<td valign="top">Im bumpin this one up.  As I went through the first time, this one seemed bland, and lacking any unique subject matter.  But I see it now.  I like the clarity, and depth, and there is terrific color here, and it would seem to flash across the background very nicely.  I was wonderin if you would of focused on a real bright part of the sky from where you were standing right there, or turned the EV compensation down it might of created a scene where those leaves would of stood alone illuminated on a very consistent background.  That might of been cool, if i would of worked.  As it is, its a nice photo, and Im bumpin you up.  GL.</td>', 'Im bumpin this one up.  As I went through the first time, this one seemed bland, and lacking any unique subject matter.  But I see it now.  I like the clarity, and depth, and there is terrific color here, and it would seem to flash across the background very nicely.  I was wonderin if you would of focused on a real bright part of the sky from where you were standing right there, or turned the EV compensation down it might of created a scene where those leaves would of stood alone illuminated on a very consistent background.  That might of been cool, if i would of worked.  As it is, its a nice photo, and Im bumpin you up.  GL.', '2005-09-07 22:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
