(1684698, 225293, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not a bad photo, but I wonder how if would look if you cropped out more of the trees on the right hand side so that the branches weren''t so centered in the picture?</td>', 'Not a bad photo, but I wonder how if would look if you cropped out more of the trees on the right hand side so that the branches weren''t so centered in the picture?', '2005-09-07 22:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684699, 227215, 34904, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge, and good focus.  Perhaps it would look better off-centered?</td>', 'It meets the challenge, and good focus.  Perhaps it would look better off-centered?', '2005-09-07 22:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684701, 227695, 42404, '<td valign="top">I really like how it''s kind of trippy! It almost looks like a Ring Wrathe from LORD OF THE RINGS or something. I like it.</td>', 'I really like how it''s kind of trippy! It almost looks like a Ring Wrathe from LORD OF THE RINGS or something. I like it.', '2005-09-07 22:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684707, 226651, 34904, '<td valign="top">The crooked horizon is a distraction.  I your use of black and white.</td>', 'The crooked horizon is a distraction.  I your use of black and white.', '2005-09-07 22:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684714, 228124, 34904, '<td valign="top">I like the off centered subject.  It may have looked better if you would have zoomed in a bit on the green thing.</td>', 'I like the off centered subject.  It may have looked better if you would have zoomed in a bit on the green thing.', '2005-09-07 22:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684715, 227524, 24073, '<td valign="top">This would of been so cool if you would of put a black curtain behind it, and then took the photo in macro, maybe even a blue ribbon winner.  At least top 25.  As it is, it just lacks a color appeal to me, and that cleanliness that even great dirty photos have.  I don''t have a word in my vocabulary to explain what I am feeling, but I would still like to say this is pretty cool.  GL.</td>', 'This would of been so cool if you would of put a black curtain behind it, and then took the photo in macro, maybe even a blue ribbon winner.  At least top 25.  As it is, it just lacks a color appeal to me, and that cleanliness that even great dirty photos have.  I don''t have a word in my vocabulary to explain what I am feeling, but I would still like to say this is pretty cool.  GL.', '2005-09-07 22:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684720, 227200, 34904, '<td valign="top">Sort of fits the challenge, but it doesn''t jump out and scream "Branch".  I think it would look better if you could have adjusted your focus so the trees were blurry.</td>', 'Sort of fits the challenge, but it doesn''t jump out and scream "Branch".  I think it would look better if you could have adjusted your focus so the trees were blurry.', '2005-09-07 22:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684725, 226561, 34904, '<td valign="top">Good color contrast, but the subject is slightly our of focus.  Like the off-center composition.</td>', 'Good color contrast, but the subject is slightly our of focus.  Like the off-center composition.', '2005-09-07 22:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684730, 226087, 34904, '<td valign="top">Looks good, but would look better slightly off center.  It sems a bit too sharp.</td>', 'Looks good, but would look better slightly off center.  It sems a bit too sharp.', '2005-09-07 22:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684731, 228003, 40484, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2005-09-07 22:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684735, 225394, 34904, '<td valign="top">looks OK.  Nothing is horribly interesting.</td>', 'looks OK.  Nothing is horribly interesting.', '2005-09-07 22:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684739, 226607, 34904, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, but water seems to be the subject (or maybe even the rocks).  The picture should have been composed a bit more to display the branches.</td>', 'A nice shot, but water seems to be the subject (or maybe even the rocks).  The picture should have been composed a bit more to display the branches.', '2005-09-07 22:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684742, 226360, 34904, '<td valign="top">Hood photo.  It seems like the sun is the subject, and not the branches.</td>', 'Hood photo.  It seems like the sun is the subject, and not the branches.', '2005-09-07 22:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684744, 227848, 41675, '<td valign="top">A bit more cropping from the sides and I would have scored this higher. I think cropping it closer would create a more dramatic impact.</td>', 'A bit more cropping from the sides and I would have scored this higher. I think cropping it closer would create a more dramatic impact.', '2005-09-07 22:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684748, 226560, 34904, '<td valign="top">Good composition and contrast.  Maybe a fill flash would have helped?</td>', 'Good composition and contrast.  Maybe a fill flash would have helped?', '2005-09-07 22:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684751, 228278, 34904, '<td valign="top">Focus could be sharper, but all and all a good shot.</td>', 'Focus could be sharper, but all and all a good shot.', '2005-09-07 22:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684753, 227480, 34904, '<td valign="top">Looks good, but tree trunk is to "centered".  I like the croping.</td>', 'Looks good, but tree trunk is to "centered".  I like the croping.', '2005-09-07 22:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684763, 225221, 41794, '<td valign="top">wonderful color and composition</td>', 'wonderful color and composition', '2005-09-07 22:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684765, 227542, 34904, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and focus.  It would have scored higher if it was a clear day.</td>', 'I like the subject and focus.  It would have scored higher if it was a clear day.', '2005-09-07 22:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684769, 228203, 41794, '<td valign="top">Elk? Great shot!</td>', 'Elk? Great shot!', '2005-09-07 22:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684773, 228320, 42585, '<td valign="top">I thought paper was white?</td>', 'I thought paper was white?', '2005-09-07 22:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684774, 228035, 42585, '<td valign="top">?? i don''t get it</td>', '?? i don''t get it', '2005-09-07 22:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684775, 228330, 34904, '<td valign="top">This should place well (if it doesn''t get disqualified).  The river looks very smooth.   Good color and composition.</td>', 'This should place well (if it doesn''t get disqualified).  The river looks very smooth.   Good color and composition.', '2005-09-07 22:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684777, 228008, 42585, '<td valign="top">This would look great taken with a better light (different time of the day)</td>', 'This would look great taken with a better light (different time of the day)', '2005-09-07 22:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684779, 227918, 34904, '<td valign="top">Can''t figure out how it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Can''t figure out how it meets the challenge.', '2005-09-07 22:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684780, 228154, 42585, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but flat</td>', 'nice idea, but flat', '2005-09-07 22:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684787, 227306, 34904, '<td valign="top">Aparently that green thing is a switch and it is the subject of your photo.  I don''t know enough about railroading to determine if that green thing is the subject.  INHO, I would have focused in on the tracks because they "branch", and switches, well "switch".</td>', 'Aparently that green thing is a switch and it is the subject of your photo.  I don''t know enough about railroading to determine if that green thing is the subject.  INHO, I would have focused in on the tracks because they "branch", and switches, well "switch".', '2005-09-07 22:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684788, 228244, 34904, '<td valign="top">I think it would work better if you would have zoomed in on the bird.</td>', 'I think it would work better if you would have zoomed in on the bird.', '2005-09-07 22:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684793, 227680, 34904, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, the title, composition and border.  I''m giving it a 7.</td>', 'I like this shot, the title, composition and border.  I''m giving it a 7.', '2005-09-07 22:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684795, 228158, 34904, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the subject.  Giving it a 6</td>', 'Interesting take on the subject.  Giving it a 6', '2005-09-07 22:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684799, 227358, 43031, '<td valign="top">oh, they''re on a branch. took me a little bit.</td>', 'oh, they''re on a branch. took me a little bit.', '2005-09-07 22:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684804, 227285, 34904, '<td valign="top">I think it would have worked better if those things in the foreground were a bit smaller and clearer.  6</td>', 'I think it would have worked better if those things in the foreground were a bit smaller and clearer.  6', '2005-09-07 22:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684809, 227987, 34904, '<td valign="top">This has everything for a top 20% finish (in my humble openion).  Good composition, but it looks like there is something amiss with the right side of the trees.  It has people (I like people).  Good cropping,  I''m giving it an 8.</td>', 'This has everything for a top 20% finish (in my humble openion).  Good composition, but it looks like there is something amiss with the right side of the trees.  It has people (I like people).  Good cropping,  I''m giving it an 8.', '2005-09-07 22:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684811, 227486, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the separated branch. for me, there is a nice...graphic-like quality to your shot. Good forms and shapes.</td>', 'I like the separated branch. for me, there is a nice...graphic-like quality to your shot. Good forms and shapes.', '2005-09-07 22:31:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1684815, 227908, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and viewpoint. I like the darkened shadow branches. The sun seems a bit too bright, but a nice photo overall.</td>', 'Nice angle and viewpoint. I like the darkened shadow branches. The sun seems a bit too bright, but a nice photo overall.', '2005-09-07 22:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684820, 226406, 41675, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad about the man-made fence in the background, but I like the way you caught the moose''s reflections in the water.</td>', 'It''s too bad about the man-made fence in the background, but I like the way you caught the moose''s reflections in the water.', '2005-09-07 22:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684823, 227271, 41675, '<td valign="top">Tee hee hee...lol...very funny and cute. Points for humor as I like photos that make me smile and laugh.</td>', 'Tee hee hee...lol...very funny and cute. Points for humor as I like photos that make me smile and laugh.', '2005-09-07 22:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684825, 225594, 34904, '<td valign="top">In focus, good use of color.  Good depth of field.  That black thing on the right gave me problems though, kinda looks like a dildo.  It''s probably a piece of fishing equipment that I am not familiar with.  (Don''t fish)  I think it warrents a high placing, but I don''t think it''s top 10 material.  7</td>', 'In focus, good use of color.  Good depth of field.  That black thing on the right gave me problems though, kinda looks like a dildo.  It''s probably a piece of fishing equipment that I am not familiar with.  (Don''t fish)  I think it warrents a high placing, but I don''t think it''s top 10 material.  7', '2005-09-07 22:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684828, 226575, 41675, '<td valign="top">Although I don''t like butterflies, I like how you used the leaves to frame your subject matter. That and the fact that the butterfly itself is not centered in the photo.</td>', 'Although I don''t like butterflies, I like how you used the leaves to frame your subject matter. That and the fact that the butterfly itself is not centered in the photo.', '2005-09-07 22:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684830, 227908, 31595, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot! I love your composition, especially the angle from which it was shot. Beautiful!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot! I love your composition, especially the angle from which it was shot. Beautiful!', '2005-09-07 22:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684831, 225391, 34904, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot.  The squirrel is in focus and on a branch.  It''s slightly off center and is looking right at you.  Giving it a 7.</td>', 'What a beautiful shot.  The squirrel is in focus and on a branch.  It''s slightly off center and is looking right at you.  Giving it a 7.', '2005-09-07 22:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684833, 227974, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice starlight shape from the sun, but for me it lacks interest compared to other photos in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice starlight shape from the sun, but for me it lacks interest compared to other photos in this challenge.', '2005-09-07 22:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684834, 227645, 34904, '<td valign="top">I think youre pushing it a bit to call fingers branches of the hand.  I like thsoft focus and composition.</td>', 'I think youre pushing it a bit to call fingers branches of the hand.  I like thsoft focus and composition.', '2005-09-07 22:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684835, 226408, 31595, '<td valign="top">I like the idea! Cheers to your creativity!</td>', 'I like the idea! Cheers to your creativity!', '2005-09-07 22:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684836, 228018, 41675, '<td valign="top">Seems overly done in a photo editing program, but I do like your vertical composition.</td>', 'Seems overly done in a photo editing program, but I do like your vertical composition.', '2005-09-07 22:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684841, 228310, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow...great colors and clarity. I also like the thin line, bright green border which subtely enhances the soft green from the background. This would make a nice holiday card.</td>', 'Wow...great colors and clarity. I also like the thin line, bright green border which subtely enhances the soft green from the background. This would make a nice holiday card.', '2005-09-07 22:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684843, 227686, 41675, '<td valign="top">Points for ingenuity on a challenge theme.</td>', 'Points for ingenuity on a challenge theme.', '2005-09-07 22:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684846, 226839, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not techinical when it comes to critiques. All I know is that your photo makes me smile and brings back memories of childhood and my father and brothers on fishing trips. Thank you.</td>', 'I''m not techinical when it comes to critiques. All I know is that your photo makes me smile and brings back memories of childhood and my father and brothers on fishing trips. Thank you.', '2005-09-07 22:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684850, 228259, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. The lines of the bird seem mimicked in the bush/tree that it''s perched upon. I like the soft background as well. 8</td>', 'Very nice photo. The lines of the bird seem mimicked in the bush/tree that it''s perched upon. I like the soft background as well. 8', '2005-09-07 22:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684855, 227414, 43031, '<td valign="top">If the sky is uninteresting, i feel it''s best to leave it out.</td>', 'If the sky is uninteresting, i feel it''s best to leave it out.', '2005-09-07 22:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684858, 227843, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your black and white photo gives me a spooky movie kind of feeling...like I''m being chased as I run deeper into the woods. The foreground branch on the lower right side is a little distracting, but an intriguing photo.</td>', 'Your black and white photo gives me a spooky movie kind of feeling...like I''m being chased as I run deeper into the woods. The foreground branch on the lower right side is a little distracting, but an intriguing photo.', '2005-09-07 22:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684867, 227952, 43298, '<td valign="top">I''m Dizzy!!</td>', 'I''m Dizzy!!', '2005-09-07 22:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684885, 227554, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I find the pink and orange color of the ribbons..."fighting", but I really like your composition and stark white background.</td>', 'For me, I find the pink and orange color of the ribbons..."fighting", but I really like your composition and stark white background.', '2005-09-07 22:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684886, 226651, 41675, '<td valign="top">I wonder how this would look if your main subject was less centered. Say off the left more? I like your choice of black and white. the highlights are nice too.</td>', 'I wonder how this would look if your main subject was less centered. Say off the left more? I like your choice of black and white. the highlights are nice too.', '2005-09-07 22:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684893, 228023, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not very techinical, but I like the main object of your photo. The faded branches off to the left and right are nice too, just alot of blue sky which for me, detracts a bit.</td>', 'I''m not very techinical, but I like the main object of your photo. The faded branches off to the left and right are nice too, just alot of blue sky which for me, detracts a bit.', '2005-09-07 22:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684897, 226756, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like how you "framed" the photo with the branch and the tones you used. For me, if you had cropped a bit more off the bottom, your picture would have an even greater impact.</td>', 'I like how you "framed" the photo with the branch and the tones you used. For me, if you had cropped a bit more off the bottom, your picture would have an even greater impact.', '2005-09-07 22:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684900, 225651, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very cool tree and webs. For me, I find the fence background detracts from the tree. Nice tone on tone quality to your photo though.</td>', 'Very cool tree and webs. For me, I find the fence background detracts from the tree. Nice tone on tone quality to your photo though.', '2005-09-07 22:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684901, 226993, 41675, '<td valign="top">Although the flash is a bit too bright, I like your composition.</td>', 'Although the flash is a bit too bright, I like your composition.', '2005-09-07 22:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684905, 227524, 43298, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great shot! You must have so many comments.</td>', 'Wow! Great shot! You must have so many comments.', '2005-09-07 22:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684906, 228149, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you chose and the way the leaves are backlit by the sun.</td>', 'I like the angle you chose and the way the leaves are backlit by the sun.', '2005-09-07 22:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684907, 226071, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the ripple effect you captured. I thinks this would look better slightly larger also.</td>', 'I like the ripple effect you captured. I thinks this would look better slightly larger also.', '2005-09-07 22:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684908, 227311, 17507, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the challenge. this could be a very good photo without those awful shadows from the flash.</td>', 'interesting take on the challenge. this could be a very good photo without those awful shadows from the flash.', '2005-09-07 22:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684909, 225984, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a nice, strong shadow effect you created. I like the composition. Good graphic quality to it.</td>', 'What a nice, strong shadow effect you created. I like the composition. Good graphic quality to it.', '2005-09-07 22:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684910, 227654, 36462, '<td valign="top">i think that this is probably a really nice image.  However, it is too small to be able to judge, for certain, the quality.</td>', 'i think that this is probably a really nice image.  However, it is too small to be able to judge, for certain, the quality.', '2005-09-07 22:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684911, 226006, 17507, '<td valign="top">wow, what a pose! colors are perfectly ghoulish.</td>', 'wow, what a pose! colors are perfectly ghoulish.', '2005-09-07 22:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684912, 228221, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, sometimes the simpliest photos work best. I like the tones, the stark background and the highlights. 9</td>', 'For me, sometimes the simpliest photos work best. I like the tones, the stark background and the highlights. 9', '2005-09-07 22:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684913, 228178, 17507, '<td valign="top">t<br/>o<br/>o<br/> <br/>s<br/>m<br/>a<br/>l<br/>l<br/></td>', 'too small', '2005-09-07 22:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684915, 228065, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on the challnege - creative.</td>', 'Very nice take on the challnege - creative.', '2005-09-07 22:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684918, 226540, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the lighting is a bit bright and it''s unfortunate that the one boy has his arm across his face...and I''m curious as to what or who they are looking at. :-)</td>', 'For me, the lighting is a bit bright and it''s unfortunate that the one boy has his arm across his face...and I''m curious as to what or who they are looking at. :-)', '2005-09-07 22:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684919, 226820, 17507, '<td valign="top">interesting idea, and a good pose. I think there should have been more light from the front and that the fabric covering the face should be either darker or removed, depending on whether you want to keep it "ninja" per se.</td>', 'interesting idea, and a good pose. I think there should have been more light from the front and that the fabric covering the face should be either darker or removed, depending on whether you want to keep it "ninja" per se.', '2005-09-07 22:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684922, 228007, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, good reflections...and it made me smile.</td>', 'I like the composition, good reflections...and it made me smile.', '2005-09-07 22:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684924, 228261, 41675, '<td valign="top">Sweet photo. I like how the little flowers are close in color to the straps (?) in the foreground.</td>', 'Sweet photo. I like how the little flowers are close in color to the straps (?) in the foreground.', '2005-09-07 22:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684933, 227165, 36462, '<td valign="top">very intersting.  I like the abstractness of it.  Dead, or dying,  trees almost always make for interesting abstracts.  However, I feel that the overexposure of the sky is distracting, and detracts some what from the image.</td>', 'very intersting.  I like the abstractness of it.  Dead, or dying,  trees almost always make for interesting abstracts.  However, I feel that the overexposure of the sky is distracting, and detracts some what from the image.', '2005-09-07 23:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684945, 226081, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not a technical critiquer, but I like the texture you captured on the logs.</td>', 'I''m not a technical critiquer, but I like the texture you captured on the logs.', '2005-09-07 23:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684949, 225643, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like how you used the trees at the top of your photo as frames.</td>', 'I like how you used the trees at the top of your photo as frames.', '2005-09-07 23:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684954, 226578, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a landing. Nice to see something other than tree branches. I like it as a black and white also.</td>', 'Nice capture of a landing. Nice to see something other than tree branches. I like it as a black and white also.', '2005-09-07 23:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684955, 227952, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but it honestly makes my eyes hurt from such a blur.</td>', 'I like this photo, but it honestly makes my eyes hurt from such a blur.', '2005-09-07 23:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684958, 226820, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the use of black * white, and just a bit of the hand adds just the right touch. One of my favorites - hope you get a ribbon! 10</td>', 'I like the use of black * white, and just a bit of the hand adds just the right touch. One of my favorites - hope you get a ribbon! 10', '2005-09-07 23:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684962, 226080, 41675, '<td valign="top">Althought I find the very top (white branch?) distracting, what a cool macro.</td>', 'Althought I find the very top (white branch?) distracting, what a cool macro.', '2005-09-07 23:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684965, 227655, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a different take on the challenge. If there had been a bit more light or contrast on the rocks themselves, I would have scored it higher. I like your point of view too.</td>', 'Nice to see a different take on the challenge. If there had been a bit more light or contrast on the rocks themselves, I would have scored it higher. I like your point of view too.', '2005-09-07 23:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684968, 227012, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a wodnerful angles and the critter blends in so well on the log, yet the log stands out from the softness of the water. I hope you do very well in this challenge. One of my favorites.</td>', 'What a wodnerful angles and the critter blends in so well on the log, yet the log stands out from the softness of the water. I hope you do very well in this challenge. One of my favorites.', '2005-09-07 23:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684970, 227335, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cute candid.</td>', 'Cute candid.', '2005-09-07 23:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684981, 227645, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your concept of "branch". I find the object (shoe?) in the lower right a bit distracting, but otherwise well executed.</td>', 'I like your concept of "branch". I find the object (shoe?) in the lower right a bit distracting, but otherwise well executed.', '2005-09-07 23:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684982, 227322, 2000, '<td valign="top">Cropped a little lower, so the branch would be visible, would make this a near perfect shot to me.  7</td>', 'Cropped a little lower, so the branch would be visible, would make this a near perfect shot to me.  7', '2005-09-07 23:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684987, 225915, 41675, '<td valign="top">On my screen your photo appears a bit out of focus. Good idea, but for me, those spotlights detract from your shot.</td>', 'On my screen your photo appears a bit out of focus. Good idea, but for me, those spotlights detract from your shot.', '2005-09-07 23:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684989, 226006, 2000, '<td valign="top">Looks like a high-wire act, and I smiled.  Nice composition, with the sunset highlights on the branches.  I really like that purple sky - I wonder if it''s natural or if your edits brought that color out. 8</td>', 'Looks like a high-wire act, and I smiled.  Nice composition, with the sunset highlights on the branches.  I really like that purple sky - I wonder if it''s natural or if your edits brought that color out. 8', '2005-09-07 23:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
