(1685147, 225906, 38127, '<td valign="top">what a peaceful spot.. makes me want to take a deep breath and just relax.. beautiful.  I like the crop and framing here.</td>', 'what a peaceful spot.. makes me want to take a deep breath and just relax.. beautiful.  I like the crop and framing here.', '2005-09-07 23:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685150, 227024, 35545, '<td valign="top">I can relate to this one.  Did you put it in the emotive gallery?  The colors in the background look a little washed out.</td>', 'I can relate to this one.  Did you put it in the emotive gallery?  The colors in the background look a little washed out.', '2005-09-07 23:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685151, 227063, 43004, '<td valign="top">Very nice.   I especially appreciate the crispness of the foreground vs. the faded background.  :-)<br/>Oh, and I love birds.  :-)</td>', 'Very nice.   I especially appreciate the crispness of the foreground vs. the faded background.  :-)Oh, and I love birds.  :-)', '2005-09-07 23:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685152, 227004, 38127, '<td valign="top">personally I would have liked to see more of the background cropped and more detail of the gentleman... fun picture though.</td>', 'personally I would have liked to see more of the background cropped and more detail of the gentleman... fun picture though.', '2005-09-07 23:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685154, 228216, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about the carpeting(?), but I like the trains and motion.</td>', 'Not crazy about the carpeting(?), but I like the trains and motion.', '2005-09-07 23:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685155, 227680, 38127, '<td valign="top">now thats what branches are for ;) ... great detail and subject takes me back .. :)</td>', 'now thats what branches are for ;) ... great detail and subject takes me back .. :)', '2005-09-07 23:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685158, 228160, 38127, '<td valign="top">wow.. love the detail of the bird and branch.. Wow</td>', 'wow.. love the detail of the bird and branch.. Wow', '2005-09-07 23:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685160, 226607, 43565, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but I don''t feel it really meets the challenge</td>', 'Nice picture, but I don''t feel it really meets the challenge', '2005-09-07 23:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685162, 228236, 38127, '<td valign="top">what fun creature...</td>', 'what fun creature...', '2005-09-07 23:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685163, 228081, 41675, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what those critters are, but I like the photo.</td>', 'I can''t tell what those critters are, but I like the photo.', '2005-09-07 23:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685165, 225688, 38127, '<td valign="top">Thank you.. thats priceless.... *laughing*...</td>', 'Thank you.. thats priceless.... *laughing*...', '2005-09-07 23:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685166, 228254, 38127, '<td valign="top">Oh, fun angles</td>', 'Oh, fun angles', '2005-09-07 23:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685167, 227436, 35545, '<td valign="top">That is a stem, not a branch!  8)  Having said that, I really like this picture.  I wish the parts where the grapes have been plucked was more in focus.</td>', 'That is a stem, not a branch!  8)  Having said that, I really like this picture.  I wish the parts where the grapes have been plucked was more in focus.', '2005-09-07 23:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685169, 226110, 42837, '<td valign="top">A beautiful study of the dappled light peppered through the leaves, although there is nothing really powerful to lead the eye. Some new element like a ball stuck up there or if a nature theme is what you prefer then a bird or even a nest highlighted against the leaves to break the uniformity maybe?</td>', 'A beautiful study of the dappled light peppered through the leaves, although there is nothing really powerful to lead the eye. Some new element like a ball stuck up there or if a nature theme is what you prefer then a bird or even a nest highlighted against the leaves to break the uniformity maybe?', '2005-09-07 23:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685170, 228044, 41675, '<td valign="top">I think this would work even better as a black and white photo.</td>', 'I think this would work even better as a black and white photo.', '2005-09-07 23:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685171, 227848, 38127, '<td valign="top">so stark... I like the play of light on here</td>', 'so stark... I like the play of light on here', '2005-09-07 23:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685172, 226704, 41800, '<td valign="top">nice contrast</td>', 'nice contrast', '2005-09-07 23:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685173, 226536, 35545, '<td valign="top">Really good colors and textures.  I would have cropped it so that the diagonal of the branch didn''t leave a gap at the bottom right --have it going right into the corner, so it forms a true diagonal.</td>', 'Really good colors and textures.  I would have cropped it so that the diagonal of the branch didn''t leave a gap at the bottom right --have it going right into the corner, so it forms a true diagonal.', '2005-09-07 23:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685176, 225461, 38127, '<td valign="top">Wow.. what detail... took me a second to see the little yellow bug''s... *shivers*.. lol great shot.</td>', 'Wow.. what detail... took me a second to see the little yellow bug''s... *shivers*.. lol great shot.', '2005-09-07 23:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685177, 227493, 38127, '<td valign="top">Serene.. thanks for sharing your moment.</td>', 'Serene.. thanks for sharing your moment.', '2005-09-07 23:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685179, 228018, 42837, '<td valign="top">Seems unfocused and regarding the composition: I have no problem with halving the tree (which I think is striking) it''s the very low horizon and cropping away the bottom of the tree that''s bothering me.</td>', 'Seems unfocused and regarding the composition: I have no problem with halving the tree (which I think is striking) it''s the very low horizon and cropping away the bottom of the tree that''s bothering me.', '2005-09-07 23:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685180, 228267, 35545, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this is just too dark.</td>', 'Sorry, but this is just too dark.', '2005-09-07 23:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685181, 228200, 43565, '<td valign="top">Where''s the branch?</td>', 'Where''s the branch?', '2005-09-07 23:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685182, 226543, 38127, '<td valign="top">Whoa.. the yellow just Pop''s to me... love it against the slightly blurry background.</td>', 'Whoa.. the yellow just Pop''s to me... love it against the slightly blurry background.', '2005-09-07 23:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685183, 226607, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, but I can''t see how it fits any definition of "branch".</td>', 'I really like this picture, but I can''t see how it fits any definition of "branch".', '2005-09-07 23:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685186, 228295, 43565, '<td valign="top">The path should be more off-center, and it looks over processed.</td>', 'The path should be more off-center, and it looks over processed.', '2005-09-07 23:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685187, 227674, 41675, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for those two people in the lower right (I find them distracting), I would have scored this higher. Great shot of the wall. Such rich colors and clarity.</td>', 'If it weren''t for those two people in the lower right (I find them distracting), I would have scored this higher. Great shot of the wall. Such rich colors and clarity.', '2005-09-07 23:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685189, 227429, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is too busy for me.</td>', 'This is too busy for me.', '2005-09-07 23:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685190, 225221, 38127, '<td valign="top">K... saw this and 1st it made me want to be there.. 2nd blows my pic outta the water.. 3rd.. Wow.  what a view.. Love the framing and view.. thanks for sharing :)</td>', 'K... saw this and 1st it made me want to be there.. 2nd blows my pic outta the water.. 3rd.. Wow.  what a view.. Love the framing and view.. thanks for sharing :)', '2005-09-07 23:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685193, 227885, 38127, '<td valign="top">ive looked at this about 3 times now.. simply love it. It says Tree to me.. tall strong and powerful... simply beautiful.. :)</td>', 'ive looked at this about 3 times now.. simply love it. It says Tree to me.. tall strong and powerful... simply beautiful.. :)', '2005-09-07 23:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685195, 226081, 35545, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I''ve never seen anything that beavers have chewed on before.  Could you have shot it just to include the two branches the beavers gnawed?  The large trunk (?) at the bottom has good texture and color, but it overwhelms the picture.</td>', 'Interesting.  I''ve never seen anything that beavers have chewed on before.  Could you have shot it just to include the two branches the beavers gnawed?  The large trunk (?) at the bottom has good texture and color, but it overwhelms the picture.', '2005-09-07 23:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685196, 227661, 42837, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of sillhouetting the strong shape against a sunset texture. The sky could have been more remarkable however, and this doesn''t quite fit the branch theme being more a tree theme.</td>', 'I like the idea of sillhouetting the strong shape against a sunset texture. The sky could have been more remarkable however, and this doesn''t quite fit the branch theme being more a tree theme.', '2005-09-07 23:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685197, 227952, 41800, '<td valign="top">that is quite the effect. your picture is inventive and eye catching</td>', 'that is quite the effect. your picture is inventive and eye catching', '2005-09-07 23:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685200, 225236, 36462, '<td valign="top">interesting effect here.</td>', 'interesting effect here.', '2005-09-07 23:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685202, 228202, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, although I find the tree itself intriguing, my eyes are too distracted by the many fences.</td>', 'For me, although I find the tree itself intriguing, my eyes are too distracted by the many fences.', '2005-09-07 23:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685203, 226566, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good title.  I like the humor.  I also like the textures and colors.</td>', 'Good title.  I like the humor.  I also like the textures and colors.', '2005-09-07 23:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685204, 226346, 35545, '<td valign="top">What does a cabbage leave or a cabbage head have to do with branches?</td>', 'What does a cabbage leave or a cabbage head have to do with branches?', '2005-09-07 23:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685206, 228301, 38127, '<td valign="top">thats fun.. the light n shadows... ghostly feel.. I like it. Gave me pause</td>', 'thats fun.. the light n shadows... ghostly feel.. I like it. Gave me pause', '2005-09-07 23:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
