(1685211, 227496, 35545, '<td valign="top">I''d give you a higher mark if the picture was larger, and I could tell what it was.</td>', 'I''d give you a higher mark if the picture was larger, and I could tell what it was.', '2005-09-07 23:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685212, 228009, 38127, '<td valign="top">fun colours :)  liking the silhouette</td>', 'fun colours :)  liking the silhouette', '2005-09-07 23:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685214, 225391, 38127, '<td valign="top">great detail.. :)</td>', 'great detail.. :)', '2005-09-07 23:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685216, 228143, 43565, '<td valign="top">Neat sky.  I would like to see more of the tree.</td>', 'Neat sky.  I would like to see more of the tree.', '2005-09-07 23:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685218, 228323, 27421, '<td valign="top">Why so small? 5</td>', 'Why so small? 5', '2005-09-07 23:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685219, 228178, 38127, '<td valign="top">almost looks like its underwater.... some detail seems lost to me?</td>', 'almost looks like its underwater.... some detail seems lost to me?', '2005-09-07 23:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685220, 228008, 42837, '<td valign="top">For such a close textural study, I would have liked to see less details in the background distracting from the main subject.  Just the texture of the water maybe?</td>', 'For such a close textural study, I would have liked to see less details in the background distracting from the main subject.  Just the texture of the water maybe?', '2005-09-07 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685221, 225178, 41800, '<td valign="top">clever idea</td>', 'clever idea', '2005-09-07 23:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685225, 226529, 35545, '<td valign="top">This is really original.  I really like it.  I wonder if the picture would have been better without the tree?  That patch of sky is kind of distracting.  The shadow is quite powerful by itself.<br/> <br/>P. S. Is this the Chapala Lofts?</td>', 'This is really original.  I really like it.  I wonder if the picture would have been better without the tree?  That patch of sky is kind of distracting.  The shadow is quite powerful by itself. P. S. Is this the Chapala Lofts?', '2005-09-07 23:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685226, 228325, 41522, '<td valign="top">Your subject, IMO, is obscured by the background.  Perhaps a lower angle would have given more visual weight to the cactus.</td>', 'Your subject, IMO, is obscured by the background.  Perhaps a lower angle would have given more visual weight to the cactus.', '2005-09-07 23:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685227, 227466, 38127, '<td valign="top">love the feeling of this picture... desolate lonely but full of life ... I like the location of the tree in contrast to the big rock...</td>', 'love the feeling of this picture... desolate lonely but full of life ... I like the location of the tree in contrast to the big rock...', '2005-09-07 23:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685230, 228264, 17507, '<td valign="top">wow, what a beautiful place.<br/>I think this photo would be more effective if it were cropped to leave out the black windows and show the column/branches more clearly. In any case it''s a very nice picture, and a good exposure, with good highlights and rich shadows.</td>', 'wow, what a beautiful place.I think this photo would be more effective if it were cropped to leave out the black windows and show the column/branches more clearly. In any case it''s a very nice picture, and a good exposure, with good highlights and rich shadows.', '2005-09-07 23:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685231, 226492, 42837, '<td valign="top">A nice take on the theme, but without the title your close crop makes it kind of difficult to determine. The flash catching the blurry condensation on one pane seems to detract from the strong contrast and form of the structure also.</td>', 'A nice take on the theme, but without the title your close crop makes it kind of difficult to determine. The flash catching the blurry condensation on one pane seems to detract from the strong contrast and form of the structure also.', '2005-09-07 23:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685232, 226408, 35545, '<td valign="top">Not enough of this is in focus.</td>', 'Not enough of this is in focus.', '2005-09-07 23:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685233, 228043, 38127, '<td valign="top">almost would have liked this better with out the red bush blocking the horizon.. although its still beautiful</td>', 'almost would have liked this better with out the red bush blocking the horizon.. although its still beautiful', '2005-09-07 23:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685236, 225131, 35545, '<td valign="top">The background is too busy and too dark.  It''s hard to see the form of the branches.</td>', 'The background is too busy and too dark.  It''s hard to see the form of the branches.', '2005-09-07 23:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685237, 227091, 17507, '<td valign="top">this picture is DPC-tastic, and would probably do well in just about any challenge you entered it in--but aside from the rather incidental presence of a vine or small tree branch, I don''t think it meets this challenge particularly well.</td>', 'this picture is DPC-tastic, and would probably do well in just about any challenge you entered it in--but aside from the rather incidental presence of a vine or small tree branch, I don''t think it meets this challenge particularly well.', '2005-09-07 23:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685238, 228016, 42837, '<td valign="top">A nice study of tree rings, however I don''t think the choice of branch is clear enough in the shadow.</td>', 'A nice study of tree rings, however I don''t think the choice of branch is clear enough in the shadow.', '2005-09-07 23:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685239, 228230, 38127, '<td valign="top">The Sun spot in the middle made me think of the soul of the tree... I''d buy this.</td>', 'The Sun spot in the middle made me think of the soul of the tree... I''d buy this.', '2005-09-08 00:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685241, 227650, 17507, '<td valign="top">mmm...moss...lovely stuff, and difficult to photograph!</td>', 'mmm...moss...lovely stuff, and difficult to photograph!', '2005-09-08 00:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685242, 226002, 41522, '<td valign="top">Interesting ... For me, the harsh light is a distraction.</td>', 'Interesting ... For me, the harsh light is a distraction.', '2005-09-08 00:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685243, 226346, 17507, '<td valign="top">wonderful backlighting, especially where the thinner veins glow. I think the corner of white seriously detracts from this image.</td>', 'wonderful backlighting, especially where the thinner veins glow. I think the corner of white seriously detracts from this image.', '2005-09-08 00:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685244, 225906, 35545, '<td valign="top">I guess the branches are framing the river, but they are so dark,  I can hardly make them out.  I like the river scene.</td>', 'I guess the branches are framing the river, but they are so dark,  I can hardly make them out.  I like the river scene.', '2005-09-08 00:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685245, 228045, 17507, '<td valign="top">nicely different take on the challenge.</td>', 'nicely different take on the challenge.', '2005-09-08 00:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685246, 228323, 19035, '<td valign="top">nice composition, but you should take advantage of the 640 pixel size limit, yours is only 235 pixels.</td>', 'nice composition, but you should take advantage of the 640 pixel size limit, yours is only 235 pixels.', '2005-09-08 00:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685247, 228031, 38127, '<td valign="top">gnarled.. and beautiful .. nice angle the haze of the light coming through the top to the left is a bit distracting for me tho...  Gorgeous tree though :) thanks</td>', 'gnarled.. and beautiful .. nice angle the haze of the light coming through the top to the left is a bit distracting for me tho...  Gorgeous tree though :) thanks', '2005-09-08 00:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685248, 226993, 41522, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2005-09-08 00:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685249, 228245, 17507, '<td valign="top">yaaaaaay for the bellagio fountainssss</td>', 'yaaaaaay for the bellagio fountainssss', '2005-09-08 00:01:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1685251, 226680, 38127, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2005-09-08 00:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685252, 227659, 19035, '<td valign="top">nice silouhette and pleasant sky.</td>', 'nice silouhette and pleasant sky.', '2005-09-08 00:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685253, 227654, 42837, '<td valign="top">If there''s a bird hiding in a hole in the tree or a small animal hiding up there as it''s sanctuary then I can''t see it sorry. Otherwise I don''t see the connection to the title. The bottom half of the tree trunk could be cropped also to improve the composition</td>', 'If there''s a bird hiding in a hole in the tree or a small animal hiding up there as it''s sanctuary then I can''t see it sorry. Otherwise I don''t see the connection to the title. The bottom half of the tree trunk could be cropped also to improve the composition', '2005-09-08 00:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685254, 228222, 42404, '<td valign="top">Where''s the branch?</td>', 'Where''s the branch?', '2005-09-08 00:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685255, 226501, 41522, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this is too over-processed for my liking.  For me, this has gone beyond photography into digital art.</td>', 'Sorry, this is too over-processed for my liking.  For me, this has gone beyond photography into digital art.', '2005-09-08 00:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685256, 227283, 43565, '<td valign="top">Neat idea but the trees look out of focus</td>', 'Neat idea but the trees look out of focus', '2005-09-08 00:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685258, 227200, 19035, '<td valign="top">good find, I think I would have liked to see more of the scupture though.</td>', 'good find, I think I would have liked to see more of the scupture though.', '2005-09-08 00:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685259, 228203, 38127, '<td valign="top">wow..what a stunning fella... and what a RACK... *tilt*</td>', 'wow..what a stunning fella... and what a RACK... *tilt*', '2005-09-08 00:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685263, 228264, 38127, '<td valign="top">Life really does go on doesnt it? Love it</td>', 'Life really does go on doesnt it? Love it', '2005-09-08 00:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685264, 227538, 41522, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  The focus is just too soft.  Did you use a tripod?  If so, perhaps your processing is introducing some softness to the image?</td>', 'Cool idea.  The focus is just too soft.  Did you use a tripod?  If so, perhaps your processing is introducing some softness to the image?', '2005-09-08 00:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685265, 228150, 42837, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you were hoping to suggest a defiant remaining green leaf still clinging on with the weather getting colder? If so then one green leaf against a starker backdrop of tangled branches would have worked better.</td>', 'I''m guessing you were hoping to suggest a defiant remaining green leaf still clinging on with the weather getting colder? If so then one green leaf against a starker backdrop of tangled branches would have worked better.', '2005-09-08 00:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685266, 228279, 41800, '<td valign="top">creative, although I''m not really sure about it''s representation but it looks cool.</td>', 'creative, although I''m not really sure about it''s representation but it looks cool.', '2005-09-08 00:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685267, 227398, 19035, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene, the water is so blue....reminds me of a postcard.</td>', 'Lovely scene, the water is so blue....reminds me of a postcard.', '2005-09-08 00:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685270, 228230, 19035, '<td valign="top">I love the way the sun sneaks through the trunk of the tree. Well captured  .  7  .</td>', 'I love the way the sun sneaks through the trunk of the tree. Well captured  .  7  .', '2005-09-08 00:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685271, 225221, 42837, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely landscape shot, but seems to be depicting the main river rather than a branch or stream. sorry.</td>', 'This is a lovely landscape shot, but seems to be depicting the main river rather than a branch or stream. sorry.', '2005-09-08 00:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685272, 228051, 38127, '<td valign="top">what is it??? LOL ... too fun...</td>', 'what is it??? LOL ... too fun...', '2005-09-08 00:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685274, 226540, 19035, '<td valign="top">The whites seems a little blown out, but I like the theme of the photo.</td>', 'The whites seems a little blown out, but I like the theme of the photo.', '2005-09-08 00:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685276, 227944, 38127, '<td valign="top">I found a tree like that once... Perfect spot .. i like the sun sneaking in through the tops of the trees.</td>', 'I found a tree like that once... Perfect spot .. i like the sun sneaking in through the tops of the trees.', '2005-09-08 00:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
