(1685484, 228320, 42957, '<td valign="top">A different take on the challenge.  I like how the paper is so brown-yellowy-parchment-like.  Shadows are nice too.</td>', 'A different take on the challenge.  I like how the paper is so brown-yellowy-parchment-like.  Shadows are nice too.', '2005-09-08 01:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
