(1685487, 226750, 42957, '<td valign="top">Focus is off--I don''t know what I''m supposed to be looking at.  The trunk in the foreground, the branch in the middle, or the larger trunk in the back?  I do like the colors, however.</td>', 'Focus is off--I don''t know what I''m supposed to be looking at.  The trunk in the foreground, the branch in the middle, or the larger trunk in the back?  I do like the colors, however.', '2005-09-08 01:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685489, 228043, 43047, '<td valign="top">i am very impressed by the colors; great pic!</td>', 'i am very impressed by the colors; great pic!', '2005-09-08 01:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685491, 227197, 42404, '<td valign="top">I can barely see the branch.</td>', 'I can barely see the branch.', '2005-09-08 01:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685492, 227885, 42957, '<td valign="top">Nice colors--the yellow works well against the blue and whtie.  This photo is interesting because of the perspective.  I''d like it better I there was more texture on the trunk.</td>', 'Nice colors--the yellow works well against the blue and whtie.  This photo is interesting because of the perspective.  I''d like it better I there was more texture on the trunk.', '2005-09-08 01:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685493, 228217, 42837, '<td valign="top">Would like to see a sharper focus on the debris or whatever it is nestled in the bough of the branches. Very effective composition and framing.</td>', 'Would like to see a sharper focus on the debris or whatever it is nestled in the bough of the branches. Very effective composition and framing.', '2005-09-08 01:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685494, 226704, 42404, '<td valign="top">The topic should be the main focus and you shouldn''t cut it off either.</td>', 'The topic should be the main focus and you shouldn''t cut it off either.', '2005-09-08 01:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685496, 227590, 42957, '<td valign="top">I like how you actually have a subject ON the branch, not just a plain old branch like in other entries.</td>', 'I like how you actually have a subject ON the branch, not just a plain old branch like in other entries.', '2005-09-08 01:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685497, 227398, 32084, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  There is just a little too much background cluter in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the idea.  There is just a little too much background cluter in my opinion.', '2005-09-08 01:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685498, 226607, 15511, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. The tilted horizon looks unnatural. A boost of the greens would give this image more appeal.</td>', 'Very nice image. The tilted horizon looks unnatural. A boost of the greens would give this image more appeal.', '2005-09-08 01:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685500, 226756, 42404, '<td valign="top">Your main focus is not the topic of the challenge although it is a very nice picture of a castle thing.</td>', 'Your main focus is not the topic of the challenge although it is a very nice picture of a castle thing.', '2005-09-08 01:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685502, 227516, 43047, '<td valign="top">simple and beautiful; i like it very much - 9</td>', 'simple and beautiful; i like it very much - 9', '2005-09-08 01:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685503, 227486, 32084, '<td valign="top">Cool!  I like the different idea.</td>', 'Cool!  I like the different idea.', '2005-09-08 01:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685504, 228035, 42404, '<td valign="top">Where''s the branch?</td>', 'Where''s the branch?', '2005-09-08 01:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685506, 225643, 42957, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I don''t think this is a very nice nature competition.  I am supposed to look at the overrun hedges and bushes?</td>', 'I''m sorry, I don''t think this is a very nice nature competition.  I am supposed to look at the overrun hedges and bushes?', '2005-09-08 01:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685507, 228320, 32084, '<td valign="top">Good use of a classic shot.  It might have been even better if the text not seen through the eye glass were thrown out of focus.</td>', 'Good use of a classic shot.  It might have been even better if the text not seen through the eye glass were thrown out of focus.', '2005-09-08 01:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685509, 228009, 32084, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.</td>', 'Nice abstract.', '2005-09-08 01:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685510, 228247, 42957, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the unnatural green lighting.  I much prefer the brownish tones.</td>', 'I don''t like the unnatural green lighting.  I much prefer the brownish tones.', '2005-09-08 01:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685511, 228170, 42404, '<td valign="top">Isn''t your title part of a song??? I don''t know...It''s really neat though, I like how the branches in front are out of focus and yet you can see the tree clearly. Very nice.</td>', 'Isn''t your title part of a song??? I don''t know...It''s really neat though, I like how the branches in front are out of focus and yet you can see the tree clearly. Very nice.', '2005-09-08 01:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685513, 226160, 33672, '<td valign="top">This could be a ten without the overexposed areas! Great comp and subject Interesting.</td>', 'This could be a ten without the overexposed areas! Great comp and subject Interesting.', '2005-09-08 01:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685514, 228003, 42404, '<td valign="top">It shouldn''t be a view THROUGH the branches, it should actually be a view OF the branches. Since the challenge topic isn''t boats.</td>', 'It shouldn''t be a view THROUGH the branches, it should actually be a view OF the branches. Since the challenge topic isn''t boats.', '2005-09-08 01:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685515, 226505, 42837, '<td valign="top">Very witty, I like it. The composition would have been better balanced into thirds by cropping about 1/2 the cloud from the top. It''s taking too much attention from the braches imo.</td>', 'Very witty, I like it. The composition would have been better balanced into thirds by cropping about 1/2 the cloud from the top. It''s taking too much attention from the braches imo.', '2005-09-08 01:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685517, 225460, 32084, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That must have been a little un-nerving.  It is a little hot.  I wonder if some level adjustment or exposure compensation might have given more contrast.</td>', 'Wow!  That must have been a little un-nerving.  It is a little hot.  I wonder if some level adjustment or exposure compensation might have given more contrast.', '2005-09-08 01:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685518, 226951, 42957, '<td valign="top">I like small  birds.  Focus is a little off; colors would be richer.</td>', 'I like small  birds.  Focus is a little off; colors would be richer.', '2005-09-08 01:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685521, 226006, 43047, '<td valign="top">this is good :-)) very funny; nice purple; great pic - 9</td>', 'this is good :-)) very funny; nice purple; great pic - 9', '2005-09-08 01:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685522, 227612, 32084, '<td valign="top">Great find!  Maybe a little more contrast, but that is probably just a matter of personal taste.</td>', 'Great find!  Maybe a little more contrast, but that is probably just a matter of personal taste.', '2005-09-08 01:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685526, 228267, 42404, '<td valign="top">Way too dark buddy...</td>', 'Way too dark buddy...', '2005-09-08 01:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685527, 225651, 42957, '<td valign="top">I''d like the photo better if the background was black, or some other solid color.  The wood in the background is distracting and too similar to the branches.  I like the webs, however.</td>', 'I''d like the photo better if the background was black, or some other solid color.  The wood in the background is distracting and too similar to the branches.  I like the webs, however.', '2005-09-08 01:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685528, 227951, 32084, '<td valign="top">Nice find and great capture.</td>', 'Nice find and great capture.', '2005-09-08 01:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685529, 225852, 32084, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Great timing.</td>', 'Cool.  Great timing.', '2005-09-08 01:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685532, 226538, 42404, '<td valign="top">I really like the red in contrast to most of the gray in your picture. Also the water reflection (that is water right?) is excellent. Nicely portrayed.</td>', 'I really like the red in contrast to most of the gray in your picture. Also the water reflection (that is water right?) is excellent. Nicely portrayed.', '2005-09-08 01:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685534, 225906, 32084, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  A little hot in the center.</td>', 'Very pretty.  A little hot in the center.', '2005-09-08 01:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685535, 227379, 42957, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.  I don''t know what I think of the title.  I''d like to see more of the trunk, so it''d look like it''s climbing across the sky, or something.</td>', 'Very dramatic.  I don''t know what I think of the title.  I''d like to see more of the trunk, so it''d look like it''s climbing across the sky, or something.', '2005-09-08 01:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685537, 225906, 42404, '<td valign="top">Where''s the branch?</td>', 'Where''s the branch?', '2005-09-08 01:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685538, 227183, 32084, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good tonal range.</td>', 'Very nice.  Good tonal range.', '2005-09-08 01:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685539, 228003, 42837, '<td valign="top">Had you picked some of the leaves off and left some in such a way as to mirror the well caught pattern created by the boats this would have been more effective. The focus on the boats also makes the branch seem like a mistake and  it got in the way. They would still have been obvious as boats with their shape if you focused on the leaves and not them.</td>', 'Had you picked some of the leaves off and left some in such a way as to mirror the well caught pattern created by the boats this would have been more effective. The focus on the boats also makes the branch seem like a mistake and  it got in the way. They would still have been obvious as boats with their shape if you focused on the leaves and not them.', '2005-09-08 01:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685543, 226540, 42404, '<td valign="top">This photo is way overexposed. The kids are kind of pinkish too. I can''t see one boy''s eyes, if you''re taking a picture of someone''s face it is most important that you can see their eyeballs.</td>', 'This photo is way overexposed. The kids are kind of pinkish too. I can''t see one boy''s eyes, if you''re taking a picture of someone''s face it is most important that you can see their eyeballs.', '2005-09-08 01:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685544, 225999, 42837, '<td valign="top">The reflections are clear enough with the still water and well enough lit to be strong on their own. Cropping a lot of the top would have benn more powerful.</td>', 'The reflections are clear enough with the still water and well enough lit to be strong on their own. Cropping a lot of the top would have benn more powerful.', '2005-09-08 01:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685545, 225835, 42638, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture. I''m curious if color would have complimented it more.</td>', 'This is a great picture. I''m curious if color would have complimented it more.', '2005-09-08 01:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685546, 226801, 32084, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Great tonal range.  Maybe a crop to remove the lighter shaded item bottom left.  Still super though.</td>', 'Very nice.  Great tonal range.  Maybe a crop to remove the lighter shaded item bottom left.  Still super though.', '2005-09-08 01:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685547, 225836, 42404, '<td valign="top">SCARY!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'SCARY!!!!!!!!!!', '2005-09-08 01:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685548, 227609, 42957, '<td valign="top">I''d like the it if the background was more blurred and the closer leaves more focused.  I  don''t know what to look at.  Nice colors.</td>', 'I''d like the it if the background was more blurred and the closer leaves more focused.  I  don''t know what to look at.  Nice colors.', '2005-09-08 01:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
