(1685605, 228110, 19035, '<td valign="top">Original and well composed.  I like the grain of the photo, it adds character to the picture.  7.</td>', 'Original and well composed.  I like the grain of the photo, it adds character to the picture.  7.', '2005-09-08 01:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
