(1685610, 228256, 39243, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty shot. One slight thing catches my eye and that is a dark spot in the upper left of the photo that looks out of place. I know it is the petal but it still is kind of bothersome. Otherwise exellent. 8</td>', 'This is a very pretty shot. One slight thing catches my eye and that is a dark spot in the upper left of the photo that looks out of place. I know it is the petal but it still is kind of bothersome. Otherwise exellent. 8', '2005-09-08 01:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
