(1686802, 226780, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, but the technical flaws make it difficult to appreciate.  Lens flare has its place, but in this image the pinkish dot and purple banding don''t seem to have a purpose.  The sun is painfully blown out--perhaps if you had intentionally underexposed you could have drawn out the shapes of the branches more and reduced the sun to a more pleasing size.</td>', 'Interesting perspective, but the technical flaws make it difficult to appreciate.  Lens flare has its place, but in this image the pinkish dot and purple banding don''t seem to have a purpose.  The sun is painfully blown out--perhaps if you had intentionally underexposed you could have drawn out the shapes of the branches more and reduced the sun to a more pleasing size.', '2005-09-08 13:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
