(1687108, 227590, 32147, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF.  Perhaps this shot could use a touch more sharpness and/or a contrast adjustment to really bring the foreground and main subject out.  Also, it would be a much more interesting shot if the lizard was shot at a lower angle to make it look like you are sharing the branch with him.  Good luck in the challenge and keep shooting!</td>', 'Good use of DOF.  Perhaps this shot could use a touch more sharpness and/or a contrast adjustment to really bring the foreground and main subject out.  Also, it would be a much more interesting shot if the lizard was shot at a lower angle to make it look like you are sharing the branch with him.  Good luck in the challenge and keep shooting!', '2005-09-08 15:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1687110, 227198, 32147, '<td valign="top">whoa!  good detail.</td>', 'whoa!  good detail.', '2005-09-08 15:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1687114, 227515, 32147, '<td valign="top">the craggly old baren tree makes a good subject against the blue sky - and I like low angle shots like this.  It would be better if the sun flares were not there though.</td>', 'the craggly old baren tree makes a good subject against the blue sky - and I like low angle shots like this.  It would be better if the sun flares were not there though.', '2005-09-08 15:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
