(1687129, 227322, 37103, '<td valign="top">The colors are stunning.  The title really ties it to the "branch" theme.  It seems like the focus on the bird''s face could be a little sharper.</td>', 'The colors are stunning.  The title really ties it to the "branch" theme.  It seems like the focus on the bird''s face could be a little sharper.', '2005-09-08 15:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
