(1687132, 227215, 37103, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus behind the branches.  I wonder if this photo would be better appreciated in black and white.  The colors don''t add anything and the orange cast to the wood is too strong.  Nice subject.</td>', 'I like the soft focus behind the branches.  I wonder if this photo would be better appreciated in black and white.  The colors don''t add anything and the orange cast to the wood is too strong.  Nice subject.', '2005-09-08 15:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
