(1687262, 227451, 17507, '<td valign="top">I think this could have used a bit more black/dark grey, as it looks a little washed out right now. It should be easy to fix if you choose to do so. Still, this is a very pleasing image, and I''m sure you had to walk a good ways to get it! 7</td>', 'I think this could have used a bit more black/dark grey, as it looks a little washed out right now. It should be easy to fix if you choose to do so. Still, this is a very pleasing image, and I''m sure you had to walk a good ways to get it! 7', '2005-09-08 16:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1687274, 228009, 17507, '<td valign="top">wonderful colors and shapes. of course there are many photographs in this challenge that demonstrate a similar approach, but yours is the best I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'wonderful colors and shapes. of course there are many photographs in this challenge that demonstrate a similar approach, but yours is the best I''ve seen so far.', '2005-09-08 16:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1687293, 228031, 43031, '<td valign="top">Nice use of perspective, good focal range and detail. Would have been better possibly in B&amp;W or sepia. Some added contrast really helps. Maybe move around so that the leaves at the bottom aren''t in the shot, or you could have cropped the bottom 10-15%.</td>', 'Nice use of perspective, good focal range and detail. Would have been better possibly in B&W or sepia. Some added contrast really helps. Maybe move around so that the leaves at the bottom aren''t in the shot, or you could have cropped the bottom 10-15%.', '2005-09-08 16:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1687302, 227466, 37103, '<td valign="top">I love this craggy tree.  Great subject.  The grass looks very yellow and it is a little tough on my eyes.  Maybe you could tone down the yellow.  Really well suited to this challenge.  9.</td>', 'I love this craggy tree.  Great subject.  The grass looks very yellow and it is a little tough on my eyes.  Maybe you could tone down the yellow.  Really well suited to this challenge.  9.', '2005-09-08 16:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
