(1687311, 228170, 16488, '<td valign="top">I feel this already enigmatic photo suffers from odd choices made in post-processing.  The sky has become quite oddly pink and the blue fringing attracts attention.  These color shifts could add interest to an already strong photo with a well-defined subject,  just not this one.</td>', 'I feel this already enigmatic photo suffers from odd choices made in post-processing.  The sky has become quite oddly pink and the blue fringing attracts attention.  These color shifts could add interest to an already strong photo with a well-defined subject,  just not this one.', '2005-09-08 16:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1687319, 227357, 16488, '<td valign="top">The tendril is an interesting choice for this challenge, I just wish I could see the vine it came from--regardless, it doesn''t fit the challenge well, in my opinion.  Though you have chosen to limit the depth of field, a blurrier background could add more drama.  The highlights are a bit blown out as well.</td>', 'The tendril is an interesting choice for this challenge, I just wish I could see the vine it came from--regardless, it doesn''t fit the challenge well, in my opinion.  Though you have chosen to limit the depth of field, a blurrier background could add more drama.  The highlights are a bit blown out as well.', '2005-09-08 16:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1687322, 227322, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice bird picture.  The under-exposure loses much of the interesting detail in the feathers.  It would be nice to see a bit of light in the eye--as it is, the tip of the beak draws attention and then the eye hunts for something more to interest it...</td>', 'Nice bird picture.  The under-exposure loses much of the interesting detail in the feathers.  It would be nice to see a bit of light in the eye--as it is, the tip of the beak draws attention and then the eye hunts for something more to interest it...', '2005-09-08 16:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1687329, 225293, 16488, '<td valign="top">You have met the challenge topically, but I don''t see any other reason to be interested in this image.</td>', 'You have met the challenge topically, but I don''t see any other reason to be interested in this image.', '2005-09-08 17:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1687341, 227004, 16488, '<td valign="top">This subject had potential, but the difficult lighting situation has led to blown highlights.  The focus seems soft--perhaps a bit more contrast and sharpening would help.  The composition is ordinary--I don''t think centering the subject helps add dynamic to your image.  Because the background is complicated it is difficult for the eye to separate the branches on the man''s back--the point is thus lost.</td>', 'This subject had potential, but the difficult lighting situation has led to blown highlights.  The focus seems soft--perhaps a bit more contrast and sharpening would help.  The composition is ordinary--I don''t think centering the subject helps add dynamic to your image.  Because the background is complicated it is difficult for the eye to separate the branches on the man''s back--the point is thus lost.', '2005-09-08 17:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1687346, 225590, 16488, '<td valign="top">The evidence of technical ablity is here--in focus, well toned image.  But take away the challenge topic (which you have admittedly stretched) and what do you have?</td>', 'The evidence of technical ablity is here--in focus, well toned image.  But take away the challenge topic (which you have admittedly stretched) and what do you have?', '2005-09-08 17:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
