(1687574, 226805, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think this image would be much more effective if there was nothing behind the spanish moss to compete with it.  I don''t get much sense of what you were trying to do with the tones as the lighting is a little flat.  There seems to be no central subject.  But, you captured the texture well.</td>', 'I think this image would be much more effective if there was nothing behind the spanish moss to compete with it.  I don''t get much sense of what you were trying to do with the tones as the lighting is a little flat.  There seems to be no central subject.  But, you captured the texture well.', '2005-09-08 17:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1687575, 228232, 27460, '<td valign="top">bad lighting</td>', 'bad lighting', '2005-09-08 17:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1687577, 228320, 41838, '<td valign="top">Very neat take on the challenge!  Finally something that''s not brown and growing out of the ground!!!</td>', 'Very neat take on the challenge!  Finally something that''s not brown and growing out of the ground!!!', '2005-09-08 17:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
