(1689007, 227285, 34192, '<td valign="top">If you have something taking up so much of the foreground, chances are you want to have it in focus.  Otherwise it look like a mistake.  The alternative, for this image, would have been to move the ''branch'' on the left out of your field of view.  It hink that might have made a much stronger composition even with it out of focus.</td>', 'If you have something taking up so much of the foreground, chances are you want to have it in focus.  Otherwise it look like a mistake.  The alternative, for this image, would have been to move the ''branch'' on the left out of your field of view.  It hink that might have made a much stronger composition even with it out of focus.', '2005-09-09 00:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689012, 228330, 40344, '<td valign="top">Wonderful mood, the photo is captivating</td>', 'Wonderful mood, the photo is captivating', '2005-09-09 00:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
