(1689048, 228139, 40977, '<td valign="top">A great shot of Americana (unless it is somewhere else)...lol  Regardless I love the imagery and the tones.  The branch is there and I like that you went about it in an original way.....great job -- 8 --</td>', 'A great shot of Americana (unless it is somewhere else)...lol  Regardless I love the imagery and the tones.  The branch is there and I like that you went about it in an original way.....great job -- 8 --', '2005-09-09 00:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
