(1689518, 225635, 3554, '<td valign="top">ha! One of the best for this challenge I''ve seen yet, nice and original and a beautiful shot too! This has to be a top 10!</td>', 'ha! One of the best for this challenge I''ve seen yet, nice and original and a beautiful shot too! This has to be a top 10!', '2005-09-09 06:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689520, 225335, 3554, '<td valign="top">The border kills this one, it clashes really badly with the color in your shot! Good concept for the challenge.</td>', 'The border kills this one, it clashes really badly with the color in your shot! Good concept for the challenge.', '2005-09-09 06:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689522, 227965, 3554, '<td valign="top">Not screaming "branch" to me...</td>', 'Not screaming "branch" to me...', '2005-09-09 06:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689523, 227436, 3554, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge nicely, I like the dark on dark (fruit on background) it makes the branch stand out even more. well done</td>', 'Meets challenge nicely, I like the dark on dark (fruit on background) it makes the branch stand out even more. well done', '2005-09-09 06:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689525, 228170, 3554, '<td valign="top">I see grass and a tree with a forked trunk...Sorry but I dont really understand what you''re trying to do here.</td>', 'I see grass and a tree with a forked trunk...Sorry but I dont really understand what you''re trying to do here.', '2005-09-09 06:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689527, 228123, 3554, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract with interesting lighting and contrast. I like it.</td>', 'Nice abstract with interesting lighting and contrast. I like it.', '2005-09-09 06:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689528, 228037, 3554, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting!</td>', 'Love the lighting!', '2005-09-09 06:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689530, 228261, 3554, '<td valign="top">I dont understand where the branch is, it looks like a swing set. Seems a bit of a stretch.</td>', 'I dont understand where the branch is, it looks like a swing set. Seems a bit of a stretch.', '2005-09-09 06:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689531, 228211, 3554, '<td valign="top">Not a bad concept but its flat and doesn''t have anything to grab the viewer.</td>', 'Not a bad concept but its flat and doesn''t have anything to grab the viewer.', '2005-09-09 06:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689533, 227616, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think thats a trunk not a branch, heh.  I love the color of her dress contrast with the greens and browns. Nicely done.</td>', 'I think thats a trunk not a branch, heh.  I love the color of her dress contrast with the greens and browns. Nicely done.', '2005-09-09 06:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689534, 228318, 3554, '<td valign="top">My first reaction was "thats original!" I like it...except that the branch is obviously stuffed down his (her?) shirt sleave on the left which kind of ruins the magic.</td>', 'My first reaction was "thats original!" I like it...except that the branch is obviously stuffed down his (her?) shirt sleave on the left which kind of ruins the magic.', '2005-09-09 06:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689536, 227871, 3554, '<td valign="top">Thats a pretty big stretch....late entry maybe? The picture itself seems rather noisy as well, is that intentional?</td>', 'Thats a pretty big stretch....late entry maybe? The picture itself seems rather noisy as well, is that intentional?', '2005-09-09 06:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689537, 225651, 3554, '<td valign="top">Great concept for the challenge. The branches are the supporting pieces, but that works well here since without them the webs could not stay standing. Technically a little flat. Not sure how you''d get better perspective...</td>', 'Great concept for the challenge. The branches are the supporting pieces, but that works well here since without them the webs could not stay standing. Technically a little flat. Not sure how you''d get better perspective...', '2005-09-09 06:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689539, 226529, 3554, '<td valign="top">It took me a second but I was pleasantly surprised when I "got it"  well done!</td>', 'It took me a second but I was pleasantly surprised when I "got it"  well done!', '2005-09-09 06:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689540, 227903, 3554, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but doesn''t really grab me for "branch"</td>', 'Nice picture but doesn''t really grab me for "branch"', '2005-09-09 06:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689542, 228007, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the title  :)</td>', 'I like the title  :)', '2005-09-09 06:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
