(1689617, 227845, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - This is very nice.  Very nice capture, especially of the color.  Criticism; though I do like the soft detail on the moss/lichen(?), even more detail on that texture would make that stand out even more in my opinion.  I like the background of canopy.  I like the crop, especially with the perspective bottom left, but maybe a slightly sharper angle, or just more detail as described above, including on the ''new growth'', may have made this a better shot in my opinion.</td>', '8 - This is very nice.  Very nice capture, especially of the color.  Criticism; though I do like the soft detail on the moss/lichen(?), even more detail on that texture would make that stand out even more in my opinion.  I like the background of canopy.  I like the crop, especially with the perspective bottom left, but maybe a slightly sharper angle, or just more detail as described above, including on the ''new growth'', may have made this a better shot in my opinion.', '2005-09-09 07:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
