(1689623, 226124, 42984, '<td valign="top">Hell that''s a powerful image.  I don''t know what it is but it''s strong.  It''s 9 material but I''m not sure how branch it is so 8</td>', 'Hell that''s a powerful image.  I don''t know what it is but it''s strong.  It''s 9 material but I''m not sure how branch it is so 8', '2005-09-09 07:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689624, 226756, 40977, '<td valign="top">It has all sorts of branches.  I like this shot and the reflection in the water.  Well done.</td>', 'It has all sorts of branches.  I like this shot and the reflection in the water.  Well done.', '2005-09-09 07:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689625, 226839, 40977, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot...I love the creativity that went into this one.  Great Job.</td>', 'Very cool shot...I love the creativity that went into this one.  Great Job.', '2005-09-09 07:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689627, 228217, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice view, angle and capture.  Criticism; just the focal point really and perhaps the contrast.  More detail on the ''centre'', where the eye is drawn, would have possibly made this even more unique in my opinion.  I like the b/w (especially vs sepia in this shot), but wonder how the color would have looked, including if it would have ''allowed'' the dramatic texture to come to the fore more.  Perhaps a slight rotation or ''balancing'', not sure.  Also given the dark centre, not sure on the frame.</td>', '8 - Nice view, angle and capture.  Criticism; just the focal point really and perhaps the contrast.  More detail on the ''centre'', where the eye is drawn, would have possibly made this even more unique in my opinion.  I like the b/w (especially vs sepia in this shot), but wonder how the color would have looked, including if it would have ''allowed'' the dramatic texture to come to the fore more.  Perhaps a slight rotation or ''balancing'', not sure.  Also given the dark centre, not sure on the frame.', '2005-09-09 07:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689628, 228150, 42984, '<td valign="top">Applaud your depth of field, many many in th challenge haven''t managed that.  Thcomosition is just a littl too confuzzling for my liking</td>', 'Applaud your depth of field, many many in th challenge haven''t managed that.  Thcomosition is just a littl too confuzzling for my liking', '2005-09-09 07:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689630, 227908, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - This is very nice.  Criticism; Whilst I like the light shining through it is either too bright and thus detracting from the main subject, in my opinion, or else a different crop, cropping out half of the ''sunlight'', may have made this a better shot.  Like the toning, but the capture of the branches and the angle is what I like the best about this shot.  ''Feels'' like you are under an old and stately tree.</td>', '8 - This is very nice.  Criticism; Whilst I like the light shining through it is either too bright and thus detracting from the main subject, in my opinion, or else a different crop, cropping out half of the ''sunlight'', may have made this a better shot.  Like the toning, but the capture of the branches and the angle is what I like the best about this shot.  ''Feels'' like you are under an old and stately tree.', '2005-09-09 07:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689631, 227892, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good subject, I would look for a little more drama next time using composition''s "thirds" and fiddling with the saturation, light and contrast levels to try to inject some punch into it.  Not scored badly, you just could have maybe gotr an extra 1.5 points out of it</td>', 'Good subject, I would look for a little more drama next time using composition''s "thirds" and fiddling with the saturation, light and contrast levels to try to inject some punch into it.  Not scored badly, you just could have maybe gotr an extra 1.5 points out of it', '2005-09-09 07:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689634, 227411, 42984, '<td valign="top">My first 10 in this challenge  Stunning</td>', 'My first 10 in this challenge  Stunning', '2005-09-09 07:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689635, 227549, 42984, '<td valign="top">That is a professional shot of the pepper, excellent.  Pity the branch bit is just happens to be attached to it and is OOF. 6</td>', 'That is a professional shot of the pepper, excellent.  Pity the branch bit is just happens to be attached to it and is OOF. 6', '2005-09-09 07:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689636, 227695, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this shot and the potential here.  Criticism; the texture and patterns in the bark/wood could have been emphasized more with a closer focus/different angle, really making this more dramatic, in my opinion.  The colors are nice, but again, just a different angle, or maybe even crop, could have brought all these aspects out more, including the ''character(s)'' that can be seen in the shapes here.</td>', '7 - Like this shot and the potential here.  Criticism; the texture and patterns in the bark/wood could have been emphasized more with a closer focus/different angle, really making this more dramatic, in my opinion.  The colors are nice, but again, just a different angle, or maybe even crop, could have brought all these aspects out more, including the ''character(s)'' that can be seen in the shapes here.', '2005-09-09 07:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689637, 225961, 40977, '<td valign="top">Love the offset image. A really nice job.</td>', 'Love the offset image. A really nice job.', '2005-09-09 07:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
