(1689640, 228241, 40977, '<td valign="top">Nice job......somewhere between a dead calm and activity.  Very moody.</td>', 'Nice job......somewhere between a dead calm and activity.  Very moody.', '2005-09-09 07:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689642, 227587, 40977, '<td valign="top">Nice job on this shot. I like your choice to show detail in the track.  Again...nice job.</td>', 'Nice job on this shot. I like your choice to show detail in the track.  Again...nice job.', '2005-09-09 07:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689646, 226607, 40977, '<td valign="top">Like the off-centered composition and a minimalistic approach to the competition.  I think you did a great job on this shot.....very cool.</td>', 'Like the off-centered composition and a minimalistic approach to the competition.  I think you did a great job on this shot.....very cool.', '2005-09-09 07:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689647, 228252, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Really like the color capture and the texture in this, including the background.  Very nice and ''pure''.  Criticism; perhaps a little more ''balanced'', or more empty space top right may have made this better, not sure.  The same detail on the tip as is on the ''pod'' and leaves, would be nice but may have been difficult.  The little ''tips'' of branches top left and the two ''white dots'' back right, are a touch distracting and do detract, but not overly.  Really like the colors and that you can see the branch clear enough under that dense foliage.</td>', '8 - Really like the color capture and the texture in this, including the background.  Very nice and ''pure''.  Criticism; perhaps a little more ''balanced'', or more empty space top right may have made this better, not sure.  The same detail on the tip as is on the ''pod'' and leaves, would be nice but may have been difficult.  The little ''tips'' of branches top left and the two ''white dots'' back right, are a touch distracting and do detract, but not overly.  Really like the colors and that you can see the branch clear enough under that dense foliage.', '2005-09-09 07:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689648, 227951, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like this shot but think it as just a little more potential.  Perhaps that meant getting in the water, so, not sure.  Criticism;   Just incorporating more of the branch, a more ground level angle perhaps, may have made this a more dramatic shot in my opinion.  As for color vs b/w, not sure, I like the dramatic effect  here in the b/w but wonder if the branch would have been even more prominent in color.</td>', '7 - I like this shot but think it as just a little more potential.  Perhaps that meant getting in the water, so, not sure.  Criticism;   Just incorporating more of the branch, a more ground level angle perhaps, may have made this a more dramatic shot in my opinion.  As for color vs b/w, not sure, I like the dramatic effect  here in the b/w but wonder if the branch would have been even more prominent in color.', '2005-09-09 07:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689651, 228257, 40977, '<td valign="top">A great image...the first time around I scored yours in the middle, but I knew I wanted to come back and adjust.  I hope this does as well as it should. The colors are crisp, textures rich, and really just an excellent job on a simple image. True Photography :)</td>', 'A great image...the first time around I scored yours in the middle, but I knew I wanted to come back and adjust.  I hope this does as well as it should. The colors are crisp, textures rich, and really just an excellent job on a simple image. True Photography :)', '2005-09-09 07:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689652, 226140, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - This is a great shot and very good for the Challenge.  Criticism;   not much, maybe the bird slightly to the left more in the frame, different cropping, especially to excluse that bottom right blurred branch, would have made this a better shot in my opinion.  I like how you have managed to keep so many branches in focus, as well as the bird.</td>', '8 - This is a great shot and very good for the Challenge.  Criticism;   not much, maybe the bird slightly to the left more in the frame, different cropping, especially to excluse that bottom right blurred branch, would have made this a better shot in my opinion.  I like how you have managed to keep so many branches in focus, as well as the bird.', '2005-09-09 07:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689655, 227217, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice shot.  Great color, texture on the sand, ''composition'', natural too by the looks of it.  Criticism; whilst I like that I can discern the sand, sharper focus on the ''branch'', especially the ''points'', would have made this a better shot in my opinion.  Not sure, but seems the ''horizon''/balance needs a slight nudge up on the right hand side.  Good, unusual capture of nature.</td>', '8 - Very nice shot.  Great color, texture on the sand, ''composition'', natural too by the looks of it.  Criticism; whilst I like that I can discern the sand, sharper focus on the ''branch'', especially the ''points'', would have made this a better shot in my opinion.  Not sure, but seems the ''horizon''/balance needs a slight nudge up on the right hand side.  Good, unusual capture of nature.', '2005-09-09 07:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689661, 225651, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Indeed it is, but I think you have not ''grasped'' the full potential within this ''set''.  Criticism; I would like to have seen either a much tighter crop, different angle, possibly even close enough that only one or two webs/branches were in the frame.  The back fence (?), especially the posts/rails, detract too much from this shot.  There is just a lot more potential here in my opinion that is not captured.</td>', '6 - Indeed it is, but I think you have not ''grasped'' the full potential within this ''set''.  Criticism; I would like to have seen either a much tighter crop, different angle, possibly even close enough that only one or two webs/branches were in the frame.  The back fence (?), especially the posts/rails, detract too much from this shot.  There is just a lot more potential here in my opinion that is not captured.', '2005-09-09 07:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689664, 228035, 40977, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. I love the detail and the reflection</td>', 'Very cool shot. I love the detail and the reflection', '2005-09-09 07:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
