(1689927, 228284, 34192, '<td valign="top">The DOF on this is short so most of the image is out of focus.  For me, it doesn''t work as I don''t know what to focus on.  I think the lighting works to provide depth.  The black background contrasts nicely with the green.</td>', 'The DOF on this is short so most of the image is out of focus.  For me, it doesn''t work as I don''t know what to focus on.  I think the lighting works to provide depth.  The black background contrasts nicely with the green.', '2005-09-09 10:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
