(1690073, 227611, 40584, '<td valign="top">as a pilot, I must comment on this shot.  Very nice capture!  I''ve seen this routine several times at airshows and it is pretty cool, to say the least.  I admire your ability to catch it with such good focus, especially on the P51.</td>', 'as a pilot, I must comment on this shot.  Very nice capture!  I''ve seen this routine several times at airshows and it is pretty cool, to say the least.  I admire your ability to catch it with such good focus, especially on the P51.', '2005-09-09 11:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1690079, 225983, 40584, '<td valign="top">my eye seems drawn to the continuing track, not the dead end.  Hmmm...maybe it''s the ''tunnel'' of wire supports.  I like the coloration, though.</td>', 'my eye seems drawn to the continuing track, not the dead end.  Hmmm...maybe it''s the ''tunnel'' of wire supports.  I like the coloration, though.', '2005-09-09 11:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
