(1690128, 227060, 40584, '<td valign="top">Yep, I think that''s the ugliest tree I''ve ever seen.  Nice shot of it!  Lots of character.</td>', 'Yep, I think that''s the ugliest tree I''ve ever seen.  Nice shot of it!  Lots of character.', '2005-09-09 11:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
