(1691447, 227311, 35602, '<td valign="top">Unique perspective.  I looked at it for a long time and finally did see what looked like a head with many branches.  Focus was a bit soft, though the patina on the candle sconces was well done.  Overall, I see more of an image of a sheepdog rather than a gorgon.  See the jowel on the bottom, and the rounded mouth with a nose in the middle?  The image could be many things.</td>', 'Unique perspective.  I looked at it for a long time and finally did see what looked like a head with many branches.  Focus was a bit soft, though the patina on the candle sconces was well done.  Overall, I see more of an image of a sheepdog rather than a gorgon.  See the jowel on the bottom, and the rounded mouth with a nose in the middle?  The image could be many things.', '2005-09-09 21:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691451, 227496, 35602, '<td valign="top">The image is very soft and contrast is somewhat flat.  I tried a similar picture and chose not to do it for the same reason I see in this one, the additional reflection of the trees from the shore.  Makes the image confusing and hard to establish a focal point.</td>', 'The image is very soft and contrast is somewhat flat.  I tried a similar picture and chose not to do it for the same reason I see in this one, the additional reflection of the trees from the shore.  Makes the image confusing and hard to establish a focal point.', '2005-09-09 21:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
