(1692140, 227590, 41838, '<td valign="top">I think too many people misinterprated the challenge.  A photo doesn''t qualify for the branch challenge JUST BECAUSE there''s a branch somewhere in the photo.  Try getting more creative!</td>', 'I think too many people misinterprated the challenge.  A photo doesn''t qualify for the branch challenge JUST BECAUSE there''s a branch somewhere in the photo.  Try getting more creative!', '2005-09-10 02:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
