(1692296, 227451, 21084, '<td valign="top">Is it just me or does the rock on the right look like a face to you as well? it even has hair - showed my family and no-one else sees it!!!!<br/> Good picture -</td>', 'Is it just me or does the rock on the right look like a face to you as well? it even has hair - showed my family and no-one else sees it!!!! Good picture -', '2005-09-10 03:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692312, 227987, 21084, '<td valign="top">Greta photo- I would have cropped the bottom just below the bridge and above the light, I find all the action in the bottom too distracting from an otherwise fantastic shot 6/10</td>', 'Greta photo- I would have cropped the bottom just below the bridge and above the light, I find all the action in the bottom too distracting from an otherwise fantastic shot 6/10', '2005-09-10 03:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692338, 228034, 39007, '<td valign="top">Good concept and title, nicely shot 10</td>', 'Good concept and title, nicely shot 10', '2005-09-10 04:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692367, 226140, 42837, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2005-09-10 05:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692369, 228023, 42837, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective use of shape and line, and well placed focus.</td>', 'Simple and effective use of shape and line, and well placed focus.', '2005-09-10 05:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692370, 228022, 42837, '<td valign="top">The other elements are not strongly enough incorporated into the composition to have  been included, and seem distracting</td>', 'The other elements are not strongly enough incorporated into the composition to have  been included, and seem distracting', '2005-09-10 05:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692371, 228331, 42837, '<td valign="top">Says nothing about the branches in particular and is instead a shot of a tree.</td>', 'Says nothing about the branches in particular and is instead a shot of a tree.', '2005-09-10 05:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692372, 227438, 42837, '<td valign="top">Maybe if you had ''painted'' some additional light onto the branch with a flashlight or someting  it would have benn even stronger. Still a strong well composed shot though.</td>', 'Maybe if you had ''painted'' some additional light onto the branch with a flashlight or someting  it would have benn even stronger. Still a strong well composed shot though.', '2005-09-10 05:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692374, 225221, 39381, '<td valign="top">top 10</td>', 'top 10', '2005-09-10 05:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692375, 228195, 42837, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it''s fromcolours in  the post-processing or the initial shot itself but it appears too ''fuzzy''.</td>', 'I don''t know if it''s fromcolours in  the post-processing or the initial shot itself but it appears too ''fuzzy''.', '2005-09-10 05:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692378, 227573, 42837, '<td valign="top">Essentially a great shot,  I like the strong DOF, and form in the cherries as it is, and would like to see the strength of the line in the branch be stronger. Had the viewpoint moved back it would have made the cherries less the main subject and allowed them to regress to the backseat as no more than a beautifully caught decoration on the branch, and a focal point on the subject (the twig).</td>', 'Essentially a great shot,  I like the strong DOF, and form in the cherries as it is, and would like to see the strength of the line in the branch be stronger. Had the viewpoint moved back it would have made the cherries less the main subject and allowed them to regress to the backseat as no more than a beautifully caught decoration on the branch, and a focal point on the subject (the twig).', '2005-09-10 05:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692380, 226561, 42837, '<td valign="top">The twig is out of focus, and loses the strength in an otherwise simple composition</td>', 'The twig is out of focus, and loses the strength in an otherwise simple composition', '2005-09-10 05:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692381, 226769, 42837, '<td valign="top">The glare from the distracting objects bottom left is the biggest issue I see here, and a slightly different viewpoint would have solved this.</td>', 'The glare from the distracting objects bottom left is the biggest issue I see here, and a slightly different viewpoint would have solved this.', '2005-09-10 05:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692382, 227353, 42837, '<td valign="top">I see what you''re trying to say here, I guess they are your 3 kids. no? The bad focus and clumsy crop of the wheel all combine to make this a poor image and just a snapshot however.</td>', 'I see what you''re trying to say here, I guess they are your 3 kids. no? The bad focus and clumsy crop of the wheel all combine to make this a poor image and just a snapshot however.', '2005-09-10 05:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692383, 228274, 42837, '<td valign="top">Poor focus and uninteresting composition</td>', 'Poor focus and uninteresting composition', '2005-09-10 05:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692384, 227493, 42837, '<td valign="top">A strong shot otherwise, but maybe the gloomy dark and less focused foreground should be removed.</td>', 'A strong shot otherwise, but maybe the gloomy dark and less focused foreground should be removed.', '2005-09-10 05:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692385, 228003, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the photo''s definition isn''t the best... Colours seem a bit odd too (the water on the bottom of the photo makes it look like extreme curves treatment).</td>', 'Nice idea, but the photo''s definition isn''t the best... Colours seem a bit odd too (the water on the bottom of the photo makes it look like extreme curves treatment).', '2005-09-10 05:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692388, 228154, 42837, '<td valign="top">A strong composition and I like the relief from the theme of tree branches. To be a truly great shot however, I''d like to see outtakes of several versions at different times of the day. The direction of the light at the moment doesn''t sculpt the form as strongly as it could considering how strong the light is.</td>', 'A strong composition and I like the relief from the theme of tree branches. To be a truly great shot however, I''d like to see outtakes of several versions at different times of the day. The direction of the light at the moment doesn''t sculpt the form as strongly as it could considering how strong the light is.', '2005-09-10 06:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692389, 228257, 42837, '<td valign="top">I like the attempt to do something different, but without the title this fails to show me it''s a library at all.</td>', 'I like the attempt to do something different, but without the title this fails to show me it''s a library at all.', '2005-09-10 06:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692390, 227577, 41554, '<td valign="top">This is great, but there''s a lot of noise in this one. Also, colours on the sunny side of the grass seem a bit blown, this probably was taken using tele and then cropped a lot... But the photo is very well composed and I like it anyway.</td>', 'This is great, but there''s a lot of noise in this one. Also, colours on the sunny side of the grass seem a bit blown, this probably was taken using tele and then cropped a lot... But the photo is very well composed and I like it anyway.', '2005-09-10 06:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692391, 226467, 41554, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition, light and colours. A great pic.</td>', 'Fantastic composition, light and colours. A great pic.', '2005-09-10 06:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692392, 226769, 41554, '<td valign="top">Very simple, but very nice. Great.</td>', 'Very simple, but very nice. Great.', '2005-09-10 06:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692393, 227647, 42837, '<td valign="top">If the wings were to be the main subject then a tighter crop would have eliminated this confusion. As it is, the butterfly and the leafy brach it''s resting on are fighting too much for attention.</td>', 'If the wings were to be the main subject then a tighter crop would have eliminated this confusion. As it is, the butterfly and the leafy brach it''s resting on are fighting too much for attention.', '2005-09-10 06:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692394, 227451, 41554, '<td valign="top">A bit more contrast would do this good IMHO.</td>', 'A bit more contrast would do this good IMHO.', '2005-09-10 06:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692395, 225635, 41554, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2005-09-10 06:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692396, 227612, 42837, '<td valign="top">I like this one, subtle use of line, but could be more focused I think.</td>', 'I like this one, subtle use of line, but could be more focused I think.', '2005-09-10 06:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692397, 227654, 41554, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame this pic is soooo small... Very nice anyway...</td>', 'It''s a shame this pic is soooo small... Very nice anyway...', '2005-09-10 06:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692398, 228278, 42837, '<td valign="top">Not focused, which may be from camera shake considering the dark shot and a long exposure, maybe?</td>', 'Not focused, which may be from camera shake considering the dark shot and a long exposure, maybe?', '2005-09-10 06:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692399, 228310, 42837, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot, and spectacular use of colour well complemented. A good combination of line and shape.</td>', 'Stunning shot, and spectacular use of colour well complemented. A good combination of line and shape.', '2005-09-10 06:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692400, 227534, 42837, '<td valign="top">Not sure which element in the shot or post-processing has caused this but there''s an annoying halo effect very evident. Could be a combination of the strong light from the flash and over zealous sharpening later on maybe. The untidy crop on the top is poor too.</td>', 'Not sure which element in the shot or post-processing has caused this but there''s an annoying halo effect very evident. Could be a combination of the strong light from the flash and over zealous sharpening later on maybe. The untidy crop on the top is poor too.', '2005-09-10 06:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692401, 228252, 42837, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle colours, however the slash of light on the left disrupts the even effect. Should have gone for one or the other, shadow or sunlight.</td>', 'I like the subtle colours, however the slash of light on the left disrupts the even effect. Should have gone for one or the other, shadow or sunlight.', '2005-09-10 06:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692402, 225643, 42837, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t say anything about branches, and not even a strong nature shot either, looking more like a poorly focused snapshot in your garden.</td>', 'Doesn''t say anything about branches, and not even a strong nature shot either, looking more like a poorly focused snapshot in your garden.', '2005-09-10 06:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692404, 226701, 42837, '<td valign="top">I like the strong forms of the berries, and use of shape and line in the leaves and twig, but could have moved out to relax the composition more and make it a little about the berries and let them become simply an interseting decoration on the branch.</td>', 'I like the strong forms of the berries, and use of shape and line in the leaves and twig, but could have moved out to relax the composition more and make it a little about the berries and let them become simply an interseting decoration on the branch.', '2005-09-10 06:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692405, 226185, 42837, '<td valign="top">Too tight a crop to be a well shot tree, and too loose to find any particular branch.</td>', 'Too tight a crop to be a well shot tree, and too loose to find any particular branch.', '2005-09-10 06:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692406, 226801, 42837, '<td valign="top">Good contrast making a strong form, and good composition. The focus loses the potential of the texture however.</td>', 'Good contrast making a strong form, and good composition. The focus loses the potential of the texture however.', '2005-09-10 06:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692408, 225797, 42837, '<td valign="top">Brillant use of DOF and a great solution to the challenge. The subject placed bang on the middle of the composition loses power though, could be placed at the top and give the impression of space below the owl.</td>', 'Brillant use of DOF and a great solution to the challenge. The subject placed bang on the middle of the composition loses power though, could be placed at the top and give the impression of space below the owl.', '2005-09-10 06:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692410, 225546, 42837, '<td valign="top">Too much unnecessary action in the shot with the severe tilt, and not sharply focused.</td>', 'Too much unnecessary action in the shot with the severe tilt, and not sharply focused.', '2005-09-10 06:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692413, 227536, 42837, '<td valign="top">If you had moved around and ignored trying to use perspective to demonstrate the ''thick'' effect, and used the contrasting thin vertical lines of the tree trunks in the background with the thick horizontal line of the branch in the foreground this theme would have worked.</td>', 'If you had moved around and ignored trying to use perspective to demonstrate the ''thick'' effect, and used the contrasting thin vertical lines of the tree trunks in the background with the thick horizontal line of the branch in the foreground this theme would have worked.', '2005-09-10 06:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692419, 227001, 42837, '<td valign="top">A nice attempt to break with the convention of tree branches, and as a nature shot it''s very effective. But the wire has been lost by a combination of the strong light which has bled it away, the narrow focus which doesn''t pick out any point of the wire, and the action of the birds which completely dominate the composition and rob the attention of the viewer from the branch theme. If they were all settled in a uniform line with the shallow DOF picking out something more subtle like a brid with it''s head turned, or under it''s wing preening it would have been much closer to the challenge.</td>', 'A nice attempt to break with the convention of tree branches, and as a nature shot it''s very effective. But the wire has been lost by a combination of the strong light which has bled it away, the narrow focus which doesn''t pick out any point of the wire, and the action of the birds which completely dominate the composition and rob the attention of the viewer from the branch theme. If they were all settled in a uniform line with the shallow DOF picking out something more subtle like a brid with it''s head turned, or under it''s wing preening it would have been much closer to the challenge.', '2005-09-10 06:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692420, 226360, 42837, '<td valign="top">Not related to the theme enough since it''s a silhouette of a tree, and the odd composition with the line and shape touching slightly should be seperated.</td>', 'Not related to the theme enough since it''s a silhouette of a tree, and the odd composition with the line and shape touching slightly should be seperated.', '2005-09-10 06:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692421, 227616, 42837, '<td valign="top">This is a very well taken and sweet shot of your little girl.  But it won''t get as high a mark as it would have if it were a branch she were climbing on rather than a tree trunk.</td>', 'This is a very well taken and sweet shot of your little girl.  But it won''t get as high a mark as it would have if it were a branch she were climbing on rather than a tree trunk.', '2005-09-10 06:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692422, 227319, 42837, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the crop is too tight.</td>', 'Good idea, but the crop is too tight.', '2005-09-10 06:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692423, 228327, 42837, '<td valign="top">Great use of line, and nicely composed. A refreshing and very effective break from the norm in this challenge.</td>', 'Great use of line, and nicely composed. A refreshing and very effective break from the norm in this challenge.', '2005-09-10 06:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692426, 226992, 42837, '<td valign="top">Poorly lit with the shadows, and looks more like one for the family album.</td>', 'Poorly lit with the shadows, and looks more like one for the family album.', '2005-09-10 06:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692427, 227879, 42837, '<td valign="top">Is stronger with the bottom cropped out. And too dark, could be fixed by overexposing (openiing the aperture more than the camera lightmeter says you should) one fstop or so.</td>', 'Is stronger with the bottom cropped out. And too dark, could be fixed by overexposing (openiing the aperture more than the camera lightmeter says you should) one fstop or so.', '2005-09-10 06:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692428, 227451, 42837, '<td valign="top">The shadow loses the river and combined with the composition makes it seem like the rocks were what was being shot. Also, although I like that you took a chance and broke with the norm, without the title and lacking in any junction or ''branching'' in the waterflow it just makes it seem more like a shot of a river rather than a river branch specifically.</td>', 'The shadow loses the river and combined with the composition makes it seem like the rocks were what was being shot. Also, although I like that you took a chance and broke with the norm, without the title and lacking in any junction or ''branching'' in the waterflow it just makes it seem more like a shot of a river rather than a river branch specifically.', '2005-09-10 06:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692429, 228160, 42837, '<td valign="top">The bird seems a bit out of focus, and the challenge response would have been more strong by relaxing the focus on the bird and backing off. Then it becomes a beautiful and colourful jewel on a limb (branch) which reclaims the dominance of the composition.</td>', 'The bird seems a bit out of focus, and the challenge response would have been more strong by relaxing the focus on the bird and backing off. Then it becomes a beautiful and colourful jewel on a limb (branch) which reclaims the dominance of the composition.', '2005-09-10 07:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692431, 227402, 42837, '<td valign="top">Out of focus and doesn''t succeed in expressing the roots either.</td>', 'Out of focus and doesn''t succeed in expressing the roots either.', '2005-09-10 07:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692433, 227649, 42837, '<td valign="top">The crop could be tighter to concentrate on the sharply focused branches.</td>', 'The crop could be tighter to concentrate on the sharply focused branches.', '2005-09-10 07:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692434, 227425, 42837, '<td valign="top">Crop the whole left hand side of the shot and the vertical composition and tighter focus on the lightning is much much stronger.</td>', 'Crop the whole left hand side of the shot and the vertical composition and tighter focus on the lightning is much much stronger.', '2005-09-10 07:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692497, 228209, 41581, '<td valign="top">Startling contrast and balance.  It makes me think.</td>', 'Startling contrast and balance.  It makes me think.', '2005-09-10 09:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692500, 225461, 41581, '<td valign="top">Although it is difficult to see the ant, the aphids and plant''s contrasting hairs are well focused.</td>', 'Although it is difficult to see the ant, the aphids and plant''s contrasting hairs are well focused.', '2005-09-10 09:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692501, 226801, 41581, '<td valign="top">This is a good subject to render in black and white.</td>', 'This is a good subject to render in black and white.', '2005-09-10 09:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692503, 228011, 42837, '<td valign="top">The crop seems just a little too intense or tight.</td>', 'The crop seems just a little too intense or tight.', '2005-09-10 09:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692505, 227013, 42837, '<td valign="top">Looks too much like a snapshot, poorly cropped, and uncontrolled composition.</td>', 'Looks too much like a snapshot, poorly cropped, and uncontrolled composition.', '2005-09-10 09:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692506, 228031, 41581, '<td valign="top">I love the leading lines formed by the trunk''s unique texture!</td>', 'I love the leading lines formed by the trunk''s unique texture!', '2005-09-10 09:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692512, 227871, 42837, '<td valign="top">Aside from the blantant misunderstanding of the expression "branching out", from a purely technical standpoint the focus is off. The fur and whiskers should have been caught pin-sharp. The composition however is charming.</td>', 'Aside from the blantant misunderstanding of the expression "branching out", from a purely technical standpoint the focus is off. The fur and whiskers should have been caught pin-sharp. The composition however is charming.', '2005-09-10 09:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692517, 228221, 42837, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tripod with a long shutter speed would let you use a torch(flashlight) to paint the light more evenly and would have fixed both the harsh lighting form the flash and helped you pick up the drops more clearly. The composition would be improved also by not having the branch so central in the shot. And finally, the desat to b&amp;w isn''t so effective here, and would be better in colour with a splash of green from the leaves.</td>', 'Maybe a tripod with a long shutter speed would let you use a torch(flashlight) to paint the light more evenly and would have fixed both the harsh lighting form the flash and helped you pick up the drops more clearly. The composition would be improved also by not having the branch so central in the shot. And finally, the desat to b&w isn''t so effective here, and would be better in colour with a splash of green from the leaves.', '2005-09-10 09:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692520, 225651, 42837, '<td valign="top">A well caught effect, but loses a lot of impact with the fence in the background, and could be composed better with less enthuastic crop.</td>', 'A well caught effect, but loses a lot of impact with the fence in the background, and could be composed better with less enthuastic crop.', '2005-09-10 09:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692521, 226614, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast in lighting between the one branch and the entire rest of the background.</td>', 'I like the contrast in lighting between the one branch and the entire rest of the background.', '2005-09-10 09:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692522, 227918, 3554, '<td valign="top">I don''t think it really meets the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t think it really meets the challenge.', '2005-09-10 09:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692524, 228110, 42837, '<td valign="top">Seems to have just missed the facial features at the point of sharp focus, (maybe it''s excess noise?), and the crop is too tight to their arms. An interesting and original take on the challenge though, and has loads of potential for exploring the other branches of Abraham: Islam and Christianity as well, and how they interact.</td>', 'Seems to have just missed the facial features at the point of sharp focus, (maybe it''s excess noise?), and the crop is too tight to their arms. An interesting and original take on the challenge though, and has loads of potential for exploring the other branches of Abraham: Islam and Christianity as well, and how they interact.', '2005-09-10 09:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692529, 227417, 42837, '<td valign="top">A nice nature shot, but would be more suitable to this particular challenge if you pulled the frame out and make the line of the branch the subject, with the bird as an attractive feature on the branch, rather than the bird dominating the frame and focus. It could also be placed away from the very centre.</td>', 'A nice nature shot, but would be more suitable to this particular challenge if you pulled the frame out and make the line of the branch the subject, with the bird as an attractive feature on the branch, rather than the bird dominating the frame and focus. It could also be placed away from the very centre.', '2005-09-10 09:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692531, 227987, 42837, '<td valign="top">Looks like a tourist snapshot of a waterfall and some trees rather than saying anything in particular about branches.</td>', 'Looks like a tourist snapshot of a waterfall and some trees rather than saying anything in particular about branches.', '2005-09-10 09:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692543, 228139, 42837, '<td valign="top">The sign and swans (although nice elements) takes away a bit from the strong action happening with the young boy playing with the branch. You could have moved further left and closer so as to make him fill more of the shot, and catch some features like his shadow. And also resolve the direction of his gaze by either placing some space that way rather than placing the space at his back and making his face so close to the edge of the shot, or else get him to face back towards the direction you want the viewers focus (the brannch dragging inm the water).</td>', 'The sign and swans (although nice elements) takes away a bit from the strong action happening with the young boy playing with the branch. You could have moved further left and closer so as to make him fill more of the shot, and catch some features like his shadow. And also resolve the direction of his gaze by either placing some space that way rather than placing the space at his back and making his face so close to the edge of the shot, or else get him to face back towards the direction you want the viewers focus (the brannch dragging inm the water).', '2005-09-10 09:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692551, 228232, 42837, '<td valign="top">A poor choice of subject since you would have gotten more control of the lighting out of the car, and standing at the ATM. Also the yellow glow should be fixed by setting the WB correctly for candescent lights.</td>', 'A poor choice of subject since you would have gotten more control of the lighting out of the car, and standing at the ATM. Also the yellow glow should be fixed by setting the WB correctly for candescent lights.', '2005-09-10 09:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692558, 226538, 42837, '<td valign="top">A nicely composed shot, and nice balance between the line of the branch, the texture of the water and the form and colour of the flower. But just wondering if the WB was set for cloudy conditions since it seems very dark.</td>', 'A nicely composed shot, and nice balance between the line of the branch, the texture of the water and the form and colour of the flower. But just wondering if the WB was set for cloudy conditions since it seems very dark.', '2005-09-10 09:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692564, 225835, 42837, '<td valign="top">cropped too tight, and the the flatness of the b&amp;w would be much improved with the vivid colours I imagine are in the sky, leaves and pine-cone considering how strong the sunlight seems to be.</td>', 'cropped too tight, and the the flatness of the b&w would be much improved with the vivid colours I imagine are in the sky, leaves and pine-cone considering how strong the sunlight seems to be.', '2005-09-10 10:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692569, 227594, 42837, '<td valign="top">A good shot of the plant/factory whatever it is, but doesn''t fit the challenge, since the trees seem incidental to the main subject, and says nothing relating to branches of any kind.</td>', 'A good shot of the plant/factory whatever it is, but doesn''t fit the challenge, since the trees seem incidental to the main subject, and says nothing relating to branches of any kind.', '2005-09-10 10:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692580, 227306, 42837, '<td valign="top">An inventive and interesting take on the theme. Nice composition of elements: line in the tracks and shape of the bridge and the form in the switch apparatus. The focus on the switch seems slightly off though. Take the writing on the box beside it as an indication. 7</td>', 'An inventive and interesting take on the theme. Nice composition of elements: line in the tracks and shape of the bridge and the form in the switch apparatus. The focus on the switch seems slightly off though. Take the writing on the box beside it as an indication. 7', '2005-09-10 10:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692581, 227848, 42837, '<td valign="top">Seems unfocused, and the placing bang in the centre seems uninventive and dull.</td>', 'Seems unfocused, and the placing bang in the centre seems uninventive and dull.', '2005-09-10 10:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692588, 228222, 42837, '<td valign="top">I can''t see the connection to the theme "branch", sorry!. Not that i want to see a picture of a branch of course, but this link  just seems to be so tenuous as to be in the realms of Times crossword clues. An adorable pet pic however. Maybe a row of little pups suckling on mums belly would fit the theme you were aiming for?</td>', 'I can''t see the connection to the theme "branch", sorry!. Not that i want to see a picture of a branch of course, but this link  just seems to be so tenuous as to be in the realms of Times crossword clues. An adorable pet pic however. Maybe a row of little pups suckling on mums belly would fit the theme you were aiming for?', '2005-09-10 10:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692592, 228202, 42837, '<td valign="top">The effect of the wire fences takes a lot away from this unusual shape of the solitary branch on a dead tree. I like the thought process of trying to include the other close layer to both frame the tree and make the fences a feature though, and I kind of think you pulled it off. well done. 8</td>', 'The effect of the wire fences takes a lot away from this unusual shape of the solitary branch on a dead tree. I like the thought process of trying to include the other close layer to both frame the tree and make the fences a feature though, and I kind of think you pulled it off. well done. 8', '2005-09-10 10:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692596, 226357, 42837, '<td valign="top">The close macro shot is too much an insect shot and relegates the branch to the backseat missing the brief. Pulling out to relax the viewevers attention away from the caterpillar and let it camoflague itself would have fitted the challenge by bringing the branch back to centre stage and made this idea a lot stronger.</td>', 'The close macro shot is too much an insect shot and relegates the branch to the backseat missing the brief. Pulling out to relax the viewevers attention away from the caterpillar and let it camoflague itself would have fitted the challenge by bringing the branch back to centre stage and made this idea a lot stronger.', '2005-09-10 10:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692612, 227013, 16028, '<td valign="top">bummer!</td>', 'bummer!', '2005-09-10 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692613, 228216, 16028, '<td valign="top">the carpet sucks, but its a cool shot nonetheless.</td>', 'the carpet sucks, but its a cool shot nonetheless.', '2005-09-10 10:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692614, 227515, 16028, '<td valign="top">great subject, lighting seems off.</td>', 'great subject, lighting seems off.', '2005-09-10 10:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692618, 227918, 22937, '<td valign="top">Magnificent shot. With a little more contrast in it I would rank this action photo high.  Keep up the great work!</td>', 'Magnificent shot. With a little more contrast in it I would rank this action photo high.  Keep up the great work!', '2005-09-10 10:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692619, 225688, 16028, '<td valign="top">Wierd, but great, what happened to the bird?</td>', 'Wierd, but great, what happened to the bird?', '2005-09-10 10:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692620, 227944, 16028, '<td valign="top">Seems a little unsaturated? maybe you did it on purpose, pretty neat.</td>', 'Seems a little unsaturated? maybe you did it on purpose, pretty neat.', '2005-09-10 10:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692621, 226006, 16028, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot.</td>', 'Amazing shot.', '2005-09-10 10:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692622, 228232, 16028, '<td valign="top">im not diggin'' the yellow cast, good composition though.</td>', 'im not diggin'' the yellow cast, good composition though.', '2005-09-10 10:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692624, 227848, 16028, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop might do it better justice, but a cool shot anyhow.</td>', 'A tighter crop might do it better justice, but a cool shot anyhow.', '2005-09-10 10:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692627, 228154, 16028, '<td valign="top">too dark for my eye.</td>', 'too dark for my eye.', '2005-09-10 10:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692631, 228066, 40922, '<td valign="top">Nice - i like the colors -- good composition</td>', 'Nice - i like the colors -- good composition', '2005-09-10 10:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692643, 227944, 40922, '<td valign="top">Good exposure, dof, light. I wonder if the composition would be even better if the subject wasn''t in the center -- tho I''m not sure about that in this case. Nice job!</td>', 'Good exposure, dof, light. I wonder if the composition would be even better if the subject wasn''t in the center -- tho I''m not sure about that in this case. Nice job!', '2005-09-10 10:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692652, 227217, 16028, '<td valign="top">I really like it.</td>', 'I really like it.', '2005-09-10 10:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692658, 227183, 40922, '<td valign="top">Nice tones - wonderful sky. Not sure, but wonder if showing more of that dramatic sky would be even better? Good job!</td>', 'Nice tones - wonderful sky. Not sure, but wonder if showing more of that dramatic sky would be even better? Good job!', '2005-09-10 10:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692670, 227165, 38812, '<td valign="top">wow thats really cool!</td>', 'wow thats really cool!', '2005-09-10 10:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692681, 226529, 42837, '<td valign="top">The wall seems too busy and takes away from the striking shadow cast in the strong sunlight.</td>', 'The wall seems too busy and takes away from the striking shadow cast in the strong sunlight.', '2005-09-10 11:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692682, 228245, 42837, '<td valign="top">From another direction without the casino in shot would have worked better. You can see some nice forms in the ''branches'' around the other side. Perhaps you should have concentrated on those.</td>', 'From another direction without the casino in shot would have worked better. You can see some nice forms in the ''branches'' around the other side. Perhaps you should have concentrated on those.', '2005-09-10 11:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692683, 226827, 27514, '<td valign="top">looks like acadia national park very nice colors in the sky</td>', 'looks like acadia national park very nice colors in the sky', '2005-09-10 11:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692686, 228295, 42837, '<td valign="top">This would get a high mark for originality if only the focus was sharper.</td>', 'This would get a high mark for originality if only the focus was sharper.', '2005-09-10 11:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692689, 227402, 31403, '<td valign="top">all that''s missing is the hobbit - very nice</td>', 'all that''s missing is the hobbit - very nice', '2005-09-10 11:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692693, 228130, 42837, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, that''s hilarious! Seems to be a bit out of focus though.<br/></td>', 'Hahaha, that''s hilarious! Seems to be a bit out of focus though.', '2005-09-10 11:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692697, 226006, 42837, '<td valign="top">The bat is the subject here, and the branch seems to be nothing more than a prop. The post production effects look to be used purely for the sake of using effects too.</td>', 'The bat is the subject here, and the branch seems to be nothing more than a prop. The post production effects look to be used purely for the sake of using effects too.', '2005-09-10 11:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692703, 227180, 42837, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, and the skewed line of the river bank bang in the centre makes for a poor composition.</td>', 'Out of focus, and the skewed line of the river bank bang in the centre makes for a poor composition.', '2005-09-10 11:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692706, 226085, 41581, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot of a Chaffinch or Buchfink in German.<br/> <br/>The crispness of the leaves contrasts nicely with the softness of the bird.</td>', 'Very nice shot of a Chaffinch or Buchfink in German. The crispness of the leaves contrasts nicely with the softness of the bird.', '2005-09-10 11:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692707, 228264, 31403, '<td valign="top">love the colors, this is very nice</td>', 'love the colors, this is very nice', '2005-09-10 11:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692712, 226737, 41581, '<td valign="top">The individual elements of this shot are amazing, but taken all together, there is so much going on that it is distracting.</td>', 'The individual elements of this shot are amazing, but taken all together, there is so much going on that it is distracting.', '2005-09-10 11:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692713, 227695, 42837, '<td valign="top">A good find, and I like the contrasts and fluid forms, but the focus doesn''t lead the eye anywhere.</td>', 'A good find, and I like the contrasts and fluid forms, but the focus doesn''t lead the eye anywhere.', '2005-09-10 11:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692714, 226820, 27514, '<td valign="top">very dark</td>', 'very dark', '2005-09-10 11:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692717, 227843, 42837, '<td valign="top">Nothing to break the pattern or focus the eye on, and the twig in the foreground should be removed.</td>', 'Nothing to break the pattern or focus the eye on, and the twig in the foreground should be removed.', '2005-09-10 11:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692718, 227202, 41581, '<td valign="top">Lucious contrast!  Good focal length.</td>', 'Lucious contrast!  Good focal length.', '2005-09-10 11:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692723, 227566, 41581, '<td valign="top">A a different time of day, this might be a more successful shot.</td>', 'A a different time of day, this might be a more successful shot.', '2005-09-10 11:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692725, 225842, 31403, '<td valign="top">beautiful rays, pushing the greens in photoshop would really make this great</td>', 'beautiful rays, pushing the greens in photoshop would really make this great', '2005-09-10 11:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692726, 227466, 41581, '<td valign="top">Great composition and colors!</td>', 'Great composition and colors!', '2005-09-10 11:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692730, 226575, 42837, '<td valign="top">The badly focused branch in the foreground is distracting, but nice scale and idea.</td>', 'The badly focused branch in the foreground is distracting, but nice scale and idea.', '2005-09-10 11:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692731, 227425, 41581, '<td valign="top">Wow!  The subtle shift from light to dark really balances this shot out well.</td>', 'Wow!  The subtle shift from light to dark really balances this shot out well.', '2005-09-10 11:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692736, 228331, 31403, '<td valign="top">looks like your sensor needs to be cleaned</td>', 'looks like your sensor needs to be cleaned', '2005-09-10 11:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692737, 227549, 40977, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...love the pepper</td>', 'Nice shot...love the pepper', '2005-09-10 11:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692738, 227887, 40977, '<td valign="top">I love your shot.  One of the most interesting in the challenge.  I hope you do as well as IMO you should with this entry.  Great job.</td>', 'I love your shot.  One of the most interesting in the challenge.  I hope you do as well as IMO you should with this entry.  Great job.', '2005-09-10 11:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692739, 226543, 42837, '<td valign="top">The strange lighting from the flash (if that''s what it is) makes for an odd appearance on the branch, almost like it''s a composite image.</td>', 'The strange lighting from the flash (if that''s what it is) makes for an odd appearance on the branch, almost like it''s a composite image.', '2005-09-10 11:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692740, 227686, 40977, '<td valign="top">What an original idea. I like the shot, just wish the foreground was a bit more in focus...regardless a good shot -- 6 --</td>', 'What an original idea. I like the shot, just wish the foreground was a bit more in focus...regardless a good shot -- 6 --', '2005-09-10 11:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692742, 227528, 41581, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors!</td>', 'Stunning colors!', '2005-09-10 11:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692744, 225651, 40977, '<td valign="top">OMG - how cool is that!!  I night-time shot might have been a little darker (of course - lol), but mood darker ...anyway great shot.</td>', 'OMG - how cool is that!!  I night-time shot might have been a little darker (of course - lol), but mood darker ...anyway great shot.', '2005-09-10 11:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692746, 228295, 41581, '<td valign="top">Rich colors, good leading lines.</td>', 'Rich colors, good leading lines.', '2005-09-10 11:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692747, 227587, 31403, '<td valign="top">stunning, just love it, sorry no input - just admiration</td>', 'stunning, just love it, sorry no input - just admiration', '2005-09-10 11:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692748, 227680, 42837, '<td valign="top">Seems very dark, (maybe adjust your WB for cloudy conditions), and this causes the white rope to stand out and rob all the attention. A more muted colour than white would help.</td>', 'Seems very dark, (maybe adjust your WB for cloudy conditions), and this causes the white rope to stand out and rob all the attention. A more muted colour than white would help.', '2005-09-10 11:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692753, 227183, 41581, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of a composition that benefits from being cast in black and white.  The complete grey scale is represented, giving richness and depth to the shot.</td>', 'This is a great example of a composition that benefits from being cast in black and white.  The complete grey scale is represented, giving richness and depth to the shot.', '2005-09-10 11:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692759, 226820, 42837, '<td valign="top">Before I read the title I thought this was a clever analogy to the branch of the children of Abraham, with the Hijab on the model. Pity because it''s much stronger than a ninja?!?! holding a twig. Where''s the connection? <br/> <br/>Badly focused as well.</td>', 'Before I read the title I thought this was a clever analogy to the branch of the children of Abraham, with the Hijab on the model. Pity because it''s much stronger than a ninja?!?! holding a twig. Where''s the connection?  Badly focused as well.', '2005-09-10 11:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692762, 225480, 41581, '<td valign="top">This shot feels top heavy.  Cropping the bottom about half way up to the lower reflected branch would give it more balance.  Perhaps the reflected branches need more strength.  On the other hand, the light branches contrast well against the darkness.</td>', 'This shot feels top heavy.  Cropping the bottom about half way up to the lower reflected branch would give it more balance.  Perhaps the reflected branches need more strength.  On the other hand, the light branches contrast well against the darkness.', '2005-09-10 11:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692764, 227613, 41581, '<td valign="top">It feels as if the fruit should be in focus too.</td>', 'It feels as if the fruit should be in focus too.', '2005-09-10 11:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692765, 225842, 41581, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this one in high contrasting black and white.</td>', 'I would like to see this one in high contrasting black and white.', '2005-09-10 11:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692770, 227975, 41581, '<td valign="top">Way cool!  There''s a branch with personality!</td>', 'Way cool!  There''s a branch with personality!', '2005-09-10 11:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692772, 226852, 42837, '<td valign="top">It''s spelt dying. Despite this, the shot is uninteresting, the close crop and short DOF don''t seem to serve any purpose. Anything at all on the twig to break the monotony of the line would have helped: an insect, a bird... anything, and it needn''t even be in the foreground and in focus.</td>', 'It''s spelt dying. Despite this, the shot is uninteresting, the close crop and short DOF don''t seem to serve any purpose. Anything at all on the twig to break the monotony of the line would have helped: an insect, a bird... anything, and it needn''t even be in the foreground and in focus.', '2005-09-10 11:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692774, 225221, 40820, '<td valign="top">love the colors and the mottled light....8</td>', 'love the colors and the mottled light....8', '2005-09-10 11:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692777, 225131, 40820, '<td valign="top">shots taken in the fiddle of the day always tend to look a little "dry"</td>', 'shots taken in the fiddle of the day always tend to look a little "dry"', '2005-09-10 11:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692779, 225236, 42837, '<td valign="top">Too closely cropped and poorly positioned losing most of your subject off frame causing a poor composition. The desat picks out the red colour, but seems excessive (just for the sake of using it) and the branch would probably stand out well on it''s own anyway since it''s quite a striking red. The focus is terrible as well, considering the red branch is the only thing you want focused it''s just plain sloppy to lose most of it.</td>', 'Too closely cropped and poorly positioned losing most of your subject off frame causing a poor composition. The desat picks out the red colour, but seems excessive (just for the sake of using it) and the branch would probably stand out well on it''s own anyway since it''s quite a striking red. The focus is terrible as well, considering the red branch is the only thing you want focused it''s just plain sloppy to lose most of it.', '2005-09-10 11:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692783, 228143, 42837, '<td valign="top">cropping seems awkward</td>', 'cropping seems awkward', '2005-09-10 11:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692786, 227609, 42837, '<td valign="top">Nothing to break up the pattern and focus the eye.</td>', 'Nothing to break up the pattern and focus the eye.', '2005-09-10 11:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692791, 225635, 40820, '<td valign="top">pin sharp!!...nice caption too</td>', 'pin sharp!!...nice caption too', '2005-09-10 11:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692799, 226969, 42837, '<td valign="top">If the rest of the family tree was included in the background and the girls were specifically picked out using a close DOF this idea would be a lot stronger. Makes an adorable shot of the kids despite this. Great pose and interaction with the camera.</td>', 'If the rest of the family tree was included in the background and the girls were specifically picked out using a close DOF this idea would be a lot stronger. Makes an adorable shot of the kids despite this. Great pose and interaction with the camera.', '2005-09-10 11:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692803, 228281, 42837, '<td valign="top">Excellent find, and great form in the branch and texture in the bark.</td>', 'Excellent find, and great form in the branch and texture in the bark.', '2005-09-10 11:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692811, 227319, 41520, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of hard to tell what that really is. All of the lines kind of make me dizzy.</td>', 'It''s kind of hard to tell what that really is. All of the lines kind of make me dizzy.', '2005-09-10 12:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692813, 225931, 41520, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast, but I''m sure lots of people have probably told you that.</td>', 'I like the contrast, but I''m sure lots of people have probably told you that.', '2005-09-10 12:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692815, 227285, 41581, '<td valign="top">This shot really suffers from the unfocused plants in the front.</td>', 'This shot really suffers from the unfocused plants in the front.', '2005-09-10 12:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692817, 225480, 41520, '<td valign="top">It looks cool, but maybe it''s just a little too dark.</td>', 'It looks cool, but maybe it''s just a little too dark.', '2005-09-10 12:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692820, 227972, 41520, '<td valign="top">Is that a fence in the background? It''s too bad that was there.</td>', 'Is that a fence in the background? It''s too bad that was there.', '2005-09-10 12:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692825, 226002, 42837, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m having a blonde moment, but I dont get it!  :-? Seems badly focused and overexposed as well btw.</td>', 'Maybe I''m having a blonde moment, but I dont get it!  :-? Seems badly focused and overexposed as well btw.', '2005-09-10 12:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692826, 228245, 41520, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the slow shutter, looks awesome.</td>', 'I like the use of the slow shutter, looks awesome.', '2005-09-10 12:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692830, 227297, 42837, '<td valign="top">A charming pose well caught, but without the title this makes the shot seem irrelevant to the challenge, sorry!</td>', 'A charming pose well caught, but without the title this makes the shot seem irrelevant to the challenge, sorry!', '2005-09-10 12:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692831, 228279, 41520, '<td valign="top">I cant seem to see the branch in this photo.</td>', 'I cant seem to see the branch in this photo.', '2005-09-10 12:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692832, 227116, 41520, '<td valign="top">Everything in the photo seem to blend into eachother. It makes it hard to see anything at all.</td>', 'Everything in the photo seem to blend into eachother. It makes it hard to see anything at all.', '2005-09-10 12:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692835, 228003, 41520, '<td valign="top">It looks like you blew up the photo a little too much, the image quality could be better.</td>', 'It looks like you blew up the photo a little too much, the image quality could be better.', '2005-09-10 12:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692836, 228002, 42837, '<td valign="top">A stunning effect to break the branch, but the circle around the edge and the telephone wires are distracting.</td>', 'A stunning effect to break the branch, but the circle around the edge and the telephone wires are distracting.', '2005-09-10 12:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692837, 228318, 41520, '<td valign="top">A little too out there for me.</td>', 'A little too out there for me.', '2005-09-10 12:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692839, 227905, 42837, '<td valign="top">Cropped too tight losing impact because of the aggrevation of wanting to see what the crane is doing outside the crop.</td>', 'Cropped too tight losing impact because of the aggrevation of wanting to see what the crane is doing outside the crop.', '2005-09-10 12:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692841, 227200, 42837, '<td valign="top">Poorly lit, making it hard to see if it''s focused (which it doesn''t appear to be) and the tree in the background is placed badly.</td>', 'Poorly lit, making it hard to see if it''s focused (which it doesn''t appear to be) and the tree in the background is placed badly.', '2005-09-10 12:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692843, 228131, 42837, '<td valign="top">Check your WB is set for cloudy conditions because it seems dark and underexposed.</td>', 'Check your WB is set for cloudy conditions because it seems dark and underexposed.', '2005-09-10 12:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692847, 227610, 42837, '<td valign="top">Would have been better if you caught the shot during the day to remove the harsh flash from the branch. The plant pot and gun are trrelevant here as well. A charming shot, but one for the family album i think.</td>', 'Would have been better if you caught the shot during the day to remove the harsh flash from the branch. The plant pot and gun are trrelevant here as well. A charming shot, but one for the family album i think.', '2005-09-10 12:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692853, 226565, 42837, '<td valign="top">Hard to judge this shot properly since the image is so small. From what I can make out I like the strong use of line, and the splash of colour in the red leaves. Nice composition.</td>', 'Hard to judge this shot properly since the image is so small. From what I can make out I like the strong use of line, and the splash of colour in the red leaves. Nice composition.', '2005-09-10 12:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692857, 228045, 42837, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge, good use of line, and the position and composition manages to pick out the branch line as the focus of the shot very well.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge, good use of line, and the position and composition manages to pick out the branch line as the focus of the shot very well.', '2005-09-10 12:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692863, 226080, 42837, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit out of focus, and maybe trying to fill more of the shot with the wings than the body of the insect would get the point across better.</td>', 'Seems a bit out of focus, and maybe trying to fill more of the shot with the wings than the body of the insect would get the point across better.', '2005-09-10 12:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692865, 226408, 42837, '<td valign="top">Would have worked a lot better if you either cropped the foreground that''s out of focus, or else hold the focus on the foreground ''branches'' in the bark and move the camera back up to it''s current position before releasing the shutter. Nice idea though.</td>', 'Would have worked a lot better if you either cropped the foreground that''s out of focus, or else hold the focus on the foreground ''branches'' in the bark and move the camera back up to it''s current position before releasing the shutter. Nice idea though.', '2005-09-10 12:33:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1692868, 227210, 40703, '<td valign="top">I like it. Can''t explain why. Something different.</td>', 'I like it. Can''t explain why. Something different.', '2005-09-10 12:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692870, 227645, 42837, '<td valign="top">Underexposed, and doesn''t focus on the lines of the palm without the title telling you what''s going on.</td>', 'Underexposed, and doesn''t focus on the lines of the palm without the title telling you what''s going on.', '2005-09-10 12:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692874, 226660, 42837, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot, excellent use of light to create shape and form.</td>', 'Great macro shot, excellent use of light to create shape and form.', '2005-09-10 12:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692876, 225394, 42837, '<td valign="top">An out of focus tree doesn''t say enough about branches considering the challenge, other than it has some.</td>', 'An out of focus tree doesn''t say enough about branches considering the challenge, other than it has some.', '2005-09-10 12:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692878, 227611, 42837, '<td valign="top">A nice shot and different take on the theme, but considering the possibilities available since you''re all airborne it''s quite a flat composition.</td>', 'A nice shot and different take on the theme, but considering the possibilities available since you''re all airborne it''s quite a flat composition.', '2005-09-10 12:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692881, 226737, 24981, '<td valign="top">No doubt meets the challenge, but my beef with it is it seems flat. Shadows and blur go a long way to adding depth. Hope this helps.</td>', 'No doubt meets the challenge, but my beef with it is it seems flat. Shadows and blur go a long way to adding depth. Hope this helps.', '2005-09-10 12:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692884, 227542, 42837, '<td valign="top">Seems like the WB wasn''t set correctly considering the cloudy conditions since it''s dark. Good composition though, nice take on the challenge theme and the plume of exhaust/smoke/whatever adds action and movement to the shot.</td>', 'Seems like the WB wasn''t set correctly considering the cloudy conditions since it''s dark. Good composition though, nice take on the challenge theme and the plume of exhaust/smoke/whatever adds action and movement to the shot.', '2005-09-10 12:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692886, 226081, 42837, '<td valign="top">The burned corner should be cropped, and if the theme is suppossed to be the chewmarks from the beaver then the focus should be on the far branch cut.</td>', 'The burned corner should be cropped, and if the theme is suppossed to be the chewmarks from the beaver then the focus should be on the far branch cut.', '2005-09-10 12:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692897, 227839, 42837, '<td valign="top">Novel take on the tree theme, and the lighting makes a strong form.A small point though, it looks more like a tree trunk than a branch, but with such a close crop I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'Novel take on the tree theme, and the lighting makes a strong form.A small point though, it looks more like a tree trunk than a branch, but with such a close crop I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.', '2005-09-10 12:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692901, 227606, 42837, '<td valign="top">The Whitebalance (WB) needs to be set on your camera for such cloudy conditions to fix the darkness in the shot. Could do with arranging the compositrion a bit so the web is still evident but takes a smaller role and lets the branch seem more obvious.</td>', 'The Whitebalance (WB) needs to be set on your camera for such cloudy conditions to fix the darkness in the shot. Could do with arranging the compositrion a bit so the web is still evident but takes a smaller role and lets the branch seem more obvious.', '2005-09-10 12:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692904, 227180, 41581, '<td valign="top">I like the color and light in this shot, but I just can''t get past the tilt.</td>', 'I like the color and light in this shot, but I just can''t get past the tilt.', '2005-09-10 12:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692909, 228254, 42837, '<td valign="top">Great shot, well composed and excellent use of line. Suits the challenge well, and a novel approach. Seems slightly underexposed, but I''m guessing this was deliberate to try make the colours more vivid and enhance the impact of the silhouette.</td>', 'Great shot, well composed and excellent use of line. Suits the challenge well, and a novel approach. Seems slightly underexposed, but I''m guessing this was deliberate to try make the colours more vivid and enhance the impact of the silhouette.', '2005-09-10 13:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692914, 228285, 42837, '<td valign="top">Good shot great composition and subject, but the DOF seems a bit too narrow, and WB seems to need adjusting since it seems dark.</td>', 'Good shot great composition and subject, but the DOF seems a bit too narrow, and WB seems to need adjusting since it seems dark.', '2005-09-10 13:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692920, 226368, 24981, '<td valign="top">Can I have a cutting from this tree??</td>', 'Can I have a cutting from this tree??', '2005-09-10 13:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692921, 227283, 42837, '<td valign="top">The horizon looks tilted (may be an illusion caused by foreshortening of the shore).</td>', 'The horizon looks tilted (may be an illusion caused by foreshortening of the shore).', '2005-09-10 13:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692925, 228281, 40922, '<td valign="top">interesting tree and nice title  --  but it doesn''t work as an interesting subject for a  photo IMHO --</td>', 'interesting tree and nice title  --  but it doesn''t work as an interesting subject for a  photo IMHO --', '2005-09-10 13:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692927, 227698, 42837, '<td valign="top">A poignant shot, and an interesting way to break the monotony of a plain branch shot.</td>', 'A poignant shot, and an interesting way to break the monotony of a plain branch shot.', '2005-09-10 13:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692928, 227060, 40922, '<td valign="top">Crazy looking tree there. As a subject for the photo it lacks interest IMHO.</td>', 'Crazy looking tree there. As a subject for the photo it lacks interest IMHO.', '2005-09-10 13:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692931, 228190, 40922, '<td valign="top">The lighting is harsh and the subject here just doesn''t provide enough interest --</td>', 'The lighting is harsh and the subject here just doesn''t provide enough interest --', '2005-09-10 13:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692935, 227613, 42837, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, though the berry could have been caught in focus since it''s such a prominant part of the composition. I like it''s use to break up the branch and draw the eye though.</td>', 'Nice idea, though the berry could have been caught in focus since it''s such a prominant part of the composition. I like it''s use to break up the branch and draw the eye though.', '2005-09-10 13:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692938, 227285, 42837, '<td valign="top">Poor use of DOF, and makes the flowers in the foreground just seem like it''s in the way..</td>', 'Poor use of DOF, and makes the flowers in the foreground just seem like it''s in the way..', '2005-09-10 13:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692941, 226565, 40922, '<td valign="top">IMO the background is just too busy and distracting to get the viewer to focus in on the red. Also -- a larger pic works better for the viewer to be able to see the content of the photo<br/></td>', 'IMO the background is just too busy and distracting to get the viewer to focus in on the red. Also -- a larger pic works better for the viewer to be able to see the content of the photo', '2005-09-10 13:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692943, 226071, 42837, '<td valign="top">A nice idea though the execution is not as strong as it could be. The rippled pattern takes over the shot and breaks up the reflections of the branches up too much. A good shot for a water challenge, just not this one I''m afraid.</td>', 'A nice idea though the execution is not as strong as it could be. The rippled pattern takes over the shot and breaks up the reflections of the branches up too much. A good shot for a water challenge, just not this one I''m afraid.', '2005-09-10 13:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692947, 226860, 40484, '<td valign="top">like the interesting use of hue shift..find the rope-wire-? stickiing out the tree distracting</td>', 'like the interesting use of hue shift..find the rope-wire-? stickiing out the tree distracting', '2005-09-10 13:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692948, 228067, 40922, '<td valign="top">I like the mist idea -- but it comes across as too washed out. Also ... the backround elements/windows are distracting as is the clump of dead leaves hangin there.</td>', 'I like the mist idea -- but it comes across as too washed out. Also ... the backround elements/windows are distracting as is the clump of dead leaves hangin there.', '2005-09-10 13:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692952, 227516, 42837, '<td valign="top">Not sharp enough line, out of focus, and maybe some negative space arranged around the branch to accentuate the active pose.</td>', 'Not sharp enough line, out of focus, and maybe some negative space arranged around the branch to accentuate the active pose.', '2005-09-10 13:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692953, 227091, 40484, '<td valign="top">the light at the end of the tunnel tends to draw my eye there as a focal point instead of to the branch.</td>', 'the light at the end of the tunnel tends to draw my eye there as a focal point instead of to the branch.', '2005-09-10 13:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692954, 227964, 40922, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too harsh and the composition does not really create a point of interest. -- the tree or branch is too dominant</td>', 'The lighting is too harsh and the composition does not really create a point of interest. -- the tree or branch is too dominant', '2005-09-10 13:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692955, 226131, 42837, '<td valign="top">An eerie shot, a powerful image. Seems to be far off  trees rather than branches though.</td>', 'An eerie shot, a powerful image. Seems to be far off  trees rather than branches though.', '2005-09-10 13:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692957, 228042, 40922, '<td valign="top">Colors and exposure are well done -- IMHO the subject just doesn''t have enough interest as a photo</td>', 'Colors and exposure are well done -- IMHO the subject just doesn''t have enough interest as a photo', '2005-09-10 13:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
