(1692964, 227902, 40484, '<td valign="top">I like the way you framed the sun with the branches and captured the colors. I don''t like the antenna and roof....perhaps a closer crop?</td>', 'I like the way you framed the sun with the branches and captured the colors. I don''t like the antenna and roof....perhaps a closer crop?', '2005-09-10 13:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692966, 227549, 42005, '<td valign="top">I have viewed this many times and each time a different memory is evoked.  I am not a photographer but know I like this.  Thanks for sharing it.</td>', 'I have viewed this many times and each time a different memory is evoked.  I am not a photographer but know I like this.  Thanks for sharing it.', '2005-09-10 13:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692972, 227939, 42837, '<td valign="top">This is a brillant shot and the fact the ducks are so numerous actually adds to the branches attention rather than overpower it. would be almost perfect if one of the ducks had been picked out very sharply, like the lighter one for example (second in) bathed in light.</td>', 'This is a brillant shot and the fact the ducks are so numerous actually adds to the branches attention rather than overpower it. would be almost perfect if one of the ducks had been picked out very sharply, like the lighter one for example (second in) bathed in light.', '2005-09-10 13:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692973, 227496, 40484, '<td valign="top">nice composition, hard to tell about anything else though because of size of pic</td>', 'nice composition, hard to tell about anything else though because of size of pic', '2005-09-10 13:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692974, 228320, 42005, '<td valign="top">This picture makes me happy on many levels. Good work.  PS  What year dictionary did you use?</td>', 'This picture makes me happy on many levels. Good work.  PS  What year dictionary did you use?', '2005-09-10 13:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692977, 228123, 42837, '<td valign="top">Great composition, simple and effective, good contrast and strong form. Focus could be sharper.</td>', 'Great composition, simple and effective, good contrast and strong form. Focus could be sharper.', '2005-09-10 13:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692981, 228139, 42005, '<td valign="top">I like all the things going on in this picture.  The boy tugging, the geese swimming, the men sitting and lazing.  I enjoy the emotions evoked by the dark hole on the right, the light leaves or flowers on the left, the mystery of the weeping willow, the energy of the sun and its path.  Thank you for sharing.  The only thing which I found uncomfortable is the title.  But heck, maybe it will grow on me.</td>', 'I like all the things going on in this picture.  The boy tugging, the geese swimming, the men sitting and lazing.  I enjoy the emotions evoked by the dark hole on the right, the light leaves or flowers on the left, the mystery of the weeping willow, the energy of the sun and its path.  Thank you for sharing.  The only thing which I found uncomfortable is the title.  But heck, maybe it will grow on me.', '2005-09-10 13:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692982, 227091, 42837, '<td valign="top">Very striking image, and powerful silhouette, with the small splash of colour on the leaves, just enough to draw the eye. 10</td>', 'Very striking image, and powerful silhouette, with the small splash of colour on the leaves, just enough to draw the eye. 10', '2005-09-10 13:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692983, 227439, 42005, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and timely.</td>', 'Wonderful and timely.', '2005-09-10 13:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692992, 227972, 42837, '<td valign="top">The horizon line is tilted and seems very central. The stripes on the wall are distractiing too.</td>', 'The horizon line is tilted and seems very central. The stripes on the wall are distractiing too.', '2005-09-10 14:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692999, 228156, 42837, '<td valign="top">A clever shot, very subtle, although maybe a little too difficult to determine what''s going on. I initially thought it was a reflection in a window, but the writing isn''t backwards. I really like the layering of the light and silhouettes though.</td>', 'A clever shot, very subtle, although maybe a little too difficult to determine what''s going on. I initially thought it was a reflection in a window, but the writing isn''t backwards. I really like the layering of the light and silhouettes though.', '2005-09-10 14:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1693000, 226177, 42837, '<td valign="top">Could have pulled the narrow focal range out a bit so it catches the branch rather than just the stem of the petals.</td>', 'Could have pulled the narrow focal range out a bit so it catches the branch rather than just the stem of the petals.', '2005-09-10 14:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1693004, 225625, 42837, '<td valign="top">Must have been a really long exposure for something as slow as a caterpillar to blur like that.</td>', 'Must have been a really long exposure for something as slow as a caterpillar to blur like that.', '2005-09-10 14:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1693019, 227951, 42837, '<td valign="top">You could have cropped the waterfall closer to the branch wihtout losing any of the effectiveness of the movement of the water, but otherwise an excellent shot</td>', 'You could have cropped the waterfall closer to the branch wihtout losing any of the effectiveness of the movement of the water, but otherwise an excellent shot', '2005-09-10 14:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1693026, 225594, 42837, '<td valign="top">Strong from on the branch, and good use of line to break it up and add interest, but the crop is too tight and makes it upclear what''s attached to the branch.</td>', 'Strong from on the branch, and good use of line to break it up and add interest, but the crop is too tight and makes it upclear what''s attached to the branch.', '2005-09-10 14:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
