(1693288, 228256, 42837, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t fit the challenge imo since there''s no indication (apart from the title) that there''s a branch involved in this shot at all. A subtle and beautiful shot otherwise.</td>', 'Doesn''t fit the challenge imo since there''s no indication (apart from the title) that there''s a branch involved in this shot at all. A subtle and beautiful shot otherwise.', '2005-09-10 16:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
