(1694490, 228226, 42984, '<td valign="top">OK, this is awesome.  What a great subject, such beautiful colouring that gaurantees huge impact.  I think you have to miss out on the perfect 10 simply because the off-square verticals are not arty enough for you to get away with.  As a result it looks like sloppy post-p - which it may not be at all.  Notmally a dead-centred composition doesn''t work, but I tink the equal balance of stark yellow and stark blue lets you get away with it. - 9</td>', 'OK, this is awesome.  What a great subject, such beautiful colouring that gaurantees huge impact.  I think you have to miss out on the perfect 10 simply because the off-square verticals are not arty enough for you to get away with.  As a result it looks like sloppy post-p - which it may not be at all.  Notmally a dead-centred composition doesn''t work, but I tink the equal balance of stark yellow and stark blue lets you get away with it. - 9', '2005-09-11 05:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694512, 228323, 41701, '<td valign="top">Too small to see the details, which would have been nice because it''s a nice silhouette.  It seems a bit squashed though, but of course I don''t know how the surroundings are.</td>', 'Too small to see the details, which would have been nice because it''s a nice silhouette.  It seems a bit squashed though, but of course I don''t know how the surroundings are.', '2005-09-11 05:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
