(1694577, 226614, 42984, '<td valign="top">Quite an interesting allusion created here. When I first looked, I thought there was a hole in the conopy letting bright light through, but of course it is the reverse.  Quite striking</td>', 'Quite an interesting allusion created here. When I first looked, I thought there was a hole in the conopy letting bright light through, but of course it is the reverse.  Quite striking', '2005-09-11 08:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
