(1694581, 228325, 42984, '<td valign="top">Mmmm.  Great light, good composition, pure late light, i love it. If there was anything that could gain it another point, I wonder if it would be moving left when you took it and splitting the hill and the bush into complimentary elements whereas at the moment they tend to clash a little - 8</td>', 'Mmmm.  Great light, good composition, pure late light, i love it. If there was anything that could gain it another point, I wonder if it would be moving left when you took it and splitting the hill and the bush into complimentary elements whereas at the moment they tend to clash a little - 8', '2005-09-11 08:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694584, 225891, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nice ehteral feel to this, not sure what it represents but it does get the viewer involved with it and so it works</td>', 'Nice ehteral feel to this, not sure what it represents but it does get the viewer involved with it and so it works', '2005-09-11 08:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694610, 227340, 41554, '<td valign="top">The subject is too centered; also I think that a bit less DOF would do this good, as the background is a bit distracting. Good idea though</td>', 'The subject is too centered; also I think that a bit less DOF would do this good, as the background is a bit distracting. Good idea though', '2005-09-11 08:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694728, 226080, 2000, '<td valign="top">I would never have known that a dragon fly had so much detail to photograph.  The hot spot at the head, and a tighter crop than ideal will hurt the score a bit, but this is an amazing shot.  8</td>', 'I would never have known that a dragon fly had so much detail to photograph.  The hot spot at the head, and a tighter crop than ideal will hurt the score a bit, but this is an amazing shot.  8', '2005-09-11 09:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694732, 228320, 2000, '<td valign="top">It''s strange that the glasses are not magnifying the text; I would have expected that, but maybe they''re just weak reading glasses.  This is a unique take on the challenge, so a kudo for that.</td>', 'It''s strange that the glasses are not magnifying the text; I would have expected that, but maybe they''re just weak reading glasses.  This is a unique take on the challenge, so a kudo for that.', '2005-09-11 09:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694734, 227297, 2000, '<td valign="top">Nice bird shot, but if he''s sitting on a branch, I would like to see the branch... or at least some indication of where he is.</td>', 'Nice bird shot, but if he''s sitting on a branch, I would like to see the branch... or at least some indication of where he is.', '2005-09-11 09:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694742, 227143, 2000, '<td valign="top">The maximum size for a photograph is 640px on one side; your long side is 480px.  If this shot were submitted at full accepted size, I probably would have seen the goose sooner, and it would be much easier to give a fair score.  At this size, however, it is hard to really evaluate.</td>', 'The maximum size for a photograph is 640px on one side; your long side is 480px.  If this shot were submitted at full accepted size, I probably would have seen the goose sooner, and it would be much easier to give a fair score.  At this size, however, it is hard to really evaluate.', '2005-09-11 09:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694747, 228284, 2000, '<td valign="top">Aloe is such a cool plant to look at... a plant that has the healer inside to fix the cuts from the thorns.  I like the lighting here and the level of detail, though I think the DoF should be a touch deeper - just to the branch in the upper right corner would be in focus too.</td>', 'Aloe is such a cool plant to look at... a plant that has the healer inside to fix the cuts from the thorns.  I like the lighting here and the level of detail, though I think the DoF should be a touch deeper - just to the branch in the upper right corner would be in focus too.', '2005-09-11 09:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694751, 225411, 2000, '<td valign="top">Creative take on the challenge, and a nice rainbow catch.  The sky seems a bit noisy, but otherwise a very nice shot.</td>', 'Creative take on the challenge, and a nice rainbow catch.  The sky seems a bit noisy, but otherwise a very nice shot.', '2005-09-11 09:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694763, 228295, 2000, '<td valign="top">Just like the Robert Frost poem "The Road Not Taken."  I had to memorize that in 6th grade, and this shot is of that poem.  Detail is good, color is OK - keeping with the poem, the yellow tint is acceptable. 8</td>', 'Just like the Robert Frost poem "The Road Not Taken."  I had to memorize that in 6th grade, and this shot is of that poem.  Detail is good, color is OK - keeping with the poem, the yellow tint is acceptable. 8', '2005-09-11 10:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694765, 228222, 2000, '<td valign="top">And how does this relate to branch?</td>', 'And how does this relate to branch?', '2005-09-11 10:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694768, 227590, 2000, '<td valign="top">Very nice pose - be sure to thank the lizard for that.  Focus is good for this shot, and I like the level of detail.</td>', 'Very nice pose - be sure to thank the lizard for that.  Focus is good for this shot, and I like the level of detail.', '2005-09-11 10:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694795, 228157, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice twist. I like the green contrasting with the bleached wood.  It might look better with cleaner plants, but only to some. For me, I like the natural look.<br/> <br/>I felt this was a better picture technically than it was aesthetically.</td>', 'Nice twist. I like the green contrasting with the bleached wood.  It might look better with cleaner plants, but only to some. For me, I like the natural look. I felt this was a better picture technically than it was aesthetically.', '2005-09-11 10:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694797, 225593, 28710, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours. I come from apple country (Canada), and live in imported apples only country (Taiwan), so I appreciate the look of fresh tree-ripe apples.<br/> <br/>The only thing I would have experimented with perhaps would have been a little bit of fill flash to even out the shadows a bit, and sliding the crop over a couple of millimiters to lose that tiny shadow on the left.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, great contrast.</td>', 'Beautiful colours. I come from apple country (Canada), and live in imported apples only country (Taiwan), so I appreciate the look of fresh tree-ripe apples. The only thing I would have experimented with perhaps would have been a little bit of fill flash to even out the shadows a bit, and sliding the crop over a couple of millimiters to lose that tiny shadow on the left. Otherwise, great contrast.', '2005-09-11 10:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694799, 228241, 28710, '<td valign="top">Soft and gentle. Very nice. very well done with the composition on the reflections up and down.</td>', 'Soft and gentle. Very nice. very well done with the composition on the reflections up and down.', '2005-09-11 10:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694803, 227604, 28710, '<td valign="top">Great feel for the picture. DOF is a bit low, but that gives a feeling of depth. There appears to be a rainspot in the middle of the shot. I don''t think it takes away from the picture because it isn''t a print and it''s basic editing, but make sure you clean your lens before the next time you go shooting :). I like that the sky matches the mood perfectly, with just a little lumpiness.</td>', 'Great feel for the picture. DOF is a bit low, but that gives a feeling of depth. There appears to be a rainspot in the middle of the shot. I don''t think it takes away from the picture because it isn''t a print and it''s basic editing, but make sure you clean your lens before the next time you go shooting :). I like that the sky matches the mood perfectly, with just a little lumpiness.', '2005-09-11 10:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694805, 228081, 28710, '<td valign="top">Focus point is a little bit too close. There appears to be a bit of a bright haziness to the tops of the bugs. Direct sunlight? Cool procession though.</td>', 'Focus point is a little bit too close. There appears to be a bit of a bright haziness to the tops of the bugs. Direct sunlight? Cool procession though.', '2005-09-11 10:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694811, 228200, 28710, '<td valign="top">Apparently this is a picture on the broader definitions of branch. Technically, the focus is short, bringing out detail in the hair. Try manual focus? or focus lock and either focus bracket or move in and out a bit. I like the colour tone.<br/> <br/>It is an interesting picture to me because I am trying to find my "inner toy model" for my own shots, but I honestly can''t quite grasp the connection to branch. Thoughts branching out? Where is the branching? Looks more like an explosion.</td>', 'Apparently this is a picture on the broader definitions of branch. Technically, the focus is short, bringing out detail in the hair. Try manual focus? or focus lock and either focus bracket or move in and out a bit. I like the colour tone. It is an interesting picture to me because I am trying to find my "inner toy model" for my own shots, but I honestly can''t quite grasp the connection to branch. Thoughts branching out? Where is the branching? Looks more like an explosion.', '2005-09-11 10:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694818, 225635, 28710, '<td valign="top">Heh. More explicit pictures... what would my mother say?<br/> <br/>On second thoughts, I don''t think I care. What would I say? WOW nice DOF! You have the texture of their bodies down so well, I can feel the smoothness just by looking at them. The colours rock too.<br/> <br/>Stunning. 10.</td>', 'Heh. More explicit pictures... what would my mother say? On second thoughts, I don''t think I care. What would I say? WOW nice DOF! You have the texture of their bodies down so well, I can feel the smoothness just by looking at them. The colours rock too. Stunning. 10.', '2005-09-11 10:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694827, 228203, 28710, '<td valign="top">This is a really good picture because of the colours, and the detail in the eye.<br/> <br/>My only complaints are:<br/> <br/> the pose (the head is down at such an angle as to create an awkward line on the neck to the forelegs. Also, the eye appears defocused and disinterested. <br/> <br/>Slight overexposure and blowing of highlights on the antler tips.<br/> <br/>Slight bit of a stretch to fit antlers into a branch challenge. Close enough though. I feel that when the visual link to the challenge, the title should be used to make up for it. Antlers are clearly antlers and not branches.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, far better than I will ever do. Keep it up. I would guess that if you shot something this good, there''s probably some that were better that were not available to be posted in such a public forum.</td>', 'This is a really good picture because of the colours, and the detail in the eye. My only complaints are:  the pose (the head is down at such an angle as to create an awkward line on the neck to the forelegs. Also, the eye appears defocused and disinterested.  Slight overexposure and blowing of highlights on the antler tips. Slight bit of a stretch to fit antlers into a branch challenge. Close enough though. I feel that when the visual link to the challenge, the title should be used to make up for it. Antlers are clearly antlers and not branches. Otherwise, far better than I will ever do. Keep it up. I would guess that if you shot something this good, there''s probably some that were better that were not available to be posted in such a public forum.', '2005-09-11 10:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694829, 226177, 28710, '<td valign="top">Great red! Too bad about the blown pistil. Even worse about the shadow from what I guess is the camera in the lower right corner.<br/> <br/>Title brought the pic into the challenge theme.</td>', 'Great red! Too bad about the blown pistil. Even worse about the shadow from what I guess is the camera in the lower right corner. Title brought the pic into the challenge theme.', '2005-09-11 10:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694846, 225813, 28710, '<td valign="top">Yup, they are branches alright. If I may add some unskilled comments. <br/> <br/>1. looks like the horizon is a little tilted. I suspect it is closer than it looks, but the line on the tree near center is making me feel that it''s about two degrees too far clockwise. There is a tutorial for fixing that on this website.<br/> <br/>The picture seems to lack a subject. I can''t tell if you want me to look at the tall tree (which is off center and off thirds) or the branch sticking out of the water (which is on thirds - ish, but blanketed in darkness.<br/> <br/>Landscape pictures are usually intended to have a lot in focus and it appears that this pic does not have good focus on much. I hit this with a contrast jump and an auto levels in PS. It helped a bit.<br/> <br/>I wonder if it might have been possible to slide a bit more to the right and get the elements in the shot composed slightly differently. Maybe move downwards? Tough call, I don''t know if you were on the shoreline or in a boat...<br/> <br/></td>', 'Yup, they are branches alright. If I may add some unskilled comments.  1. looks like the horizon is a little tilted. I suspect it is closer than it looks, but the line on the tree near center is making me feel that it''s about two degrees too far clockwise. There is a tutorial for fixing that on this website. The picture seems to lack a subject. I can''t tell if you want me to look at the tall tree (which is off center and off thirds) or the branch sticking out of the water (which is on thirds - ish, but blanketed in darkness. Landscape pictures are usually intended to have a lot in focus and it appears that this pic does not have good focus on much. I hit this with a contrast jump and an auto levels in PS. It helped a bit. I wonder if it might have been possible to slide a bit more to the right and get the elements in the shot composed slightly differently. Maybe move downwards? Tough call, I don''t know if you were on the shoreline or in a boat... ', '2005-09-11 10:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694853, 228170, 28710, '<td valign="top">Strange colour, maybe push the colour a bit more with hue and saturation to bring out the odd pinkness in the sky? Seems to work with the purple CA on the grass.<br/> <br/>I''m afraid I can''t say I like the picture much though, sorry.</td>', 'Strange colour, maybe push the colour a bit more with hue and saturation to bring out the odd pinkness in the sky? Seems to work with the purple CA on the grass. I''m afraid I can''t say I like the picture much though, sorry.', '2005-09-11 11:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694855, 228066, 28710, '<td valign="top">Yum. gorgeous.</td>', 'Yum. gorgeous.', '2005-09-11 11:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694858, 227220, 28710, '<td valign="top">nice light.</td>', 'nice light.', '2005-09-11 11:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694864, 226357, 28710, '<td valign="top">Weird pic. I keep thinking I can see where the DOF is, but it''s soft in weird places to my eyes. Great choice of subject and background. It always helps to have a green caterpillar walking on a red branch eating green leaves.<br/> <br/>Too bad about the plastic bag (?) in the bottom of the pic. Not a 10, but it''s quite good.</td>', 'Weird pic. I keep thinking I can see where the DOF is, but it''s soft in weird places to my eyes. Great choice of subject and background. It always helps to have a green caterpillar walking on a red branch eating green leaves. Too bad about the plastic bag (?) in the bottom of the pic. Not a 10, but it''s quite good.', '2005-09-11 11:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694866, 226660, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice use of colours. A little too much light. This is a palm branch, but I must say that the picture is of leaves. Skirting the edges of the challenge definition here.</td>', 'Nice use of colours. A little too much light. This is a palm branch, but I must say that the picture is of leaves. Skirting the edges of the challenge definition here.', '2005-09-11 11:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694870, 225646, 28710, '<td valign="top">What a busy picture. Seems lik there is some animal or something just above center. I wonder if it would have been possible to crop a bit off the bottom and get rid of that (?) stone wall?<br/></td>', 'What a busy picture. Seems lik there is some animal or something just above center. I wonder if it would have been possible to crop a bit off the bottom and get rid of that (?) stone wall?', '2005-09-11 11:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694875, 228037, 28710, '<td valign="top">Great light. Soft pic though... Weird branch sticking up at the bottom. The crop isn''t too bad, Don''t take it personally, but I find it a bit uninteresting and unstimulating.</td>', 'Great light. Soft pic though... Weird branch sticking up at the bottom. The crop isn''t too bad, Don''t take it personally, but I find it a bit uninteresting and unstimulating.', '2005-09-11 11:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694878, 228327, 28710, '<td valign="top">Visual cue to branch - Check. <br/> <br/>Sharp lines and good dynamic range with high contrast causing a dynamic image - Check.<br/> <br/>Nicely done. I think I would have liked a tiny bit more of the left-most track I wonder if a dark border might have created a bit of illusion to help this?</td>', 'Visual cue to branch - Check.  Sharp lines and good dynamic range with high contrast causing a dynamic image - Check. Nicely done. I think I would have liked a tiny bit more of the left-most track I wonder if a dark border might have created a bit of illusion to help this?', '2005-09-11 11:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694882, 227217, 28710, '<td valign="top">Hmm. If I remember correctly, the presence of acacia (?) often indicates the presence of fire ants... Been a while since I''ve been to a beach like that though.<br/> <br/>This pic is excellent. The only things I would like to see better would perhaps be the inclusion of more on the left and the focusing on the tip of a thorn instead of where the twig is broken.<br/> <br/>Sweet colour though.</td>', 'Hmm. If I remember correctly, the presence of acacia (?) often indicates the presence of fire ants... Been a while since I''ve been to a beach like that though. This pic is excellent. The only things I would like to see better would perhaps be the inclusion of more on the left and the focusing on the tip of a thorn instead of where the twig is broken. Sweet colour though.', '2005-09-11 11:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694885, 228318, 28710, '<td valign="top">Wicked Tim Burton cue. Fine lighting, the teensiest bit too bright on the hand on the left which is almost totally immatterial. Superb use of shadow and maybe makeup on the eyes.<br/> <br/>Technically near perfect. Creatively outstanding.</td>', 'Wicked Tim Burton cue. Fine lighting, the teensiest bit too bright on the hand on the left which is almost totally immatterial. Superb use of shadow and maybe makeup on the eyes. Technically near perfect. Creatively outstanding.', '2005-09-11 11:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694891, 225651, 28710, '<td valign="top">Wow! I can''t think of anything to say. That''s usually good :) I really like the way this picture is bright. So many others would have tried to put a dark cast on it and it may have been a great picture too, but it wouldn''t have been the same. This is a picture about brightness, lightness, creative workmanship and interesting design.<br/> <br/>A bit too much is sliced off the right side. I would have cropped down another millimeter to get the top horizontal slat off on the top right.<br/> <br/>Fine work. Good eye. Glad you were quick to shutter, but slow to broom.</td>', 'Wow! I can''t think of anything to say. That''s usually good :) I really like the way this picture is bright. So many others would have tried to put a dark cast on it and it may have been a great picture too, but it wouldn''t have been the same. This is a picture about brightness, lightness, creative workmanship and interesting design. A bit too much is sliced off the right side. I would have cropped down another millimeter to get the top horizontal slat off on the top right. Fine work. Good eye. Glad you were quick to shutter, but slow to broom.', '2005-09-11 11:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694898, 226364, 28710, '<td valign="top">I''m sure everyone will say the same thing about the crop here. The focus on reflection shots is tricky. I got some fun ones myself when my mother picked some inky cap mushrooms and didn''t use them before they melted to ink.<br/> <br/>Your focus in the reflection is good enough to make out detail in the trunk of the tree and in the wood of the birdhouse... A bit too much is left of the background in the top left corner and because of the odd focal length used, it is in focus and is distracting.<br/> <br/>Nice concept though.</td>', 'I''m sure everyone will say the same thing about the crop here. The focus on reflection shots is tricky. I got some fun ones myself when my mother picked some inky cap mushrooms and didn''t use them before they melted to ink. Your focus in the reflection is good enough to make out detail in the trunk of the tree and in the wood of the birdhouse... A bit too much is left of the background in the top left corner and because of the odd focal length used, it is in focus and is distracting. Nice concept though.', '2005-09-11 11:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694899, 226827, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice looking pic. <br/> <br/>Branch?</td>', 'Nice looking pic.  Branch?', '2005-09-11 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694904, 226140, 28710, '<td valign="top">Very nice. This is too busy for anything but a branch themed shot. The title brings it together. A little less shadow on the bird would have been nice with a little more brightness to that redbreast.</td>', 'Very nice. This is too busy for anything but a branch themed shot. The title brings it together. A little less shadow on the bird would have been nice with a little more brightness to that redbreast.', '2005-09-11 11:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694907, 228222, 28710, '<td valign="top">Cute puppy. Nice capture.<br/> <br/>Branch?</td>', 'Cute puppy. Nice capture. Branch?', '2005-09-11 11:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694910, 227536, 28710, '<td valign="top">nice angle. Nice crop. Nice branch.</td>', 'nice angle. Nice crop. Nice branch.', '2005-09-11 11:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694911, 225580, 28710, '<td valign="top">Looks good, Nice lighting. Too bad about the softness.</td>', 'Looks good, Nice lighting. Too bad about the softness.', '2005-09-11 11:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694914, 228202, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice tree. Nice framing. Ugly Fence.<br/> <br/>That''s not your fault though, and you captured it well.</td>', 'Nice tree. Nice framing. Ugly Fence. That''s not your fault though, and you captured it well.', '2005-09-11 11:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694924, 227659, 22871, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure about this topic but this one look beautiful to me.</td>', 'i''m not sure about this topic but this one look beautiful to me.', '2005-09-11 11:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694927, 225330, 28710, '<td valign="top">While I think this photo is really great, I find there are a lot of distracting elements in it that are obviously way beyond the control of the photographer. <br/> <br/>The bird itself appears to merit a 10, but I can''t go there because of these distractions.</td>', 'While I think this photo is really great, I find there are a lot of distracting elements in it that are obviously way beyond the control of the photographer.  The bird itself appears to merit a 10, but I can''t go there because of these distractions.', '2005-09-11 11:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694929, 228278, 28710, '<td valign="top">Sorry, these don''t look young. Young branches are typically a brighter colour with a green core. They usually ahven''t gone to seed either. I''m probably not qualified to say this, but I think a slightly tighter crop on the bottom and the left would make this picture more appealing. I did not remove points for the young branch title.</td>', 'Sorry, these don''t look young. Young branches are typically a brighter colour with a green core. They usually ahven''t gone to seed either. I''m probably not qualified to say this, but I think a slightly tighter crop on the bottom and the left would make this picture more appealing. I did not remove points for the young branch title.', '2005-09-11 11:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694935, 227126, 28710, '<td valign="top">I assume the point of this picture was to depict a challenge to a tree-climbing youth based on the title? <br/> <br/>Technical issues would include blown area on the left, with chromatic aberrations, slight clockwise tilt, No focus anywhere in the picture and low contrast (probably the cause of the loss of focus) <br/> <br/>Good that you made the effort to submit though. It is always good when you see how you can improve. <br/> <br/>Suggestions might include cropping the left side off the shot and boosting contrast in PS. The shot ultimately needs to be retaken. It would be much more interesting if there was a young boy either looking up, contemplating climbing the tree or in the process of climbing the first few lower branches. A narrow vertical crop would add the feeling of height. Changing to a narower aperture (higher number) might make focusing a little easier.<br/> <br/>After writing all of that, I think I just noticed that there is a bird. Sorry.</td>', 'I assume the point of this picture was to depict a challenge to a tree-climbing youth based on the title?  Technical issues would include blown area on the left, with chromatic aberrations, slight clockwise tilt, No focus anywhere in the picture and low contrast (probably the cause of the loss of focus)  Good that you made the effort to submit though. It is always good when you see how you can improve.  Suggestions might include cropping the left side off the shot and boosting contrast in PS. The shot ultimately needs to be retaken. It would be much more interesting if there was a young boy either looking up, contemplating climbing the tree or in the process of climbing the first few lower branches. A narrow vertical crop would add the feeling of height. Changing to a narower aperture (higher number) might make focusing a little easier. After writing all of that, I think I just noticed that there is a bird. Sorry.', '2005-09-11 11:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694939, 225394, 28710, '<td valign="top">Uhm. It''s a tree. Still not liking the idea of trees being branches. Could you have walked closer and taken a picture that highlighted a branch?</td>', 'Uhm. It''s a tree. Still not liking the idea of trees being branches. Could you have walked closer and taken a picture that highlighted a branch?', '2005-09-11 11:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694943, 227577, 28710, '<td valign="top">Picturesque scene. You should have shot "Bambi" with a tranq and cleared away the cluttering branches.... oh uhm maybe not. <br/> <br/>Forgive me if I''m off on this, but this looks like a really well photoshop rescued pic. I voted another pic down because the visual cue on this pic is an antlered animal. The visual relationship to branch is a little too much for me. Not beyond reason though.</td>', 'Picturesque scene. You should have shot "Bambi" with a tranq and cleared away the cluttering branches.... oh uhm maybe not.  Forgive me if I''m off on this, but this looks like a really well photoshop rescued pic. I voted another pic down because the visual cue on this pic is an antlered animal. The visual relationship to branch is a little too much for me. Not beyond reason though.', '2005-09-11 11:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694944, 225643, 28710, '<td valign="top">Soft focus. This is a landscape. There is no clear highlighting of a branch.<br/> <br/>Nice colours though</td>', 'Soft focus. This is a landscape. There is no clear highlighting of a branch. Nice colours though', '2005-09-11 11:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694958, 227515, 6132, '<td valign="top">You should have tried this in black and white with a touch more contrast, it would have looked far more dramatic. Interesting composition which unfortunately slightly suffers from lens flare.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'You should have tried this in black and white with a touch more contrast, it would have looked far more dramatic. Interesting composition which unfortunately slightly suffers from lens flare.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2005-09-11 11:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694978, 226212, 22871, '<td valign="top">It''s simple enough it nice.</td>', 'It''s simple enough it nice.', '2005-09-11 12:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694995, 225852, 28710, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I can''t really agree with your branch interpretation. Not a full markdown as it almost fits. There is a very slight sun branch or sun beam coming off the trees below. It is overshadowed too much by the gash in the clouds.<br/> <br/>Technically, you know about the speck. Crooked horizon.<br/> <br/>Interesting sky pic though</td>', 'Sorry, I can''t really agree with your branch interpretation. Not a full markdown as it almost fits. There is a very slight sun branch or sun beam coming off the trees below. It is overshadowed too much by the gash in the clouds. Technically, you know about the speck. Crooked horizon. Interesting sky pic though', '2005-09-11 12:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695000, 228009, 28710, '<td valign="top">Yup. Nailed it.</td>', 'Yup. Nailed it.', '2005-09-11 12:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695007, 228008, 28710, '<td valign="top">What does a dog do?<br/> <br/>Bark.<br/> <br/>The fact that the title says departure can be applied to the subject which is both a departure from the tree, and a departure from the strict chalenge definitions. The fact that it does bear some resemblance to a branch helps bring this nicely in line.<br/> <br/>Nice detail in the shadows. Colours are a bit drab and that branch above the bark is quite distracting.</td>', 'What does a dog do? Bark. The fact that the title says departure can be applied to the subject which is both a departure from the tree, and a departure from the strict chalenge definitions. The fact that it does bear some resemblance to a branch helps bring this nicely in line. Nice detail in the shadows. Colours are a bit drab and that branch above the bark is quite distracting.', '2005-09-11 12:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695013, 226651, 28710, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Close to great. A slightly different composition  might have helped this one. Particularly on the sliced top end. Looks good though, keep up the work on this technique.<br/> <br/>I think partly the harsh shadows and lighting are a bit distracting as is the slightly odd interaction between beach tide line and horizon.</td>', 'Hmmm. Close to great. A slightly different composition  might have helped this one. Particularly on the sliced top end. Looks good though, keep up the work on this technique. I think partly the harsh shadows and lighting are a bit distracting as is the slightly odd interaction between beach tide line and horizon.', '2005-09-11 12:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695021, 228012, 28710, '<td valign="top">Simplicity is power in pictures, particularly of pre-pickable peppers and poor pock-marked leaves prowled by peckish pint-sized pests.</td>', 'Simplicity is power in pictures, particularly of pre-pickable peppers and poor pock-marked leaves prowled by peckish pint-sized pests.', '2005-09-11 12:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
