(1695037, 227353, 28710, '<td valign="top">On the branch?<br/> <br/>You mean from a branch? <br/> <br/>Kind of shap-shottish. I''m guessing someone else will say that though. <br/> <br/>Composition seems to be without direction.</td>', 'On the branch? You mean from a branch?  Kind of shap-shottish. I''m guessing someone else will say that though.  Composition seems to be without direction.', '2005-09-11 12:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
