(1695046, 226992, 28710, '<td valign="top">Fun picture. Have you experimented with using fill flash? Great crop.<br/> <br/>Maybe it would be improved by increasing contrast and a little bit of levels?</td>', 'Fun picture. Have you experimented with using fill flash? Great crop. Maybe it would be improved by increasing contrast and a little bit of levels?', '2005-09-11 12:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
