(1695054, 226686, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid contrast with the blue sky. Crisp focus and good detailing on the tree.</td>', 'Nice vivid contrast with the blue sky. Crisp focus and good detailing on the tree.', '2005-09-11 12:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695056, 227547, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of leaves.<br/> <br/>A bit of a stretch for branch because nothing is being highlighted about the branch, and the mood of the picture is set by the leaves. I''m not being too harsh in voting though, I just wanted you to know my feelings on the subject.</td>', 'Nice picture of leaves. A bit of a stretch for branch because nothing is being highlighted about the branch, and the mood of the picture is set by the leaves. I''m not being too harsh in voting though, I just wanted you to know my feelings on the subject.', '2005-09-11 12:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695058, 225590, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this. I might desat the yellow a bit and play with curves to enrich the overall sense of it.  This is different and her playful movement is a nice change in this challenge.</td>', 'I like this. I might desat the yellow a bit and play with curves to enrich the overall sense of it.  This is different and her playful movement is a nice change in this challenge.', '2005-09-11 12:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695065, 228252, 28710, '<td valign="top">Spruce?<br/> <br/>Tip. To really bring out the blues, bury a whole mess of pennies in near the roots. Long term colour adjustment. Only really useful if this is at your house.</td>', 'Spruce? Tip. To really bring out the blues, bury a whole mess of pennies in near the roots. Long term colour adjustment. Only really useful if this is at your house.', '2005-09-11 12:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695066, 225696, 15711, '<td valign="top">Good DOF. I like this in black and white.  I wish the lower branch were more focused to showcase the detailing.</td>', 'Good DOF. I like this in black and white.  I wish the lower branch were more focused to showcase the detailing.', '2005-09-11 12:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695072, 228271, 28710, '<td valign="top">Slight double meaning on the branch in the context of family tree. Great effect from glowing "blown" areas.<br/> <br/>Excellent - 10</td>', 'Slight double meaning on the branch in the context of family tree. Great effect from glowing "blown" areas. Excellent - 10', '2005-09-11 12:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695073, 226750, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice look.</td>', 'Nice look.', '2005-09-11 12:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695074, 226575, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very springlike.  The blurred leaves in the foreground actually frame the shot, so they don''t bother me like they would if there were only one. The greens are pretty. I wish the zoom were more tight so we could see more details of the butterfly.</td>', 'Very springlike.  The blurred leaves in the foreground actually frame the shot, so they don''t bother me like they would if there were only one. The greens are pretty. I wish the zoom were more tight so we could see more details of the butterfly.', '2005-09-11 12:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695077, 228157, 15711, '<td valign="top">GOod detailing and placement of the V. The colors are natural and overall, this is nicely composed. I sense that there is a touch more focusing that could be done, but overall, nice. 8</td>', 'GOod detailing and placement of the V. The colors are natural and overall, this is nicely composed. I sense that there is a touch more focusing that could be done, but overall, nice. 8', '2005-09-11 12:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695083, 226536, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of this.  I would work on the colors a bit - it seems overly orange to me. Probably the lighting and the time of day.  Play with adjusting curves and it might solve the problem. Interesting DOF.</td>', 'I really like the idea of this.  I would work on the colors a bit - it seems overly orange to me. Probably the lighting and the time of day.  Play with adjusting curves and it might solve the problem. Interesting DOF.', '2005-09-11 12:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695086, 227519, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice mood, nice colours. Super nice sun.<br/> <br/>The bottom line is that this is a tree, not a branch. Your title highlights the branches though.<br/> <br/>Bit of a speck just to the right of center.</td>', 'Nice mood, nice colours. Super nice sun. The bottom line is that this is a tree, not a branch. Your title highlights the branches though. Bit of a speck just to the right of center.', '2005-09-11 12:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695089, 227516, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the lonely sense of this against the golden sky. The lower rocky base is a tad distracting. I think you could crop it out or just show a tiny bit, to ground the branch, and it might be more effective. 7</td>', 'I like the lonely sense of this against the golden sky. The lower rocky base is a tad distracting. I think you could crop it out or just show a tiny bit, to ground the branch, and it might be more effective. 7', '2005-09-11 12:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695091, 228310, 28710, '<td valign="top">VERY nice.</td>', 'VERY nice.', '2005-09-11 12:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695099, 226405, 28710, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I''m not much of a drinker, don''t really know what branch water is.<br/> <br/>Nice looking pic tho</td>', 'Sorry, I''m not much of a drinker, don''t really know what branch water is. Nice looking pic tho', '2005-09-11 12:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695101, 225651, 15711, '<td valign="top">This shot has great potential.  Since the color of the fence doesn''t add anything to the shot, I think I''d go with black and white, boost the contrast and those wonderful spider webs would really POP.  The light is well done to showcase them with the existing monochromatic theme.  7</td>', 'This shot has great potential.  Since the color of the fence doesn''t add anything to the shot, I think I''d go with black and white, boost the contrast and those wonderful spider webs would really POP.  The light is well done to showcase them with the existing monochromatic theme.  7', '2005-09-11 12:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695104, 227534, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like the DOF of this.  IT seems slightly out of focus - maybe it''s my old eyes. LOL  Nice colors and the contrast of the pink and green give it some pop. 7</td>', 'I really like the DOF of this.  IT seems slightly out of focus - maybe it''s my old eyes. LOL  Nice colors and the contrast of the pink and green give it some pop. 7', '2005-09-11 12:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695106, 227417, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very sweet.  Doves have such a beautiful presence. I like the DOF.  Maybe crop out part of the blurry big branch to the left. The colors are nicely done. I''d zoom in on the bird a bit more. 7</td>', 'Very sweet.  Doves have such a beautiful presence. I like the DOF.  Maybe crop out part of the blurry big branch to the left. The colors are nicely done. I''d zoom in on the bird a bit more. 7', '2005-09-11 12:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695109, 225813, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a lonesome sense to it.  It might be fun to play with black and white and see if the the branches really POP out of the water more. I''d straighten the horizon too, as it looks tilted and down to the right a bit. This definitely has potential. ;~D</td>', 'This has a lonesome sense to it.  It might be fun to play with black and white and see if the the branches really POP out of the water more. I''d straighten the horizon too, as it looks tilted and down to the right a bit. This definitely has potential. ;~D', '2005-09-11 12:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695112, 227939, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I''d zoom in on just a few of them to showcase their beautiful colors and detail. I like the idea of this. Maybe work on the focus a tad as well.</td>', 'I think I''d zoom in on just a few of them to showcase their beautiful colors and detail. I like the idea of this. Maybe work on the focus a tad as well.', '2005-09-11 12:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695114, 228006, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the dappled light on the trunk.  The sky is lovely. I''d work on the curves a bit, maybe darken up the trunks even more to an almost silhouette.</td>', 'I like the dappled light on the trunk.  The sky is lovely. I''d work on the curves a bit, maybe darken up the trunks even more to an almost silhouette.', '2005-09-11 12:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695118, 225842, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has great potential.  I think I''d work on curves and contrast so that it really POPs out at you. I love the rays through the trees. 7</td>', 'This has great potential.  I think I''d work on curves and contrast so that it really POPs out at you. I love the rays through the trees. 7', '2005-09-11 12:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695119, 226549, 28710, '<td valign="top">Sorry. <br/> <br/>1. silhouettes are dark on a light or coloured background.<br/> <br/>2. the challenge is branch, not tree.</td>', 'Sorry.  1. silhouettes are dark on a light or coloured background. 2. the challenge is branch, not tree.', '2005-09-11 12:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695120, 225852, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty - nice use of negative space. This has a lonesome feel to it and I appreciate the originality of the shot.</td>', 'Pretty - nice use of negative space. This has a lonesome feel to it and I appreciate the originality of the shot.', '2005-09-11 12:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695121, 227183, 15711, '<td valign="top">Are these mangroves? I love their spindly "fingers" against the cirrus clouds. Interesting perspective. I like this. 8</td>', 'Are these mangroves? I love their spindly "fingers" against the cirrus clouds. Interesting perspective. I like this. 8', '2005-09-11 12:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695124, 228278, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has good DOF. I think if the lighting were better, this would really have some impact. I like the comparison of the old and new, but it lacks emphasis as the lighting is maybe too low.</td>', 'This has good DOF. I think if the lighting were better, this would really have some impact. I like the comparison of the old and new, but it lacks emphasis as the lighting is maybe too low.', '2005-09-11 12:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695125, 227492, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and the apple green against the blue sky.  Nice!</td>', 'I like the perspective and the apple green against the blue sky.  Nice!', '2005-09-11 12:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695126, 226071, 40484, '<td valign="top">size of the photo makes it difficult to see the reflected branch but cool idea.</td>', 'size of the photo makes it difficult to see the reflected branch but cool idea.', '2005-09-11 12:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695127, 227616, 15711, '<td valign="top">The blue of her dress adds some nice POP to the otherwise natural greens and browns. The lighting is pretty. I might crop out part of the area to the right and it would still have the same impact.  Good one. 8</td>', 'The blue of her dress adds some nice POP to the otherwise natural greens and browns. The lighting is pretty. I might crop out part of the area to the right and it would still have the same impact.  Good one. 8', '2005-09-11 12:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695133, 226820, 28710, '<td valign="top">ninjae + branch ?<br/> <br/> bamboo would be more interesting and appropriate. looks good though except for the mouth peeking through</td>', 'ninjae + branch ?  bamboo would be more interesting and appropriate. looks good though except for the mouth peeking through', '2005-09-11 12:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695135, 228007, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is very clear and well focused. I like the juxtaposition of the angled posts with the movement of the duck.  Great reflective quality.</td>', 'This is very clear and well focused. I like the juxtaposition of the angled posts with the movement of the duck.  Great reflective quality.', '2005-09-11 12:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695139, 227379, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the stormy sky with the single spindly fingers of the tree.  I''d crop more to the right so that the tree is almost popping out of the corner.  Very lonesome sense to the shot. 8</td>', 'I like the stormy sky with the single spindly fingers of the tree.  I''d crop more to the right so that the tree is almost popping out of the corner.  Very lonesome sense to the shot. 8', '2005-09-11 12:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695142, 227661, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset.  It seems a tad blurred, but it''s hard to tell with dim light. I like the evergreen trees.</td>', 'Nice sunset.  It seems a tad blurred, but it''s hard to tell with dim light. I like the evergreen trees.', '2005-09-11 12:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695149, 227280, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful sky. I''d like the satellite dish to be more to one side with extra sky as negative space. It seems to be rising up like a phoenix out of the trees. LOL  Thanks for a change of pace.</td>', 'What a beautiful sky. I''d like the satellite dish to be more to one side with extra sky as negative space. It seems to be rising up like a phoenix out of the trees. LOL  Thanks for a change of pace.', '2005-09-11 12:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695155, 228153, 28710, '<td valign="top">This is a tree, not a branch. I am not taking much from it. The pic is a tad overexposed (the branches disappear in the light). It might have worked a bit better if you had underexposed a little and brought it up later. Even better would have been closer where you would have been able to focus on the branch aspect.</td>', 'This is a tree, not a branch. I am not taking much from it. The pic is a tad overexposed (the branches disappear in the light). It might have worked a bit better if you had underexposed a little and brought it up later. Even better would have been closer where you would have been able to focus on the branch aspect.', '2005-09-11 12:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695156, 226002, 15711, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of an old instamatic snapshot from the 60''s.  I like the old feeling of it. I''d up the contrast and focus more on the man to give it some punch.</td>', 'This reminds me of an old instamatic snapshot from the 60''s.  I like the old feeling of it. I''d up the contrast and focus more on the man to give it some punch.', '2005-09-11 12:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695161, 226780, 28710, '<td valign="top">be careful of your sensor! Yipes!</td>', 'be careful of your sensor! Yipes!', '2005-09-11 12:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695162, 227271, 15711, '<td valign="top">This made me smile.  I love goats.  Not the greatest shot in the world, but I''ll up the score cause I love animals. LOL</td>', 'This made me smile.  I love goats.  Not the greatest shot in the world, but I''ll up the score cause I love animals. LOL', '2005-09-11 12:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695169, 227425, 42628, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!8</td>', 'Brilliant!8', '2005-09-11 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695173, 227859, 44030, '<td valign="top">I like this photo with the mix of color and B&amp;W.  (If this was the intent then great, otherwise:) To me the placement of the arm is a bit off.  It''s angle looks a bit off so in a way, it doesn''t look alive.  I''d crop the top edge just a bit so I can''t see the shadow of the bend of the outside of the elbow starting. And then straighten the wrist with the arm so the hand is going off to the right instead of directly looking at the camera.  (I''d actually like to see that pose next to this one to see if that really had the same impact as this one)  Otherwise, the DoF with the Ivy draws the eye to the slightly out of focus hand very nicely.  I''m drawn to following tha line from the bottom front of the photo curving around to the top back.</td>', 'I like this photo with the mix of color and B&W.  (If this was the intent then great, otherwise:) To me the placement of the arm is a bit off.  It''s angle looks a bit off so in a way, it doesn''t look alive.  I''d crop the top edge just a bit so I can''t see the shadow of the bend of the outside of the elbow starting. And then straighten the wrist with the arm so the hand is going off to the right instead of directly looking at the camera.  (I''d actually like to see that pose next to this one to see if that really had the same impact as this one)  Otherwise, the DoF with the Ivy draws the eye to the slightly out of focus hand very nicely.  I''m drawn to following tha line from the bottom front of the photo curving around to the top back.', '2005-09-11 13:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695222, 227429, 42837, '<td valign="top">Good idea and good use of the bird to draw the viewers eyes. The focus seems off though, and maybe backing off a bit and letting the bird become slightly less dominant would suit this particul;ar challenge better</td>', 'Good idea and good use of the bird to draw the viewers eyes. The focus seems off though, and maybe backing off a bit and letting the bird become slightly less dominant would suit this particul;ar challenge better', '2005-09-11 13:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695227, 226501, 42837, '<td valign="top">Although the buildings are clearly commercial in some way or another, without the title there''s no indication in the photo to define them specifically as banks. It seems more like a shot of the lamppost I''m afraid.</td>', 'Although the buildings are clearly commercial in some way or another, without the title there''s no indication in the photo to define them specifically as banks. It seems more like a shot of the lamppost I''m afraid.', '2005-09-11 13:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695236, 227964, 42837, '<td valign="top">The patchy background should be darker and plain to help the fine threads stand out. And such an open aperture has made the DOF too narrow, making the branch kind of incidental to the shot.</td>', 'The patchy background should be darker and plain to help the fine threads stand out. And such an open aperture has made the DOF too narrow, making the branch kind of incidental to the shot.', '2005-09-11 13:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695241, 225842, 42628, '<td valign="top">What a nice picture-nature really is beautiful!9</td>', 'What a nice picture-nature really is beautiful!9', '2005-09-11 13:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695242, 227460, 42837, '<td valign="top">Over tight crop at the end of the leaves. Otherwise, effective DOFand pleasing subject matter</td>', 'Over tight crop at the end of the leaves. Otherwise, effective DOFand pleasing subject matter', '2005-09-11 13:45:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1695251, 228203, 42837, '<td valign="top">Good contrast picking out the antlers on the dark background The focus on the eyes could be sharper, since that''s where human instinct is naturally drawn to initially. And the stooped pose could be improved. It''s not grazing, and it''s not up and alert. Seems a touch awkward.</td>', 'Good contrast picking out the antlers on the dark background The focus on the eyes could be sharper, since that''s where human instinct is naturally drawn to initially. And the stooped pose could be improved. It''s not grazing, and it''s not up and alert. Seems a touch awkward.', '2005-09-11 13:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695255, 227217, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting DOF. I find the big log/branch on the left a tad distracting.  I might eliminate some of the dark green foliage in the background too. Maybe do a different crop and concentrate more on the spikey one.</td>', 'Interesting DOF. I find the big log/branch on the left a tad distracting.  I might eliminate some of the dark green foliage in the background too. Maybe do a different crop and concentrate more on the spikey one.', '2005-09-11 13:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695261, 228323, 2000, '<td valign="top">The maximum size for a photograph is 640px on one side; this is 235px on it''s long side - comparatively tiny.  This is probably a very good shot - however, as it is so small, it''s nearly impossible to see any detail.</td>', 'The maximum size for a photograph is 640px on one side; this is 235px on it''s long side - comparatively tiny.  This is probably a very good shot - however, as it is so small, it''s nearly impossible to see any detail.', '2005-09-11 13:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695266, 228230, 2000, '<td valign="top">The sun spot in the center of the tree got you an extra point here... it gives a focal point, and is not overdone.</td>', 'The sun spot in the center of the tree got you an extra point here... it gives a focal point, and is not overdone.', '2005-09-11 13:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
