(1699410, 227663, 37103, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing pose for the bird (vulture?).  I love that the head is down and the face is hidden.  I wish there was a little more detail in the head and feathers.  The image looks a little underexposed.  Something about the colors seems a little off, maybe a little yellow or green?  I can''t quite tell, but overall the shot is wonderful. 10.</td>', 'This is an amazing pose for the bird (vulture?).  I love that the head is down and the face is hidden.  I wish there was a little more detail in the head and feathers.  The image looks a little underexposed.  Something about the colors seems a little off, maybe a little yellow or green?  I can''t quite tell, but overall the shot is wonderful. 10.', '2005-09-12 14:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
