(1701008, 226540, 15242, '<td valign="top">Some pointers...  If the kids are the subject of the photo, you may want to have them look at you, but you must be able to see both faces.  Here it seems like they are posing for someone else and you jumoed in and took a shot.<br/>Photos of people need to have something to make them interesting.  If you don''t know these kids there is nothing interesting here.  An expession, a smile, lighting, an action, something more then just posing in a tree.<br/>Technically wise, the photo lacks crispness and is possibly overexposed.</td>', 'Some pointers...  If the kids are the subject of the photo, you may want to have them look at you, but you must be able to see both faces.  Here it seems like they are posing for someone else and you jumoed in and took a shot.Photos of people need to have something to make them interesting.  If you don''t know these kids there is nothing interesting here.  An expession, a smile, lighting, an action, something more then just posing in a tree.Technically wise, the photo lacks crispness and is possibly overexposed.', '2005-09-12 21:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
