(1702713, 226769, 16241, '<td valign="top">good!</td>', 'good!', '2005-09-13 06:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702725, 226686, 37005, '<td valign="top">The sky is amazing in this shot but the branches seem a bit over contrasty to me.</td>', 'The sky is amazing in this shot but the branches seem a bit over contrasty to me.', '2005-09-13 06:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702727, 227645, 37005, '<td valign="top">Great change of pace!</td>', 'Great change of pace!', '2005-09-13 06:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702731, 226651, 37005, '<td valign="top">I really like this image composition, my two buts are: I''d like a bit more B&amp;W contrast (just a teeny smidge towards black and pulling a bit more shadows out), the image seems a wee flat at this B&amp;W level and the crop is a wee bit tight at top--I''d like to see the end part at that top branch.  Otherwise a very nicely branch photo.</td>', 'I really like this image composition, my two buts are: I''d like a bit more B&W contrast (just a teeny smidge towards black and pulling a bit more shadows out), the image seems a wee flat at this B&W level and the crop is a wee bit tight at top--I''d like to see the end part at that top branch.  Otherwise a very nicely branch photo.', '2005-09-13 06:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702733, 228216, 37005, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling of movement by the red line.</td>', 'Nice feeling of movement by the red line.', '2005-09-13 06:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702737, 226212, 37005, '<td valign="top">I love how the branch feels like it''s floating with the coloration of the background water...it''s almost "invisible" feeling color wise.  The branch sits there gracefully and poised.  Beautifully executed.</td>', 'I love how the branch feels like it''s floating with the coloration of the background water...it''s almost "invisible" feeling color wise.  The branch sits there gracefully and poised.  Beautifully executed.', '2005-09-13 06:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702741, 225651, 37005, '<td valign="top">Wow.  The light hits it just "so" and it looks almost fake.  Very cool.</td>', 'Wow.  The light hits it just "so" and it looks almost fake.  Very cool.', '2005-09-13 06:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702755, 228261, 2563, '<td valign="top">this is a great picture, surprising and powerful, so that I don''t care there is no branch in it 9</td>', 'this is a great picture, surprising and powerful, so that I don''t care there is no branch in it 9', '2005-09-13 06:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702820, 227908, 6132, '<td valign="top">I really do like this one.  The twisted darkness of the branches reaching out for the light really does it for me :) I''m sure you''ll get "blown out" comments, but for this image I personally think it really works well. 7</td>', 'I really do like this one.  The twisted darkness of the branches reaching out for the light really does it for me :) I''m sure you''ll get "blown out" comments, but for this image I personally think it really works well. 7', '2005-09-13 07:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702821, 226820, 6132, '<td valign="top">&lt;Dubbed kung-fu film voice&gt; Don''t concentrate on the finger, or you''ll miss all that heavenly glory &lt;/Dubbed Kung-fu voice&gt;<br/> <br/>Definatley  an original entry for this challenge. I perhaps would have liked to have seen the ninja more concealed through a slightly more busy set of branches. After all, invisibility is the code of the ninja. Lighting seems spot on, and the skin tones have been well captured. The contrast between ninja and background works quite well, but I myself would have opted for more of a darker gritty background. An image that intrigued me anyway. 7</td>', '<Dubbed kung-fu film voice> Don''t concentrate on the finger, or you''ll miss all that heavenly glory </Dubbed Kung-fu voice> Definatley  an original entry for this challenge. I perhaps would have liked to have seen the ninja more concealed through a slightly more busy set of branches. After all, invisibility is the code of the ninja. Lighting seems spot on, and the skin tones have been well captured. The contrast between ninja and background works quite well, but I myself would have opted for more of a darker gritty background. An image that intrigued me anyway. 7', '2005-09-13 07:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702824, 227399, 6132, '<td valign="top">Very nice. 7</td>', 'Very nice. 7', '2005-09-13 07:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702841, 227126, 6132, '<td valign="top">What do you want the viewer to focus on within this image? To me it feels extremely busy and lacks creativity. Perhaps to improve the image you could have spent just a little longer in finding an interesting angle or perspective to capture. 4</td>', 'What do you want the viewer to focus on within this image? To me it feels extremely busy and lacks creativity. Perhaps to improve the image you could have spent just a little longer in finding an interesting angle or perspective to capture. 4', '2005-09-13 07:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702845, 225209, 6132, '<td valign="top">Nice bold colours that you have captured. I would have liked to have been able to focus on something that would make the image stand out more though. It appears to be too busy for my liking.</td>', 'Nice bold colours that you have captured. I would have liked to have been able to focus on something that would make the image stand out more though. It appears to be too busy for my liking.', '2005-09-13 07:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702847, 225221, 6132, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.', '2005-09-13 07:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702854, 225651, 6132, '<td valign="top">Now this is an unusal capture. It''s a shame that the fence in the background slightly ruins this image.  I think it would have looked superb in black and white with a black background, or maybe even a closer/macro shot of a single web clinging to a branch to place the background out of focus. 6</td>', 'Now this is an unusal capture. It''s a shame that the fence in the background slightly ruins this image.  I think it would have looked superb in black and white with a black background, or maybe even a closer/macro shot of a single web clinging to a branch to place the background out of focus. 6', '2005-09-13 07:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702858, 226501, 6132, '<td valign="top">Another image in this challenge that I really like. It instantly reminded me of the New York images that Walker Evans took. Love the tones and composition. 7</td>', 'Another image in this challenge that I really like. It instantly reminded me of the New York images that Walker Evans took. Love the tones and composition. 7', '2005-09-13 07:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
