(1703323, 227496, 40245, '<td valign="top">You need to submit a larger photo so we can see the details. Impossible to judge photo at this size. If when you resize your photo to 640 the file size is larger than 150K which is challenge limit then adjust the jpeg quality down until you hit 150. You can do this in the save for web dialog in photoshop and I am sure other photo editors can do the same.</td>', 'You need to submit a larger photo so we can see the details. Impossible to judge photo at this size. If when you resize your photo to 640 the file size is larger than 150K which is challenge limit then adjust the jpeg quality down until you hit 150. You can do this in the save for web dialog in photoshop and I am sure other photo editors can do the same.', '2005-09-13 11:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
