(1704070, 228132, 19780, '<td valign="top">I love the concept of this one. The image in the distance (to the left of the pinky) is distracting (a continuous black background would have been helpful). The palm is a little overexposed so I''m missing the texture of the palm lines. I like the depth of field and the position &amp; shadows on the fingers.</td>', 'I love the concept of this one. The image in the distance (to the left of the pinky) is distracting (a continuous black background would have been helpful). The palm is a little overexposed so I''m missing the texture of the palm lines. I like the depth of field and the position & shadows on the fingers.', '2005-09-13 14:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704071, 228230, 43047, '<td valign="top">very good composition; i love the sun blinking through the tree! I would have cropped more to get rid of the buildings</td>', 'very good composition; i love the sun blinking through the tree! I would have cropped more to get rid of the buildings', '2005-09-13 14:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704073, 228008, 43047, '<td valign="top">very funny - i like yout title! could be sharper</td>', 'very funny - i like yout title! could be sharper', '2005-09-13 14:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704074, 227091, 19780, '<td valign="top">I love the grittyness of this photo, the stark overexposure at the end of the tunnel and the supersaturated colors.</td>', 'I love the grittyness of this photo, the stark overexposure at the end of the tunnel and the supersaturated colors.', '2005-09-13 14:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704163, 228219, 40132, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the background, it looks like the painter is also inside, anyway I prefer some crops at right and bottom, you did a nice job...7</td>', 'I like the idea and the background, it looks like the painter is also inside, anyway I prefer some crops at right and bottom, you did a nice job...7', '2005-09-13 15:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704172, 228024, 42837, '<td valign="top">I love the motion from the cars long exposure, and the composition looks good on the eyes. The focus could be sharper on the plant/weed at the edge however since it''s slight fuzziness gives the impression it''s intentionally being ''looked past'', if you get me, so as to draw more attention to the car.</td>', 'I love the motion from the cars long exposure, and the composition looks good on the eyes. The focus could be sharper on the plant/weed at the edge however since it''s slight fuzziness gives the impression it''s intentionally being ''looked past'', if you get me, so as to draw more attention to the car.', '2005-09-13 15:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704200, 227387, 42837, '<td valign="top">Great action shot, strong effective lines. You could go even further with the crop and lose the roof of the amusement ride. The wires and children in the chairs is enough information for the viewer. Less is more, yeah? I would also have gone for a portrait shot and shifted the negative space around slightly from the right so it''s below their feet and adds to their elevation over our heads.</td>', 'Great action shot, strong effective lines. You could go even further with the crop and lose the roof of the amusement ride. The wires and children in the chairs is enough information for the viewer. Less is more, yeah? I would also have gone for a portrait shot and shifted the negative space around slightly from the right so it''s below their feet and adds to their elevation over our heads.', '2005-09-13 15:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704206, 227925, 42837, '<td valign="top">Great contrast composition and motion in this shot.</td>', 'Great contrast composition and motion in this shot.', '2005-09-13 15:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704210, 227975, 24913, '<td valign="top">Beautiful DOF, and very sharp focus</td>', 'Beautiful DOF, and very sharp focus', '2005-09-13 15:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704272, 227012, 42837, '<td valign="top">Hehe, cute. He/she was well picked out with the timely splash of sunlight in the dappled light. I like this shot a lot. The texture and composition and especially the idea are very good.</td>', 'Hehe, cute. He/she was well picked out with the timely splash of sunlight in the dappled light. I like this shot a lot. The texture and composition and especially the idea are very good.', '2005-09-13 15:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704282, 227653, 42837, '<td valign="top">It''s a great shot of a nighttime cityscape, and I love the movement in the traffic.</td>', 'It''s a great shot of a nighttime cityscape, and I love the movement in the traffic.', '2005-09-13 15:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704349, 228255, 42837, '<td valign="top">Is this the musician Rameau? I don''t see the connection i''m afraid since I don''t know his work. Accordingly I will have to mark low. The blur and lack of focus or obvious subject matter will bring it even lower. sorry!</td>', 'Is this the musician Rameau? I don''t see the connection i''m afraid since I don''t know his work. Accordingly I will have to mark low. The blur and lack of focus or obvious subject matter will bring it even lower. sorry!', '2005-09-13 16:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704379, 227931, 42837, '<td valign="top">You''ve just pushed the analogy too far. You should have definitely left the green hue out altogether, since the similarity of the tree like structure is plainly obvious anyway. Nicely spotted though, has potential.</td>', 'You''ve just pushed the analogy too far. You should have definitely left the green hue out altogether, since the similarity of the tree like structure is plainly obvious anyway. Nicely spotted though, has potential.', '2005-09-13 16:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
