(1706365, 227594, 24981, '<td valign="top">thanks to all who voted and those who took the time to leave comments. :)<br/> <br/>Some don''t see my vision on how this relates to branches, so I''ll try to clarify. There''s two distict branches here, one being nature and the other being industry and how they are colliding in this shot.<br/> <br/>One more thing.. I''m honored that someone has added this pic to their favorites!!! That''s a first for me! Woohoo!!<br/> <br/>George</td>', 'thanks to all who voted and those who took the time to leave comments. :) Some don''t see my vision on how this relates to branches, so I''ll try to clarify. There''s two distict branches here, one being nature and the other being industry and how they are colliding in this shot. One more thing.. I''m honored that someone has added this pic to their favorites!!! That''s a first for me! Woohoo!! George', '2005-09-14 01:13:07.000000', NULL, 0),
