(1706411, 225635, 36628, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Rules:</b></div><hr/><i>Photographs may not, however, show male or female genitalia <b>or any acts of sex.</b></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>...DQ DQ!! Lol, great shot and congrats on your top 10! <img alt="'' . substr(''//users.pandora.be/eforum/emoticons4u/happy/046.gif'', strrpos(''//users.pandora.be/eforum/emoticons4u/happy/046.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//users.pandora.be/eforum/emoticons4u/happy/046.gif"/></td>', 'Originally posted by Rules:Photographs may not, however, show male or female genitalia or any acts of sex.  ...DQ DQ!! Lol, great shot and congrats on your top 10! ', '2005-09-14 01:21:17.000000', NULL, 0),
