(1706629, 228330, 13688, '<td valign="top">Here is the original for those interested...not sure what post processing some where asking about ;)  I know, I know, not exactly usual for me to get it right before photoshop...i need to take more shots in darkness:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=231389" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/13688/thumb/231389.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/13688/thumb/231389.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/13688/thumb/231389.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-14 01:10:34.</i></td>', 'Here is the original for those interested...not sure what post processing some where asking about ;)  I know, I know, not exactly usual for me to get it right before photoshop...i need to take more shots in darkness: ', '2005-09-14 02:00:50.000000', '2005-09-14 02:10:34.000000', 0),
