(1706724, 227951, 39243, '<td valign="top">I love the people who gice a shot like this a 1. It just goes to show that when I view my scores I can throw out most of the 1''s, 2''s and 9''s and 10''s. This is an excellent shot one of my favorite of the challenge. Good job.</td>', 'I love the people who gice a shot like this a 1. It just goes to show that when I view my scores I can throw out most of the 1''s, 2''s and 9''s and 10''s. This is an excellent shot one of my favorite of the challenge. Good job.', '2005-09-14 02:17:01.000000', NULL, 0),
