(1707330, 227931, 30173, '<td valign="top">Cool Tony ! Immerhin viel besser als dein erstes. Der Titel ist gut und das bearbeiten hat auch geklappt. Ist leider etwas zu klein ausgefallen, aber trotzdem ein gutes Foto. Weiter so !</td>', 'Cool Tony ! Immerhin viel besser als dein erstes. Der Titel ist gut und das bearbeiten hat auch geklappt. Ist leider etwas zu klein ausgefallen, aber trotzdem ein gutes Foto. Weiter so !', '2005-09-14 06:10:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1707419, 225532, 7810, '<td valign="top">Congrats on this stunning entry!</td>', 'Congrats on this stunning entry!', '2005-09-14 06:59:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1707487, 226212, 41398, '<td valign="top">You nailed it congratulations!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-14 08:35:03.</i></td>', 'You nailed it congratulations!', '2005-09-14 07:43:59.000000', '2005-09-14 09:35:03.000000', 0),
(1707496, 227871, 14509, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ttreit:</b></div><hr/><i> Thats a pretty big stretch....late entry maybe? The picture itself seems rather noisy as well, is that intentional? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You could be right about a late entry. I hadn''t really taken anything purposely for the challenge. This was a photo I already had that fit into the time bracket. As for the grain, it was intentional. The original shot was of poor quality due to low light, so I added some extra grain to sort of hide the mistakes. I know it''s not a great quality shot, but the pose is very cute. Thank you for your vote and for leaving a comment. I will try better for the next challenge.<br/>Diana</td>', 'Originally posted by ttreit: Thats a pretty big stretch....late entry maybe? The picture itself seems rather noisy as well, is that intentional?   You could be right about a late entry. I hadn''t really taken anything purposely for the challenge. This was a photo I already had that fit into the time bracket. As for the grain, it was intentional. The original shot was of poor quality due to low light, so I added some extra grain to sort of hide the mistakes. I know it''s not a great quality shot, but the pose is very cute. Thank you for your vote and for leaving a comment. I will try better for the next challenge.Diana', '2005-09-14 07:53:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1707570, 225532, 4482, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'Beautiful image. Congrats on your ribbon!', '2005-09-14 08:36:24.000000', NULL, 0),
