(1708479, 228066, 28710, '<td valign="top">Dude, sorry you were robbed. I thought this one would top ten for sure. Don''t know why so many people voted it down honestly. Some people mentioned that they couldn''t see the branch connection.<br/> <br/>The fact that there is a boat made of wood in several different styles is one clue, but I would have figured most people would have caught the branch in the guy''s hand.<br/> <br/>Helluva nice pic and I''ll restate that.</td>', 'Dude, sorry you were robbed. I thought this one would top ten for sure. Don''t know why so many people voted it down honestly. Some people mentioned that they couldn''t see the branch connection. The fact that there is a boat made of wood in several different styles is one clue, but I would have figured most people would have caught the branch in the guy''s hand. Helluva nice pic and I''ll restate that.', '2005-09-14 13:28:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1708542, 228271, 28710, '<td valign="top">Another picture that I felt was excellent and should have been in the top 10, but got bad votes because people just couldn''t see what was in front of them. <br/> <br/>I am sad that people felt that the first thing they saw was the kid so they couldn''t make the connection. Apparently a number of people can''t read titles.<br/> <br/>Sorry this didn''t get higher. It''s a super pic.</td>', 'Another picture that I felt was excellent and should have been in the top 10, but got bad votes because people just couldn''t see what was in front of them.  I am sad that people felt that the first thing they saw was the kid so they couldn''t make the connection. Apparently a number of people can''t read titles. Sorry this didn''t get higher. It''s a super pic.', '2005-09-14 13:41:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1708580, 228256, 28710, '<td valign="top">I saw this pic on the page just as I had to go to work and stop voting. I wish I had taken the time to give it just one more 9 or 10. <br/> <br/>This picture is REALLY gorgeous. <br/> <br/>I totally disagree with all the people who can''t read titles or think for more than a few seconds to get the connection with branch. The main subject of the picture is definitely related to a branch. The title brings it together.<br/> <br/>I definitely think there could be just a hair more contrast and I think there is a bit of noise or something on the right. Maybe it''s just my LCD screen, but the pic looks better as I drop the brightnest and increase the contrast.<br/> <br/>I think it is noteworthy that you got more tens than you got nines and you only got 10 less 10''s than the winning photo.<br/> <br/>Please keep works like this coming.</td>', 'I saw this pic on the page just as I had to go to work and stop voting. I wish I had taken the time to give it just one more 9 or 10.  This picture is REALLY gorgeous.  I totally disagree with all the people who can''t read titles or think for more than a few seconds to get the connection with branch. The main subject of the picture is definitely related to a branch. The title brings it together. I definitely think there could be just a hair more contrast and I think there is a bit of noise or something on the right. Maybe it''s just my LCD screen, but the pic looks better as I drop the brightnest and increase the contrast. I think it is noteworthy that you got more tens than you got nines and you only got 10 less 10''s than the winning photo. Please keep works like this coming.', '2005-09-14 13:53:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1708631, 227661, 714, '<td valign="top">hmm..not sure I agree with the comments about it has to be just a branch.  Take a look at 1st and third! Beautiful shot, Angela!</td>', 'hmm..not sure I agree with the comments about it has to be just a branch.  Take a look at 1st and third! Beautiful shot, Angela!', '2005-09-14 14:08:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1708654, 225651, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! That is awesome!  have you got a shot of the webs up close.  I would have so much fun with those. LOL  Great shot!</td>', 'Wow!!! That is awesome!  have you got a shot of the webs up close.  I would have so much fun with those. LOL  Great shot!', '2005-09-14 14:14:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1708664, 227649, 27460, '<td valign="top">1. no<br/>2. somewhat from the title<br/>3. neither<br/>4. I would crop 30% from the left side<br/>5.<br/>overall, i think this is a good technical shot, but definitely would appreciate more DOF. It seems that the focus is a little tight, and pushes alot of the "branches" out of focus. but when dealing with such a tight macro, I can appreciate the difficulty. lighting is good, there is some slight burning on one of the limbs (middle right)<br/>I think in this case, all of the negative space is actually detracting a bit from the shot. I''m not sure if a white background would have helped, but I think the black pulls some of the punch out of the greens.<br/></td>', '1. no2. somewhat from the title3. neither4. I would crop 30% from the left side5.overall, i think this is a good technical shot, but definitely would appreciate more DOF. It seems that the focus is a little tight, and pushes alot of the "branches" out of focus. but when dealing with such a tight macro, I can appreciate the difficulty. lighting is good, there is some slight burning on one of the limbs (middle right)I think in this case, all of the negative space is actually detracting a bit from the shot. I''m not sure if a white background would have helped, but I think the black pulls some of the punch out of the greens.', '2005-09-14 14:17:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1708680, 225221, 8377, '<td valign="top">YAY! I loved this photo, congrats on this beautiful shot!</td>', 'YAY! I loved this photo, congrats on this beautiful shot!', '2005-09-14 14:22:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1708896, 227649, 15242, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF, the composition, the lighting and how it works with the background.  Technically I think it''s a great shot.  However, the subject on it''s own has no wow factor.  Put a bug in there or water drops or something to give it more interest maybe?</td>', 'I like the DOF, the composition, the lighting and how it works with the background.  Technically I think it''s a great shot.  However, the subject on it''s own has no wow factor.  Put a bug in there or water drops or something to give it more interest maybe?', '2005-09-14 15:23:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1708973, 227856, 43156, '<td valign="top">That was my first challenge. I''m very new in digital photography and editing. When I realized what Id done with a border it was too late to change it. I know it''s bad, but comments like "Border Madness" don''t help me much ether. I''m still happy with a result and attention from you guys. I appreciate any useful comments, its very encouraging. Thank you all.</td>', 'That was my first challenge. I''m very new in digital photography and editing. When I realized what Id done with a border it was too late to change it. I know it''s bad, but comments like "Border Madness" don''t help me much ether. I''m still happy with a result and attention from you guys. I appreciate any useful comments, its very encouraging. Thank you all.', '2005-09-14 15:56:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1709062, 227904, 41701, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I completely agree, it''s not very interesting.  It was more a question of trying to be on the other end of voting for once.  I think I learnt a bit from that.  Oh yeah, sorry for the lame title..!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-14 18:25:16.</i></td>', 'Yeah, I completely agree, it''s not very interesting.  It was more a question of trying to be on the other end of voting for once.  I think I learnt a bit from that.  Oh yeah, sorry for the lame title..!', '2005-09-14 19:24:35.000000', '2005-09-14 19:25:16.000000', 0),
(1709113, 228043, 34956, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and votes. Takk Xilebo :-)</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and votes. Takk Xilebo :-)', '2005-09-14 19:45:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1709329, 227908, 8860, '<td valign="top">I too am staggered at this phot''s lowly rating. The movement and flow in this is tangible - so impactful and I bet, as a large format print, this is just breathtaking. I often look up to the canopy and think I see this kind of thing, but rarely capture it. You have.</td>', 'I too am staggered at this phot''s lowly rating. The movement and flow in this is tangible - so impactful and I bet, as a large format print, this is just breathtaking. I often look up to the canopy and think I see this kind of thing, but rarely capture it. You have.', '2005-09-14 20:51:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1709795, 228196, 36141, '<td valign="top">You may have gotten low points, but reading the comments I think most of them didn''t get your point at all.<br/>They all shout ''no focus'' but if they had taken the time to look, they would''ve seen that tiny spot of sunlight in the middle, that''s where my eye is drawn to. <br/>And even the humor of your title they didn''t get, did they.<br/>It could have been just a bit sharper, but I think that little unsharpness might be due to resizing. If so, you should sharpen a little bit after resizing.But it doesn''t bother me at all.<br/> <br/>I think it''s a great photo and more than others I''ve seen in the higher regions, this is exactly what the topic is about: branches.<br/> <br/>I don''t submit and vote anymore in the challenges, but I would''ve given you an 8.<br/> <br/>Titia</td>', 'You may have gotten low points, but reading the comments I think most of them didn''t get your point at all.They all shout ''no focus'' but if they had taken the time to look, they would''ve seen that tiny spot of sunlight in the middle, that''s where my eye is drawn to. And even the humor of your title they didn''t get, did they.It could have been just a bit sharper, but I think that little unsharpness might be due to resizing. If so, you should sharpen a little bit after resizing.But it doesn''t bother me at all. I think it''s a great photo and more than others I''ve seen in the higher regions, this is exactly what the topic is about: branches. I don''t submit and vote anymore in the challenges, but I would''ve given you an 8. Titia', '2005-09-14 21:58:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1709856, 228330, 42392, '<td valign="top">i think this deserved the blue ribbon- great picutre!!</td>', 'i think this deserved the blue ribbon- great picutre!!', '2005-09-14 22:12:38.000000', NULL, 0),
