(1710274, 227001, 25397, '<td valign="top">So lee-baby this is a good picture, I''m still trying to figure out how you got it. Maybe from a tall building window or sometihng, or something along the lines of flying. It met the challenge well and looks very dodged-and-burned with the big unsharp mask and contrast, very nice idea to compensate for a basic editing challenge.</td>', 'So lee-baby this is a good picture, I''m still trying to figure out how you got it. Maybe from a tall building window or sometihng, or something along the lines of flying. It met the challenge well and looks very dodged-and-burned with the big unsharp mask and contrast, very nice idea to compensate for a basic editing challenge.', '2005-09-15 00:20:41.000000', NULL, 0),
