(1712487, 227644, 39429, '<td valign="top">This photo was my highest rated on those I voted on.  I loved the novel branch idea.  The tones are wonderful.  The lighting works very well without the wayward reflections that often plague.  It has a very strong graphic feel. I''m impressed.</td>', 'This photo was my highest rated on those I voted on.  I loved the novel branch idea.  The tones are wonderful.  The lighting works very well without the wayward reflections that often plague.  It has a very strong graphic feel. I''m impressed.', '2005-09-15 20:06:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1712705, 225302, 19035, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Shadowfax:</b></div><hr/><i> I think you should have been in the top 3. This surely deserves a ribbon. Wonderful picture. </i></td></tr></table><i></i> <br/>Thank you so much!, Im still trying to figure out why twelve people gave it a three and under..oh well.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-15 20:21:44.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Shadowfax: I think you should have been in the top 3. This surely deserves a ribbon. Wonderful picture.  Thank you so much!, Im still trying to figure out why twelve people gave it a three and under..oh well.', '2005-09-15 21:20:09.000000', '2005-09-15 21:21:44.000000', 0),
