(1715106, 228132, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think it''s an interesting idea for the challenge, but I don''t think the execution of it is very interesting.  The angle, the lighting and having whatever that is in the upper right background, all give it more the feel of just a  quick snapshot vs. a thought out photo.  <br/> <br/>I would have prefered a higher angle looking down on the hand, setting the white balance so that the skin had a more natural tone (or switch to black and white), and be more careful of the background.  <br/> <br/>I like that it''s a creative and unique take on the challenge topic.</td>', 'I think it''s an interesting idea for the challenge, but I don''t think the execution of it is very interesting.  The angle, the lighting and having whatever that is in the upper right background, all give it more the feel of just a  quick snapshot vs. a thought out photo.   I would have prefered a higher angle looking down on the hand, setting the white balance so that the skin had a more natural tone (or switch to black and white), and be more careful of the background.   I like that it''s a creative and unique take on the challenge topic.', '2005-09-16 20:30:22.000000', NULL, 0),
