(1777065, 227306, 35507, '<td valign="top">Having been chased by my Grandmother with a switch - a small branch from a bush or tree - I do know where you were going with this and why you titled it sw!tch.  And the green ones hurt the most, being flexible and whip like.  As a matter of fact she chased me near the train tracks, often.  How did you know? ; )<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-11 16:28:13.</i></td>', 'Having been chased by my Grandmother with a switch - a small branch from a bush or tree - I do know where you were going with this and why you titled it sw!tch.  And the green ones hurt the most, being flexible and whip like.  As a matter of fact she chased me near the train tracks, often.  How did you know? ; )', '2005-10-11 17:27:01.000000', '2005-10-11 17:28:13.000000', 0),
