(1926463, 228016, 41548, '<td valign="top">"Shadowy Nightmare" by Jeff Sasek  (<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=43671" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jsas</a>)<br/> <br/>Shadows of the missing branches<br/>haunt the wood that once held them.<br/>The cracks show the stress<br/>of letting go the Hem.<br/> <br/>A reoccuring dream comes true<br/>whenever the sun shines fair<br/>yet in the light of day there<br/>is only a shadowy nightmare.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-06 04:44:49.</i></td>', '"Shadowy Nightmare" by Jeff Sasek  (jsas) Shadows of the missing brancheshaunt the wood that once held them.The cracks show the stressof letting go the Hem. A reoccuring dream comes truewhenever the sun shines fairyet in the light of day thereis only a shadowy nightmare.', '2005-12-06 04:43:41.000000', '2005-12-06 04:44:49.000000', 0),
